1. 先把重要资料备份到另一块盘。\n2. 以管理员身份打开命令提示符，运行：\n      bcdedit /set {current} safeboot minimal\n3. 重启，开机时进 BIOS（Dell 按 F2），在 System Configuration → SATA/NVMe Operation 里把 RAID On 改成 AHCI/NVMe，保存退出。\n4. Windows 会进安全模式，并自动装上 Windows 自带的 NVMe / AHCI 驱动。\n5. 在安全模式里再以管理员身份运行：\n      bcdedit /deletevalue {current} safeboot\n   然后重启，回到正常模式。\n\n改完开不了机：进 BIOS 把模式改回 RAID On，一切照旧，数据不受影响。之后 Intel RST 的管理软件用不了，这没关系。	1. Back up important files to another disk first.\n2. Open Command Prompt as administrator and run:\n      bcdedit /set {current} safeboot minimal\n3. Restart and enter the BIOS (F2 on Dell). Under System Configuration → SATA/NVMe Operation, change RAID On to AHCI/NVMe, then save and exit.\n4. Windows starts in Safe Mode and installs its own NVMe / AHCI driver by itself.\n5. In Safe Mode, run as administrator:\n      bcdedit /deletevalue {current} safeboot\n   then restart to return to normal mode.\n\nIf Windows will not start after the change, set the BIOS back to RAID On and everything is as before; your data is not affected. The Intel RST management app will no longer work, which does not matter.
