最可能的原因：系统盘在运行中短暂掉线（省电后唤醒失败、存储驱动或 BIOS 太旧、接触不良），或者硬盘本身在坏。硬盘报告的健康状态正常、蓝屏又都是这一类时，多半是前几种，能修好。	Most likely cause: the system disk briefly drops out while running (failing to wake from power saving, an outdated storage driver or BIOS, a loose connection), or the disk itself is failing. When the disk reports itself healthy and the crashes are all of this kind, it is usually one of the first few, which can be fixed.
