直接读取 NTFS 的文件表（MFT），比逐个文件夹查看快得多，还能看出实际占用和硬链接。少数安全软件对直接读盘会提示，可以关掉，改为逐个文件夹扫描。清理、搬家、软件管理统计大小时也按这个设置。	Read the NTFS file table (MFT) directly: much faster than opening every folder, and it also shows size on disk and hard links. A few security programs warn about direct disk reads; turn this off to scan folder by folder instead. Clean up, Moved folders and Apps follow this setting when measuring sizes.
系统还原点（卷影副本）	Restore points (shadow copies)
装更新、装驱动之前 Windows 会自动建还原点，系统出问题时可以退回去。还原点放在 C 盘的 System Volume Information 里（空间地图里带小锁的那个文件夹），只记改动过的部分，占的空间有上限，到了上限会自动删掉最旧的。觉得占得多，可以在 Windows 的「系统保护」里点「配置」，调小「最大使用量」，或者删掉这块盘的全部还原点（删了就不能再退回去）。本工具不直接删还原点。	Windows creates restore points automatically before installing updates and drivers, so you can go back if something breaks. They are kept in System Volume Information on C: (the folder with a lock in the space map), store only what changed, and have a size limit; when it is reached, the oldest are deleted automatically. If they take too much space, open Windows' "System Protection", click "Configure" and lower "Max Usage", or delete all restore points for the drive (you can't go back after that). ClearC never deletes restore points itself.
读文件时用 Windows 的后台模式，磁盘和内存都排在其他程序后面：不拖慢正在用的程序，也不把它们缓存在内存里的数据挤掉。电脑空闲时速度基本不受影响，同时在做别的事时查得慢一些。	Read files in Windows' background mode, behind other programs for both disk and memory: the programs you are using don't slow down, and the data they keep cached in memory isn't pushed out. When the PC is idle the speed is about the same; while you do other things, the search takes longer.
跟随系统会照 Windows 设置里「选择应用模式」来。换了以后本工具会关闭，再自动打开。	Follow Windows uses the "Choose your app mode" setting. ClearC closes and reopens after you change it.
页面标题下的说明	Descriptions under page titles
项目复选框	Item check boxes
'@
# 英文的帮助页（整页替换中文的那一页）
$script:helpEnXaml = @'
    <!-- ==================== Help: instructions, safety notice, feedback ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageHelp" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Visibility="Collapsed" Margin="30,24,30,14">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="*"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,16">
        <TextBlock Text="Help" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="How to use ClearC, what it never touches, and how to report problems."/>
      </StackPanel>
      <Grid Grid.Row="1">
        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="214"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <Border Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="8,0,8,10" Margin="0,0,16,0" VerticalAlignment="Top">
          <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
            <StackPanel x:Name="HelpNav">
              <TextBlock Text="Start" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNavStart" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="start" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="Getting started"><TextBlock Text="Getting started" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <TextBlock Text="Clean up" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav0" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s0" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="Clean up C:"><TextBlock Text="Clean up C:" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav1" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s1" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="Duplicates"><TextBlock Text="Duplicates" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav2" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s2" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="Save space"><TextBlock Text="Save space" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <TextBlock Text="Analyze" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav3" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s3" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="Space map"><TextBlock Text="Space map" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav4" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s4" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="Apps"><TextBlock Text="Apps" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav5" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s5" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="System health"><TextBlock Text="System health" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <TextBlock Text="Manage" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav6" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s6" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="Moved folders"><TextBlock Text="Moved folders" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav7" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s7" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="Reminders"><TextBlock Text="Reminders" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav8" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s8" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="Activity log"><TextBlock Text="Activity log" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <TextBlock Text="More" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav9" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s9" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="Settings"><TextBlock Text="Settings" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNavFaq" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="faq" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="Common questions"><TextBlock Text="Common questions" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNavFb" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="fb" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="Feedback and updates"><TextBlock Text="Feedback and updates" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
            </StackPanel>
          </ScrollViewer>
        </Border>
        <ScrollViewer x:Name="HelpScroll" Grid.Column="1" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
          <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,14">
            <StackPanel x:Name="HelpPaneStart">
              <Border x:Name="RiskCard" Background="#FFF6F6" BorderBrush="#F3C4C8" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="14" Padding="32,28,32,30" Margin="0">
                <DockPanel>
                  <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE7BA;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#D70015" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,3,16,0"/>
                  <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="Safety notice" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" Foreground="#A1000F"/>
                    <DockPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="20" Foreground="#6E6E73" Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"><Run>Deleting removes files from your PC. Files that aren't moved to the Recycle Bin usually can't be recovered after deletion, which may lead to data loss.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="20" Foreground="#6E6E73" Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"><Run>Before each deletion, make sure you really no longer need these files and that deleting them won't cause you any loss. Back up important files first.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="20" Foreground="#6E6E73" Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"><Run>ClearC only does what you choose. For any data loss or other damage caused by deleting or moving files with ClearC, </Run><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#A1000F">you are solely responsible; the developer accepts no liability</Run><Run>.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="20" Foreground="#6E6E73" Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"><Run>By continuing to use ClearC, you confirm that you understand and accept these risks.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Margin="0,20,0,0">
                <StackPanel>
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="&#xE768;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="19" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,1,12,0"/><TextBlock Text="Getting started" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}"/></StackPanel>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:230:12:12:4" Margin="0,20,0,0">
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="24" Height="24" CornerRadius="12" Background="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,12,0"><TextBlock Text="1" Foreground="White" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                        <StackPanel>
                          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="One-click cleanup" Margin="0,1,0,0"/>
                          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>On "Clean up C:", click "One-click cleanup": caches and temporary files are deleted; nothing is moved. Everything is listed for you to confirm first. When chat history takes a lot of space, the page shows a separate card; click "Move chat history" there to move it to another drive.</Run></TextBlock>
                        </StackPanel>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="24" Height="24" CornerRadius="12" Background="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,12,0"><TextBlock Text="2" Foreground="White" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                        <StackPanel>
                          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Choose for yourself" Margin="0,1,0,0"/>
                          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Click "Scan", choose "Delete", "Move to another drive" or "Skip" on each row, then click "Process selected".</Run></TextBlock>
                        </StackPanel>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="24" Height="24" CornerRadius="12" Background="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,12,0"><TextBlock Text="3" Foreground="White" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                        <StackPanel>
                          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Find duplicates" Margin="0,1,0,0"/>
                          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>In "Duplicates", choose where to look, click "Start search", check the results and delete the checked files.</Run></TextBlock>
                        </StackPanel>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="24" Height="24" CornerRadius="12" Background="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,12,0"><TextBlock Text="4" Foreground="White" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                        <StackPanel>
                          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="See what takes space" Margin="0,1,0,0"/>
                          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>In "Space map", scan a drive and double-click folders to look inside, level by level.</Run></TextBlock>
                        </StackPanel>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </Border>
                  </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
            </StackPanel>
            <StackPanel x:Name="HelpSections">
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec0" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xEDA2;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="Clean up C:" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="Delete caches and temporary files, and move chat history to another drive" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <TextBlock Text="Scan results" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,22,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:400:40:16:2" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <DockPanel>
                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="140" VerticalAlignment="Top"><Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E5F4E9"><TextBlock Text="Safe to clean" FontSize="13" Foreground="#1D7A35" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border></Border>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Caches, temporary files and logs. Apps rebuild them automatically.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel>
                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="140" VerticalAlignment="Top"><Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#FFF1DB"><TextBlock Text="Rebuilt after cleaning" FontSize="13" Foreground="#995700" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border></Border>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Browser caches, thumbnails, shader and download caches. They are generated again, so the first start is a little slower.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel>
                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="140" VerticalAlignment="Top"><Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#FFF1DB"><TextBlock Text="Skipped by default" FontSize="13" Foreground="#995700" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border></Border>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Items that come at a cost, skipped by default. After deleting Windows.old, for example, you can no longer go back to the previous Windows.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel>
                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="140" VerticalAlignment="Top"><Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC"><TextBlock Text="Move only" FontSize="13" Foreground="#0B5CAD" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border></Border>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Chat history and other large folders. They can't be deleted, only moved to another drive as a whole.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel>
                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="140" VerticalAlignment="Top"><Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E5F4E9"><TextBlock Text="Protected" FontSize="13" Foreground="#1D7A35" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border></Border>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>Personal folders, system folders and app installation folders are never touched.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="See the list before deleting"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>When you confirm, click "View file list" to see which files will be deleted; the full list can be saved as a text file.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Recycle Bin first"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Turn this on under "Cleanup list" in Settings and files deleted by a manual cleanup go to the Recycle Bin, so mistakes can be undone. Anything that can't go there is not deleted, and the log says why.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Open the location"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Double-click a row to open its folder; right-click to copy the path.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Which caches are cleaned"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Windows' temporary files, update cache and logs, the caches of common browsers, game launchers and apps, and the download caches of developer tools. Only caches: never cookies, history, passwords or settings.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Items skipped by default"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Windows.old, the Recycle Bin, orphaned Windows Installer packages, old driver packages, broken shortcuts, event logs and more. Skipped by default; read the description before selecting them.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:2">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Your own folders"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Under "Cleanup list" in Settings, add folders to clean or to exclude. For added folders only the contents are deleted; the folder itself stays.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Quick scans"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Folder sizes are read straight from the file table of C:, so a scan usually takes a few seconds. When deleting, every item is checked again.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <Border Background="#EFF8F1" BorderBrush="#CFE9D6" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12" Padding="18,16,22,17" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <DockPanel>
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xEA18;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#248A3D" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,3,14,0"/>
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Nothing in your personal folders is deleted"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>Desktop, Documents, Downloads, Pictures, Videos, Music, OneDrive and similar folders are always skipped.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <TextBlock Text="Moving chat history" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,40,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Supported apps"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>WeChat, QQ, WeCom, Tencent Meeting, Feishu, DingTalk, Telegram, Discord, Slack, Signal, LINE, Viber, KakaoTalk and Zoom. For Store versions, use "Move" under Apps in Windows Settings.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <StackPanel Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="How a move works"/>
                    <WrapPanel Margin="0,12,0,0">
                      <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,8"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="1" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="Close the app" FontSize="13" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="7,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                      <TextBlock Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#8E8E93" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,8,8"/>
                      <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,8"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="2" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="Copy to the target drive" FontSize="13" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="7,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                      <TextBlock Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#8E8E93" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,8,8"/>
                      <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,8"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="3" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="Verify" FontSize="13" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="7,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                      <TextBlock Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#8E8E93" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,8,8"/>
                      <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,8"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="4" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="Replace with a link" FontSize="13" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="7,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                      <TextBlock Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#8E8E93" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,8,8"/>
                      <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,8"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="5" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="Delete the original on C:" FontSize="13" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="7,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                    </WrapPanel>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,4,0,0"><Run>The app keeps reading and writing at the original location; no settings change. If the copy doesn't match, the original folder is not deleted.</Run></TextBlock>
                  </StackPanel>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Target drive"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>The local drive with the most free space is chosen; you can pick another drive or a folder. Network drives, cloud drives and USB sticks can't be used. External disks are never picked automatically, and you are warned when you pick one: once unplugged, the moved apps stop working.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <Border Background="#FFF8EC" BorderBrush="#F5E1BC" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12" Padding="18,16,22,17" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <DockPanel>
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE7BA;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#B25E00" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,3,14,0"/>
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Leave the CDriveMoved folder on the target drive alone"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>If it is deleted, renamed or moved, the apps can no longer find their chat history.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </Border>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec1" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE8C8;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="Duplicates" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="Find files with identical content; keep one copy, delete the rest" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <TextBlock Text="Searching" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,22,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Locations and criteria"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Choose where to look, the file types and the size. System, app and development folders are skipped automatically.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="What counts as a duplicate"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>By default both the name and the content must match; with "Content only", names may differ. Content must match byte for byte.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Fast or full comparison"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>"Fast" samples large files and verifies them byte for byte before deleting; "Full comparison" reads every file completely.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Similar photos"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Finds photos that look the same, such as different resolutions or recompressed copies. Similar is not identical: nothing is checked automatically, and they can only go to the Recycle Bin or an archive.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <TextBlock Text="Handling the results" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,40,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Which copy to keep"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>By default the newest copy in each group is kept. You can also keep the oldest, the one outside C:, the one in a chosen folder, or check them yourself.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Delete, archive or merge"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Files go to the Recycle Bin by default, so they can be restored. You can also move the extra copies to an archive folder, or "Merge into one copy": every location keeps its file, but the space is used once.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <Border Background="#EFF8F1" BorderBrush="#CFE9D6" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12" Padding="18,16,22,17" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <DockPanel>
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xEA18;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#248A3D" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,3,14,0"/>
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Personal folders on C: are protected"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>Copies in Desktop, Documents, Downloads and similar folders can't be checked by default. At least one copy of each group is always kept.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </Border>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec2" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE7B8;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="Save space (without deleting files)" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="Compress, or keep things elsewhere; every file stays" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:280:12:12:3" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="CompactOS"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Compresses the Windows system files, usually saving 2 to 4 GB with no effect on use.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:1">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Page file"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Moves pagefile.sys to another drive; takes effect after a restart.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Hibernation file"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Keeping only Fast Startup halves it; turning hibernation off removes it.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:1">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Restore points"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Shows how much they take; adjust them in Windows' System Protection. ClearC never deletes restore points.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:1">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Compress folders"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>NTFS compression: files work as usual but take less space. Good for documents and old projects.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:1">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Virtual disks"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Compacts WSL and Docker disks; emulators and virtual machines can be moved as a whole.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:1">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Merge duplicates"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Duplicates on the same drive take up space only once. Good for photos and videos you no longer edit.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="OneDrive online-only"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Local copies become cloud-only and download when opened.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:2">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Reserved storage"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Gives back the roughly 7 GB Windows keeps for updates; can be turned back on at any time.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:2">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Component store"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Lets Windows work out how much WinSxS can free before you decide to clean it up.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:2">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Small crash dumps"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Blue screens write a 256 KB dump instead of a multi-GB file.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:2">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Temp folder"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Moves TEMP to another drive; takes effect after signing out and in.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:1">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Move WSL"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Moves a whole distribution with wsl --manage --move; needs WSL 2.5 or later.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                  </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec3" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE9D9;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="Space map" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="See which folders and files take up the most space" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <TextBlock Text="Scanning" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,22,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Scan a drive"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Choose a drive and click "Scan", or click a drive card at the top. Scanning only looks; nothing is changed.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Fast scan"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>NTFS drives are read straight from the file table, so hundreds of thousands of files take seconds. If that isn't possible, folders are scanned one by one.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Drive overview"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>After a whole drive is scanned, the top shows how the used space splits into system and apps, personal files, caches you can clean, and other.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Worth a look"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Lists large folders such as caches, packages, build output and temporary files; click one to go there. They are recognized by name only, so look before deleting.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <TextBlock Text="Browsing" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,40,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Look inside"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Double-click a folder to open it. Use the mouse side buttons or Alt+← and Alt+→ to go back and forward, and click any level of the path.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Treemap"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>The bigger the block, the more space it takes. The colour shows what a folder holds; hatched blocks are caches whose space can be had back.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Find files"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Search files of 1 MB or more by size, age, type and name, or only the large files inside chat apps.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="By type"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Splits every file on the drive into ten kinds, such as videos, pictures, documents and archives, and shows how much each takes.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Recent changes and Since last scan"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>"Recent changes" lists the folders with the most new or rewritten files in the last few days; "Since last scan" finds the folders that grew and where the extra space went.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Export"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Save the list as CSV, or the whole drive as a web page report.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <TextBlock Text="Selecting and deleting" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,40,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Check boxes"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Only a click on the box in front of a row checks it; a click elsewhere on the row does not. Hold the left or right mouse button and drag to check a run of rows. The boxes can be turned off in Settings.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Delete list"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Collect what to delete from different folders first; the bar underneath keeps showing roughly how much space the drive will have afterwards. Review it, then delete everything at once.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Delete"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Move to the Recycle Bin or delete permanently; both ask first. You are warned when a folder is a git repository.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <Border Background="#F5F5F7" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12" Padding="18,16,22,17" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <DockPanel>
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE72E;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#6E6E73" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,3,14,0"/>
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Items with a lock can't be deleted here"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>System folders, app installation folders, personal folders on C:, chat history and moved data.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Size on disk"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>With the fast scan, compressed and cloud-only files show what they really take, as do hard links. "Space breakdown" explains why the used space differs from adding up file sizes.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec4" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE71D;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="Apps" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="See what apps take; uninstall, clean leftovers, move to another drive" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="App list"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>All installed apps, largest first. Search by name, or show only the apps on C:.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Several at once"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Tick several apps or drag over rows with the left mouse button. Uninstalling opens each app's own uninstaller in turn.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Uninstall and leftovers"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>After uninstalling, click "Check leftovers" to find folders left behind and move them to the Recycle Bin.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Move to another drive"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Moves an app installed on C: to another drive as a whole; shortcuts, uninstalling and updates keep working. Apps with services or drivers, Microsoft's own apps and a few others aren't suited to moving, and ClearC says why.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Check for updates"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Uses winget, which comes with Windows, and upgrades in a terminal. ClearC only goes online when you click it.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <TextBlock Text="Startup and extensions" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,40,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Startup, scheduled tasks, context menu"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Third-party startup items, scheduled tasks and context menu extensions. Disabling deletes nothing and can be undone at any time.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Leftover folders"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Finds folders uninstalled apps may have left behind. It is only a guess, so open them first, then move them to the Recycle Bin.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec5" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE95E;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="System health" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="Hardware status, boot time, crash diagnosis and common fixes" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Hardware"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>The state of the CPU, memory, drives, battery, graphics and Windows, marked green, amber or red; anything that can't be read says so. It is read in the background after ClearC opens.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Boot time"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>How long recent starts took, and which programs slowed them down.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Blue screens and crashes"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Reads the crash dumps together with the event logs and drive health and gives a diagnosis, each with "Fix as suggested" and "Things to do yourself".</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Diagnostics package"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Packs the dumps, logs and system information into one zip to send to someone who can help. It includes the computer name and installed apps, so only share it with people you trust.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Common fixes"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Proven fixes listed by problem, all built from Windows' own commands and run in a visible window. Anything that changes the system explains itself and asks first.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Activity monitor"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Checks every 3 seconds how much CPU, memory and disk writing each program uses, to find what is slowing the PC down.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <Border Background="#EFF8F1" BorderBrush="#CFE9D6" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12" Padding="18,16,22,17" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <DockPanel>
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xEA18;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#248A3D" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,3,14,0"/>
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Looking changes nothing"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>Only the fix buttons change the system, and they first say what will change and whether it can be undone.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </Border>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec6" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE8AB;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="Moved folders" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="Move several items at once and check the ones already moved" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Can be moved"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Chat history, apps and large folders on C: that can still be moved. Tick them, choose the target drive and click "Move to another drive". Hold the left mouse button and drag over rows to tick several at once.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Apps not suited to moving"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Listed separately, each with the reason.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <TextBlock Text="Moved" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,40,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:400:40:16:2" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <DockPanel>
                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="110" VerticalAlignment="Top"><Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E5F4E9"><TextBlock Text="OK" FontSize="13" Foreground="#1D7A35" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border></Border>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>The data is on the target drive and C: keeps only a link. You can move it back to C: whenever you like.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel>
                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="110" VerticalAlignment="Top"><Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#FDEBEC"><TextBlock Text="Broken link" FontSize="13" Foreground="#C0101C" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border></Border>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>The target drive isn't connected or its letter changed. Plug it back in, or repair the link.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel>
                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="110" VerticalAlignment="Top"><Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#FFF1DB"><TextBlock Text="Unfinished" FontSize="13" Foreground="#995700" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border></Border>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>The original folder is still there and the target drive has a copy. Move it again, or delete the extra copy.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec7" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE823;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="Reminders" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="A warning when space runs low, and scheduled cleanup" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Low space alert"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>A notice at the bottom right when C: drops below the amount you set, at most once a day.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Junk alert"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>A notice when temporary files and caches grow past the size you set. It only counts; nothing is deleted.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Scheduled cleanup"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Cleans temporary files, caches and logs every week or every day. Personal folders are never touched, and nothing is moved.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Space history"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Records the free space on C: each day as a 30-day bar chart.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <Border Background="#EEF5FD" BorderBrush="#D2E3FA" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12" Padding="18,16,22,17" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <DockPanel>
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE946;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,3,14,0"/>
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Both are off by default"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>Turning one on copies ClearC to C:\Program Files\ClearC, and Windows Task Scheduler runs it from there on time. The copy is removed when both are off.</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </Border>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec8" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE81C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="Activity log" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="Every change is recorded" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="What is recorded"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Every delete, move, merge, compression, uninstall and system setting change: when, what, on which folder and the result.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Finding entries"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Filter by category, time and keyword. The logs are plain text files, one per month.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="How long"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Half a year by default, and you can change it. Older entries are removed automatically.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec9" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE713;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="Settings" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="Appearance, language and what the window shows" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Mode"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Decides how many features the window shows. Change it at any time without losing settings or records.</Run></TextBlock>
                      <DockPanel Margin="0,10,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="20" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#8E8E93"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">Home user</Run><Run>: Clean up C:, Save space, Space map, Apps, System health and Help.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                      <DockPanel Margin="0,7,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="20" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#8E8E93"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">Engineer</Run><Run>: adds Duplicates, Moved folders, Reminders, the Activity log and the advanced features on each page.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                      <DockPanel Margin="0,7,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="20" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#8E8E93"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">Developer and IT</Run><Run>: everything.</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Appearance and language"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Light, dark or follow Windows; Chinese or English. ClearC reopens after you change them.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="What the window shows"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Pages, buttons and descriptions you don't use can be hidden and brought back at any time.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Scanning and duplicates"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Fast scan reads the file table directly; the duplicate search can make way for other programs so it doesn't slow down what you are using.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="What ClearC changed"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Changes ClearC made that are still in effect (CompactOS, page file, hibernation, moved folders, disabled startup items…), each with how to undo it. You can also turn on "Create a restore point before changing system settings".</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Cleanup list"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Send deleted files to the Recycle Bin first, and add folders to clean or to exclude.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
            </StackPanel>
            <Border x:Name="HelpPaneFaq" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,20" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="&#xE897;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="19" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,1,12,0"/><TextBlock Text="Common questions" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}"/></StackPanel>
                <StackPanel x:Name="HelpFaq" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}" BorderThickness="0">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Why can't I find some features?"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Probably because of the mode. Switch to Engineer or Developer and IT in Settings; anything hidden under "What the window shows" is turned back on there too.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="C: lost a lot of space recently. Where did it go?"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Scan C: in the space map and look at "Since last scan" and "Recent changes" to see where the extra space went. To find out which program is writing, run the activity monitor in System health for a while.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="What should I do after a blue screen?"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Open "Blue screens and crashes" in System health, read the diagnosis, click "Fix as suggested", then work through "Things to do yourself". To get help, export a diagnostics package.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Why does ClearC need administrator rights?"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Cleaning system temporary files, the Windows Update cache and similar places requires them.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Can I cancel halfway?"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Yes. ClearC stops at a safe point and doesn't undo what is done. If a move is still copying, the original folder on C: is left alone and the next move continues where it stopped.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Can I close the window while it's working?"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Please wait until it is done. Click "Cancel" to stop, or "Continue in background" to fold the progress away.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Where can I see the details?"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Deletes and moves are in the "Activity log"; technical details are in the "Run log" at the bottom left.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Less space was freed than expected?"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Files in the Recycle Bin free their space once it is emptied; files in use by other programs are skipped.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Why doesn't the scan total match the used space?"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Hard links are counted more than once, compressed and cloud-only files take less than their size, and system data such as the file table takes space too. After a fast scan, "Space breakdown" in the space map shows each part.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="WinSxS is huge. Can I delete it?"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Not by hand. Many of its files are hard links, so it takes less than it seems. To free space, use "WinSxS component cleanup" on the cleanup page.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Why no Prefetch cleaning or memory boost?"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Prefetch makes common apps start faster and only takes a few dozen MB; deleting it makes starts slower. Free memory is used by Windows to cache files, and emptying it only slows things down.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Why is there no registry cleaner?"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Leftover registry entries take no space and don't slow anything down, while a wrong deletion can stop apps from starting.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="How do I know about new versions?"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Click "Check for updates" under "Feedback and updates" in Help. Replace the old exe with the new one; your settings and records are kept.</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>
            <Border x:Name="FeedbackCard" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="&#xE8BD;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="19" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,1,12,0"/><TextBlock Text="Feedback and updates" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}"/></StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,12,0,0" Text="If you run into a problem or have a suggestion, please open an issue on GitHub."/>
                <Border Background="#F5F5F7" CornerRadius="12" Padding="20,16" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <Button x:Name="BtnIssue" Content="Report an issue" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Padding="14,7" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                      <Button x:Name="BtnGitHub" Content="Open page" Padding="14,7"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <Border Width="40" Height="40" CornerRadius="20" Background="#E8F0FE">
                        <TextBlock Text="&#xE943;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="18" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                      </Border>
                      <StackPanel Margin="14,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <TextBlock Text="GitHub project page" Style="{StaticResource Caption}"/>
                        <TextBlock x:Name="GitHubUrl" Text="github.com/Xuanqiyun/ClearC" FontSize="16" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,1,0,0" TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Ideal"/>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <StackPanel x:Name="FbCopyDiag" Margin="0,24,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Include diagnostic info"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Text="A screenshot and the diagnostic info help find the cause faster. The diagnostic info contains folder paths, so take a look before posting it."/>
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <Button x:Name="BtnCopyDiag" Content="Copy diagnostic info" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                    <Button x:Name="BtnOpenLog" Content="Open run log file"/>
                    <TextBlock x:Name="CopyHint" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Foreground="#1D7A35" Margin="14,0,0,0"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel x:Name="FbSelfTest" Margin="0,24,0,0">
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,0,0,24"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Check scanning"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Text="Verifies on this PC that the fast scan is accurate. It takes a minute or two and only reads. The result is copied so you can paste it into an issue."/>
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <Button x:Name="BtnSelfTest" Content="Check scanning"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel x:Name="FbCheckUpdate" Margin="0,24,0,0">
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,0,0,24"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Check for updates"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Text="ClearC contacts GitHub only when you click this button."/>
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <Button x:Name="BtnCheckUpdate" Content="Check for updates"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel x:Name="FbCopyHash" Margin="0,24,0,0">
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,0,0,24"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="Check this file"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Text="ClearC is not code-signed. Compare the SHA256 below with the one on the GitHub release page; if they match, the exe you downloaded has not been changed."/>
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <Button x:Name="BtnCopyHash" Content="Copy SHA256"/>
                    <TextBlock x:Name="SelfHash" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" FontFamily="Consolas" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="14,0,0,0"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>
            <DockPanel x:Name="HelpPager" Margin="4,14,4,0" LastChildFill="False">
              <Button x:Name="BtnHelpNext" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" FontSize="13"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnHelpPrev" DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" FontSize="13"/>
            </DockPanel>
          </StackPanel>
        </ScrollViewer>
      </Grid>
    </Grid>
'@

# ---------- 界面语言：设置里的 Lang=zh / en；没设过就跟系统显示语言走（中文系统用中文，其他用英文） ----------
function Get-UiLang {
    try {
        $f = Join-Path $env:LOCALAPPDATA 'CleanC\settings.txt'
        if (Test-Path -LiteralPath $f) { foreach ($l in [IO.File]::ReadAllLines($f, [Text.Encoding]::UTF8)) { if ($l -match '^\s*Lang\s*=\s*(zh|en)\s*$') { return $matches[1] } } }
    } catch {}
    if ([Globalization.CultureInfo]::CurrentUICulture.Name -like 'zh*') { return 'zh' }
    return 'en'
}
$script:Lang = Get-UiLang
$script:L10n = $null
if ($script:Lang -eq 'en') {
    $script:L10n = New-Object 'System.Collections.Generic.Dictionary[string,string]'
    $unesc = { param($x) $x.Replace('\\', [string][char]1).Replace('\t', "`t").Replace('\r', "`r").Replace('\n', "`n").Replace([string][char]1, '\') }
    foreach ($l in ($script:l10nData -split "`r?`n")) {
        $i = $l.IndexOf("`t"); if ($i -le 0) { continue }
        $script:L10n[(& $unesc $l.Substring(0, $i))] = (& $unesc $l.Substring($i + 1))
    }
}
try { [L10n]::Map = $script:L10n } catch {}

Invoke-Expression $engine
$catalog = Get-Catalog

# ---------- 外观：浅色 / 深色 / 跟随系统。存在设置里，换了以后重新打开本工具生效 ----------
$script:themePref = Get-Setting 'Theme' 'light'
$script:sysDark = $false
try { $script:sysDark = ((Get-ItemProperty 'HKCU:\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Themes\Personalize' -Name AppsUseLightTheme -ErrorAction Stop).AppsUseLightTheme -eq 0) } catch {}
[Theme]::Dark = ($script:themePref -eq 'dark') -or ($script:themePref -eq 'system' -and $script:sysDark)
try { [RowTheme]::Map = [Delegate]::CreateDelegate([Func[string, char, string]], [Theme].GetMethod('Map')) } catch {}

# ============================================================
# 定时任务调用的两种模式（不打开主窗口）：
#   /check      检查 C 盘剩余空间，低于设定值时在右下角提醒（每天最多一次）
#   /autoclean  每周自动清理一次「安全清理」里的缓存，做完在右下角告诉你
# ============================================================
function Show-Toast([string]$Title, [string]$Text, [string[]]$Buttons = @((T '好')), [int]$AutoClose = 0) {
    $x = @'
<Window xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation" xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        WindowStyle="None" AllowsTransparency="True" Background="Transparent" ResizeMode="NoResize" ShowInTaskbar="True" Topmost="True"
        SizeToContent="Height" Width="400" FontFamily="Segoe UI, Microsoft YaHei UI" FontSize="13" Foreground="#1D1D1F" Title="腾挪 ClearC">
  <Border Margin="14" Background="White" CornerRadius="14" BorderBrush="#D9D9DE" BorderThickness="1" Padding="20,16,20,14">
    <Border.Effect><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="24" ShadowDepth="6" Direction="270" Opacity="0.22"/></Border.Effect>
    <StackPanel>
      <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,0,8">
        <Border Width="22" Height="22" CornerRadius="6" Background="#0071E3">
          <TextBlock Text="&#xEDA2;" FontFamily="Segoe Fluent Icons, Segoe MDL2 Assets" FontSize="12" Foreground="White" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
        </Border>
        <TextBlock Text="腾挪 ClearC" Foreground="#6E6E73" FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,0,0"/>
      </StackPanel>
      <TextBlock x:Name="TTitle" FontSize="15" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
      <TextBlock x:Name="TText" Margin="0,6,0,0" Foreground="#3A3A3C" TextWrapping="Wrap" LineHeight="20"/>
      <StackPanel x:Name="TButtons" Orientation="Horizontal" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Margin="0,14,0,0"/>
    </StackPanel>
  </Border>
</Window>
'@
    $x = $x.Replace('腾挪 ClearC', (T '腾挪 ClearC'))
    $w = [Windows.Markup.XamlReader]::Parse([Theme]::Xaml($x))
    $w.FindName('TTitle').Text = $Title
    $w.FindName('TText').Text = $Text
    $script:toastResult = ''
    $panel = $w.FindName('TButtons')
    for ($i = 0; $i -lt $Buttons.Count; $i++) {
        $b = New-Object System.Windows.Controls.Button
        $b.Content = $Buttons[$i]; $b.Tag = $Buttons[$i]; $b.MinWidth = 76
        $b.Padding = New-Object System.Windows.Thickness 14, 6, 14, 6; $b.Margin = New-Object System.Windows.Thickness 8, 0, 0, 0
        $b.Cursor = [System.Windows.Input.Cursors]::Hand
        if ($i -eq $Buttons.Count - 1) { $b.Background = New-Object System.Windows.Media.SolidColorBrush ([System.Windows.Media.Color]::FromRgb(0, 0x71, 0xE3)); $b.Foreground = [System.Windows.Media.Brushes]::White; $b.BorderThickness = 0 }
        $b.Add_Click({ $script:toastResult = [string]$this.Tag; [System.Windows.Window]::GetWindow($this).Close() })
        [void]$panel.Children.Add($b)
    }
    $w.Add_MouseLeftButtonDown({ try { $this.DragMove() } catch {} })
    $w.Add_Loaded({
        $wa = [System.Windows.SystemParameters]::WorkArea
        $this.Left = $wa.Right - $this.ActualWidth - 4
        $this.Top = $wa.Bottom - $this.ActualHeight - 4
    })
    if ($AutoClose -gt 0) {
        $script:toastWin = $w
        $t = New-Object System.Windows.Threading.DispatcherTimer
        $t.Interval = [TimeSpan]::FromSeconds($AutoClose)
        $t.Add_Tick({ $this.Stop(); try { $script:toastWin.Close() } catch {} })
        $t.Start()
    }
    [void]$w.ShowDialog()
    return $script:toastResult
}

$script:mode = [string]$env:CLEANC_ARGS
if ($script:mode -match '(?i)/check') {
    Add-History
    $gb = 20; [void][int]::TryParse((Get-Setting 'RemindGB' '20'), [ref]$gb)
    $free = [double](FreeC)
    $today = (Get-Date).ToString('yyyy-MM-dd')
    $shown = $false
    if ($free -lt $gb * 1GB -and (Get-Setting 'LastRemind' '') -ne $today) {
        Set-Setting 'LastRemind' $today; $shown = $true
        $ans = Show-Toast -Title ((T "C 盘只剩 {0} 了") -f (GB $free)) -Text ((T "低于你设定的 {0} GB。打开腾挪 ClearC，看看能清掉或搬走什么？`n（在工具的「自动提醒」页可以关掉这个提醒）") -f $gb) -Buttons @((T '稍后'), (T '打开腾挪 ClearC'))
        if ($ans -eq (T '打开腾挪 ClearC') -and $env:CLEANC_SELF) { Start-Process -FilePath $env:CLEANC_SELF }
    }
    # 可以清理的垃圾超过设定值时也提醒（每天最多一次；只统计「安全清理」里的缓存，不碰任何东西）
    $jgb = 0; [void][int]::TryParse((Get-Setting 'JunkGB' '0'), [ref]$jgb)
    if (-not $shown -and $jgb -gt 0 -and (Get-Setting 'LastJunkRemind' '') -ne $today) {
        try { [Diagnostics.Process]::GetCurrentProcess().PriorityClass = 'BelowNormal' } catch {}
        $junk = [double]0
        foreach ($it in (Get-Catalog)) {
            if ($it.Kind -ne 'cache' -or $it.Def -ne 'delete' -or $it.Act -or $it.Tier -ne 'safe') { continue }
            $junk += [double](Measure-Item $it)
        }
        if ($junk -ge $jgb * 1GB) {
            Set-Setting 'LastJunkRemind' $today
            $ans = Show-Toast -Title ((T "C 盘上有约 {0} 可以清理") -f (GB $junk)) -Text ((T "临时文件、缓存和日志加起来超过了你设定的 {0} GB。打开腾挪 ClearC 清一清？`n（在工具的「自动提醒」页可以改界限或关掉这个提醒）") -f $jgb) -Buttons @((T '稍后'), (T '打开腾挪 ClearC'))
            if ($ans -eq (T '打开腾挪 ClearC') -and $env:CLEANC_SELF) { Start-Process -FilePath $env:CLEANC_SELF }
        }
    }
    $global:CLEANC_UI_SHOWN = $true
    return
}
# 界面自测（给自动测试用）：照常打开窗口，点一遍界面功能，对话框一律当作点了「取消」，做完自己关掉
$script:uiTest = [bool]($script:mode -match '(?i)/uitest')
# 这个 exe 是什么时候构建的（同一个版本号可能构建过好几次，反馈问题时好对上）
$script:AppBuild = ''
try {
    if ($script:AppBuildStamp) { $script:AppBuild = '{0:yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm}' -f ([DateTime]::Parse($script:AppBuildStamp, [Globalization.CultureInfo]::InvariantCulture, [Globalization.DateTimeStyles]::AdjustToUniversal -bor [Globalization.DateTimeStyles]::AssumeUniversal)).ToLocalTime() }
    elseif ($script:selfScript -and (Test-Path -LiteralPath $script:selfScript)) { $script:AppBuild = '{0:yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm}' -f (Get-Item -LiteralPath $script:selfScript).LastWriteTime }   # 直接运行脚本：用脚本的修改时间
} catch {}
$script:uiSheets = New-Object System.Collections.Generic.List[string]
if ($script:mode -match '(?i)/selftest') {
    Init-DriveThreads
    [DiskMap]::MftOff = ((Get-Setting 'FastScan' '1') -eq '0')
    $r = Invoke-SelfTest $script:AppVersion
    $file = if ($env:CLEANC_REPORT) { [IO.Path]::GetFullPath($env:CLEANC_REPORT) } else { Join-Path $script:appDir 'selftest.txt' }
    $dir = Split-Path $file
    try { if ($dir) { New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path $dir | Out-Null } } catch {}
    try { [IO.File]::WriteAllText($file, (@($r.Lines) -join "`r`n"), (New-Object Text.UTF8Encoding $true)) } catch {}
    if (-not $env:CLEANC_QUIET) {
        $ans = Show-Toast -Title (T '扫描功能检查完了') -Text ((T "{0} 项正常，{1} 项提醒，{2} 项有问题") -f $r.Res.Pass, $r.Res.Warn, $r.Res.Fail) -Buttons @((T '好'), (T '打开结果'))
        if ($ans -eq (T '打开结果')) { [void](Open-AsUser $file) }
    }
    $global:CLEANC_EXIT = [int]$r.Res.Fail
    $global:CLEANC_UI_SHOWN = $true
    return
}
if ($script:mode -match '(?i)/autoclean') {
    if (-not (Enter-BusyLock)) { OpLog '删除' (T '这次自动清理跳过：本工具的窗口里正在删除或搬家') '' (T '下次到时间再做'); $global:CLEANC_UI_SHOWN = $true; return }
    [void](Prune-OpLog (Get-LogMonths))
    [void][FsTools]::KeepAwake($true)   # 清完之前电脑不睡着（进程结束时自动放开）
    $r = Invoke-AutoClean
    Add-History
    OpLog '删除' (T '每周自动清理完成') '' ((T "C 盘多出 {0}；{1}") -f (GB $r.Freed), ($r.Items -join (T '；')))
    [void](Show-Toast -Title (T '每周自动清理完成') -Text ((T "C 盘多出 {0}。只清了临时文件、缓存和日志，没有碰任何个人文件。每一项都记在「操作日志」里。") -f (GB $r.Freed)) -Buttons @((T '好')) -AutoClose 30)
    $global:CLEANC_UI_SHOWN = $true
    return
}

# ============================================================
# 界面
# ============================================================
# 只开一个窗口：已经开着的话，把那个窗口拉到前面，这一个直接退出（两个窗口同时删、同时搬会互相打架）
$script:uiMutex = $null
if (-not $script:uiTest) {
    $first = $true
    try { $script:uiMutex = [System.Threading.Mutex]::new($true, 'Local\ClearC-UI', [ref]$first) } catch { $first = $true }
    if (-not $first) {
        try {
            foreach ($p in @(Get-Process -Name ([Diagnostics.Process]::GetCurrentProcess().ProcessName) -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue)) {
                if ($p.Id -ne $PID -and $p.MainWindowHandle -ne [IntPtr]::Zero) { [Microsoft.VisualBasic.Interaction]::AppActivate($p.Id); break }
            }
        } catch {}
        $global:CLEANC_UI_SHOWN = $true
        return
    }
}
# 重新打开本工具（换外观、换语言）之前先放开：不然新开的那个以为已经有窗口开着，直接退出
function Exit-UiLock { if ($script:uiMutex) { try { $script:uiMutex.ReleaseMutex() } catch {}; try { $script:uiMutex.Dispose() } catch {}; $script:uiMutex = $null } }
[xml]$xaml = @"
<Window xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        Title="腾挪 ClearC" Width="1220" Height="860" MinWidth="980" MinHeight="620"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterScreen" FontFamily="Segoe UI, Microsoft YaHei UI" FontSize="13" Background="#F5F5F7"
        Foreground="#1D1D1F" UseLayoutRounding="True" SnapsToDevicePixels="True" TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Display">
  <Window.Resources>
    <!-- 用键盘（Tab）走到哪里，哪里就有一圈蓝边；鼠标点击时不出现 -->
    <Style x:Key="FocusRing">
      <Setter Property="Control.Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate>
            <Rectangle Margin="-3" RadiusX="9" RadiusY="9" Stroke="#0071E3" StrokeThickness="2" SnapsToDevicePixels="True"/>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <!-- 设置里可以关掉的显示项：改这几个资源，界面上用到的地方都跟着变 -->
    <Visibility x:Key="MapCkVis">Visible</Visibility>
    <Visibility x:Key="MapBarVis">Visible</Visibility>
    <Visibility x:Key="MapPctVis">Visible</Visibility>
    <Visibility x:Key="MapMetaVis">Visible</Visibility>
    <Visibility x:Key="MapHealthVis">Visible</Visibility>
    <Visibility x:Key="AppMoveVis">Visible</Visibility>
    <Visibility x:Key="SubVis">Visible</Visibility>
    <!-- 配色：浅灰底 #F5F5F7、白色卡片、正文 #1D1D1F、次要文字 #6E6E73、分隔线 #E5E5EA、唯一的强调色是蓝 #0071E3，红色只给删除 -->
    <FontFamily x:Key="Icons">Segoe Fluent Icons, Segoe MDL2 Assets</FontFamily>

    <!-- ===== 文字 ===== -->
    <!-- 换行的文字按字号给行距（约 1.5 倍），几行中文读起来不挤：12 号 19、13 号 21、13.5 号 21、14 号 22、15 号 23。
         只管会换行的文字：一行的标签不加，免得和旁边的按钮、图标对不齐；自己写了行距的照旧 -->
    <Style x:Key="TextBase" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Style.Triggers>
        <MultiTrigger>
          <MultiTrigger.Conditions>
            <Condition Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
            <Condition Property="FontSize" Value="12"/>
          </MultiTrigger.Conditions>
          <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="19"/>
        </MultiTrigger>
        <MultiTrigger>
          <MultiTrigger.Conditions>
            <Condition Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
            <Condition Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
          </MultiTrigger.Conditions>
          <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="21"/>
        </MultiTrigger>
        <MultiTrigger>
          <MultiTrigger.Conditions>
            <Condition Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
            <Condition Property="FontSize" Value="13.5"/>
          </MultiTrigger.Conditions>
          <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="21"/>
        </MultiTrigger>
        <MultiTrigger>
          <MultiTrigger.Conditions>
            <Condition Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
            <Condition Property="FontSize" Value="14"/>
          </MultiTrigger.Conditions>
          <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="22"/>
        </MultiTrigger>
        <MultiTrigger>
          <MultiTrigger.Conditions>
            <Condition Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
            <Condition Property="FontSize" Value="15"/>
          </MultiTrigger.Conditions>
          <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="23"/>
        </MultiTrigger>
      </Style.Triggers>
    </Style>
    <Style TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource TextBase}"/>
    <Style x:Key="PageTitle" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="26"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="TextOptions.TextFormattingMode" Value="Ideal"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="PageSub" TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource TextBase}">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#6E6E73"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,5,0,0"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
      <Setter Property="Visibility" Value="{DynamicResource SubVis}"/>
    </Style>
    <!-- 设置页：每一项的名字和说明 -->
    <Style x:Key="SetName" TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource TextBase}">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13.5"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="SetNote" TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource TextBase}">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#6E6E73"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
      <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="18"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,3,0,0"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="SectionTitle" TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource TextBase}">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="RowLabel" TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource TextBase}">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,6,0,0"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Top"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="Caption" TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource TextBase}">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#6E6E73"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="Note" TargetType="TextBlock" BasedOn="{StaticResource Caption}"/>
    <Style x:Key="HelpHead" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="20"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpPara" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="14"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#3A3A3C"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
      <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="24"/>
    </Style>
    <!-- 帮助页：条目是一行粗体标题，下面一两行说明（字号、行距、段距照苹果的帮助页：正文 14 / 行高 24，条目之间空 26） -->
    <Style x:Key="HelpLead" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="15"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpBody" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="14"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#424245"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
      <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="24"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,6,0,0"/>
      <Setter Property="MaxWidth" Value="660"/>
      <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Left"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpGroup" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#6E6E73"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpSum" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="14"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#6E6E73"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,5,0,0"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpListHead" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#6E6E73"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Bottom"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpIcon" TargetType="Border">
      <Setter Property="Width" Value="44"/>
      <Setter Property="Height" Value="44"/>
      <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="12"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#EAF2FD"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,16,0"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpPill" TargetType="Border">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#F0F0F3"/>
      <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="7"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="10,3,10,4"/>
      <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Left"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Top"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,14,0"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpTile" TargetType="Border">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#F5F5F7"/>
      <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="12"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="18,16,18,18"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="HelpSection" TargetType="Expander">
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,0,10"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Expander">
            <Border Background="White" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12">
              <DockPanel>
                <ToggleButton DockPanel.Dock="Top" Focusable="False" Cursor="Hand" Content="{TemplateBinding Header}"
                              IsChecked="{Binding IsExpanded, Mode=TwoWay, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                  <ToggleButton.Template>
                    <ControlTemplate TargetType="ToggleButton">
                      <Border x:Name="Hd" Background="Transparent" CornerRadius="11" Padding="16,13,20,13">
                        <DockPanel>
                          <TextBlock x:Name="Chev" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Text="&#xE70D;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="12"
                                     Foreground="#6E6E73" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="14,0,0,0" RenderTransformOrigin="0.5,0.5">
                            <TextBlock.RenderTransform><RotateTransform Angle="0"/></TextBlock.RenderTransform>
                          </TextBlock>
                          <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                        </DockPanel>
                      </Border>
                      <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Chev" Property="Foreground" Value="#0071E3"/></Trigger>
                        <MultiTrigger>
                          <MultiTrigger.Conditions><Condition Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"/><Condition Property="IsChecked" Value="False"/></MultiTrigger.Conditions>
                          <Setter TargetName="Hd" Property="Background" Value="#F7F7F9"/>
                        </MultiTrigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                          <Setter TargetName="Chev" Property="RenderTransform"><Setter.Value><RotateTransform Angle="180"/></Setter.Value></Setter>
                        </Trigger>
                      </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                    </ControlTemplate>
                  </ToggleButton.Template>
                </ToggleButton>
                <StackPanel x:Name="Body" Visibility="Collapsed">
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="16,0,16,0"/>
                  <ContentPresenter Margin="22,0,22,20"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsExpanded" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Body" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <!-- 常见问题：一行一个问题，点开看答案 -->
    <Style x:Key="HelpQ" TargetType="Expander">
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#EDEDF0"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0,1,0,0"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Expander">
            <Border BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}" BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}">
              <DockPanel>
                <ToggleButton DockPanel.Dock="Top" Focusable="False" Cursor="Hand" Content="{TemplateBinding Header}"
                              IsChecked="{Binding IsExpanded, Mode=TwoWay, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                  <ToggleButton.Template>
                    <ControlTemplate TargetType="ToggleButton">
                      <Border Background="Transparent" Padding="0,17,2,17">
                        <DockPanel>
                          <TextBlock x:Name="Chev" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Text="&#xE70D;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="11"
                                     Foreground="#6E6E73" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="16,0,0,0" RenderTransformOrigin="0.5,0.5">
                            <TextBlock.RenderTransform><RotateTransform Angle="0"/></TextBlock.RenderTransform>
                          </TextBlock>
                          <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                        </DockPanel>
                      </Border>
                      <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                        <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Chev" Property="Foreground" Value="#0071E3"/></Trigger>
                        <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                          <Setter TargetName="Chev" Property="RenderTransform"><Setter.Value><RotateTransform Angle="180"/></Setter.Value></Setter>
                        </Trigger>
                      </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                    </ControlTemplate>
                  </ToggleButton.Template>
                </ToggleButton>
                <ContentPresenter x:Name="Body" Visibility="Collapsed" Margin="0,0,36,20"/>
              </DockPanel>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsExpanded" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Body" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 卡片 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="Card" TargetType="Border">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="White"/>
      <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="12"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#E5E5EA"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="SegBox" TargetType="Border">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#EBEBF0"/>
      <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="8"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="2"/>
      <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Left"/>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 按钮：圆角 8，悬停/按下时整体轻微变暗 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="Secondary" TargetType="Button">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#E8E8ED"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Transparent"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="14,6"/>
      <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="30"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
            <Grid>
              <Border x:Name="Bd" Background="{TemplateBinding Background}" BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                      BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}" CornerRadius="8"/>
              <Border x:Name="Shade" Background="#000000" Opacity="0" CornerRadius="8"/>
              <Border x:Name="Ring" BorderBrush="#7FB5F0" BorderThickness="0" CornerRadius="8" Margin="-2"/>
              <ContentPresenter Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" RecognizesAccessKey="False"/>
            </Grid>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Shade" Property="Opacity" Value="0.06"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsPressed" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Shade" Property="Opacity" Value="0.14"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsKeyboardFocused" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Ring" Property="BorderThickness" Value="2"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.4"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Secondary}"/>
    <!-- 列表自带的样式会把文字设成固定的深色，这里改回正文颜色（深色模式会跟着换） -->
    <Style TargetType="ListView"><Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/></Style>
    <Style TargetType="ListBox"><Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/></Style>
    <Style x:Key="Primary" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Secondary}">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#0071E3"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="White"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="Danger" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Secondary}">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#D70015"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="White"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="Small" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Secondary}">
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="10,3"/>
      <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="26"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12.5"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="LinkButton" TargetType="Button">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#0066CC"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="2,2"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
            <Border Background="Transparent" Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}">
              <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center" RecognizesAccessKey="False"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.7"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.4"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 列表表头：点列名按这一列排序，再点一下反过来 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="ColHead" TargetType="Button">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#6E6E73"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0,3"/>
      <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Left"/>
      <Setter Property="ToolTip" Value="点一下按这一列排序，再点一下反过来"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
            <Border Background="Transparent" Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}">
              <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}" VerticalAlignment="Center" RecognizesAccessKey="False"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <!-- 表头那一行：白底，下面一条细线 -->
    <Style x:Key="HeadBar" TargetType="Border">
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#E5E5EA"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0,0,0,1"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0,4,0,4"/>
    </Style>
    <!-- ===== 页面里的二级选项卡：文字下面一条蓝线 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="SubTab" TargetType="RadioButton">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#6E6E73"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,22,0"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="RadioButton">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" Background="Transparent" BorderBrush="Transparent" BorderThickness="0,0,0,2" Padding="2,6,2,7">
              <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="BorderBrush" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
                <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
              </Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <!-- ===== 页面左侧的目录（省空间、常见问题修复）：一级标题下面一项一项，点哪项右边显示哪项 ===== -->
    <!-- 一级标题：黑色加粗，不缩进 -->
    <Style x:Key="TreeHead" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="10,16,0,6"/>
    </Style>
    <!-- 二级菜单：缩进，左边一条细的竖线把同一组连起来，看得出属于哪个一级标题 -->
    <Style x:Key="TreeItem" TargetType="RadioButton">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#3A3A3C"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,0,1"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="RadioButton">
            <Grid Background="Transparent">
              <Rectangle Width="1" Fill="#D9D9DE" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="15,0,0,0"/>
              <Border x:Name="Bd" CornerRadius="7" Padding="12,6,10,6" Margin="22,0,0,0" Background="Transparent">
                <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              </Border>
            </Grid>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E8E8ED"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E3EEFF"/>
                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#0A5BC4"/>
                <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
              </Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <!-- 能点的一级菜单（搬家管理的「可以搬的」「已经搬走的」）：黑色加粗，不缩进 -->
    <Style x:Key="TreeTop" TargetType="RadioButton">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,10,0,2"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="RadioButton">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" CornerRadius="7" Padding="10,7" Background="Transparent">
              <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E8E8ED"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E3EEFF"/>
                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#0A5BC4"/>
              </Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <!-- 选项卡、目录上的数字和状态：小圆角标签，和名字分开 -->
    <Style x:Key="TabBadge" TargetType="Border">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#DEDEE4"/>
      <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="8"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="6,0,6,1"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="7,0,0,0"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="TabBadgeText" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="Normal"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#6E6E73"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="NavItem" TargetType="ListBoxItem">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Stretch"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,0,2"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListBoxItem">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" CornerRadius="7" Padding="10,7" Background="Transparent">
              <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E8E8ED"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsSelected" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E3EEFF"/>
                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#0A5BC4"/>
                <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
              </Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 侧边栏导航 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="Nav" TargetType="RadioButton">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13.5"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,0,3"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="RadioButton">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" CornerRadius="8" Padding="11,8" Background="Transparent">
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                <TextBlock x:Name="Glyph" Text="{Binding Tag, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}"
                           FontSize="15" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,11,0"/>
                <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E1E1E6"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Glyph" Property="Foreground" Value="White"/>
                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="White"/>
                <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
              </Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- 侧边栏分组标题下面的项：比标题缩进一点 -->
    <Style x:Key="NavSub" TargetType="RadioButton" BasedOn="{StaticResource Nav}">
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="10,0,0,3"/>
    </Style>
    <!-- ===== 分段控件（单选） ===== -->
    <!-- 外观选择：每种外观一张缩略图（浅色、深色、跟随系统），下面写名字；选中的那张描蓝边 -->
    <Style x:Key="ThemeCard" TargetType="RadioButton">
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,16,0"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="RadioButton">
            <ContentPresenter Margin="0" Cursor="Hand"/>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="ThemePic" TargetType="Border">
      <Setter Property="Width" Value="120"/>
      <Setter Property="Height" Value="80"/>
      <Setter Property="CornerRadius" Value="12"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="2"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="2"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#E5E5EA"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent"/>
      <Style.Triggers>
        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding IsMouseOver, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=RadioButton}}" Value="True"><Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#C7C7CC"/></DataTrigger>
        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding IsChecked, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=RadioButton}}" Value="True"><Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#0071E3"/></DataTrigger>
      </Style.Triggers>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="ThemeLbl" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12.5"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#3A3A3C"/>
      <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Center"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,8,0,0"/>
      <Style.Triggers>
        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding IsChecked, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=RadioButton}}" Value="True"><Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/><Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#0066CC"/></DataTrigger>
      </Style.Triggers>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="Seg" TargetType="RadioButton">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12.5"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="RadioButton">
            <Grid>
              <!-- 和前一项之间的细竖线：第一项（Uid=first）、选中的、鼠标在上面的不画 -->
              <Rectangle x:Name="Sep" Width="1" Fill="#C9C9CF" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="0,6"/>
              <Border x:Name="Bd" CornerRadius="6" Padding="12,4,12,5" Margin="1,0,0,0" Background="Transparent">
                <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              </Border>
            </Grid>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="Uid" Value="first"><Setter TargetName="Sep" Property="Visibility" Value="Hidden"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="Uid" Value="nosep"><Setter TargetName="Sep" Property="Visibility" Value="Hidden"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Sep" Property="Visibility" Value="Hidden"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Sep" Property="Visibility" Value="Hidden"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#DEDEE4"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#FEFEFE"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Effect"><Setter.Value><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="4" ShadowDepth="1" Direction="270" Opacity="0.16"/></Setter.Value></Setter>
                <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
              </Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.4"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="ChipRadio" TargetType="RadioButton" BasedOn="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
    <!-- 每一行的「删除 / 搬到其他盘 / 跳过」：一个横排的列表当分段控件用，选中项绑定到这一行的操作 -->
    <Style x:Key="SegList" TargetType="ListBox">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#EBEBF0"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0"/>
      <Setter Property="Focusable" Value="False"/>
      <Setter Property="ItemsPanel">
        <Setter.Value><ItemsPanelTemplate><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"/></ItemsPanelTemplate></Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListBox">
            <Border Background="{TemplateBinding Background}" CornerRadius="8" Padding="2"><ItemsPresenter/></Border>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
      <Setter Property="ItemContainerStyle">
        <Setter.Value>
          <Style TargetType="ListBoxItem">
            <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
            <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12.5"/>
            <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#3A3A3C"/>
            <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
            <Setter Property="Template">
              <Setter.Value>
                <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListBoxItem">
                  <Border x:Name="Bd" CornerRadius="6" Padding="11,4,11,5" Background="Transparent">
                    <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                  </Border>
                  <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                    <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#DEDEE4"/></Trigger>
                    <Trigger Property="IsSelected" Value="True">
                      <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#FEFEFE"/>
                      <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Effect"><Setter.Value><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="4" ShadowDepth="1" Direction="270" Opacity="0.16"/></Setter.Value></Setter>
                      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
                      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
                    </Trigger>
                    <MultiTrigger>
                      <MultiTrigger.Conditions><Condition Property="IsSelected" Value="True"/><Condition Property="Content" Value="删除"/></MultiTrigger.Conditions>
                      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#D70015"/>
                    </MultiTrigger>
                    <MultiTrigger>
                      <MultiTrigger.Conditions><Condition Property="IsSelected" Value="True"/><Condition Property="Content" Value="搬到其他盘"/></MultiTrigger.Conditions>
                      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#0071E3"/>
                    </MultiTrigger>
                    <MultiTrigger>
                      <MultiTrigger.Conditions><Condition Property="IsSelected" Value="True"/><Condition Property="Content" Value="执行"/></MultiTrigger.Conditions>
                      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#0071E3"/>
                    </MultiTrigger>
                  </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                </ControlTemplate>
              </Setter.Value>
            </Setter>
          </Style>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 文件类型胶囊（多选） ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="Chip" TargetType="ToggleButton">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12.5"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,6,6"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ToggleButton">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" CornerRadius="13" Padding="12,4,12,5" Background="#F2F2F7">
              <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E5E5EA"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="White"/>
              </Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.4"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 勾选框：圆角小方块，勾上变蓝 ===== -->
    <Style TargetType="CheckBox">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="CheckBox">
            <Grid Background="Transparent">
              <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <Border x:Name="Box" Width="17" Height="17" CornerRadius="4.5" BorderThickness="1" BorderBrush="#B8B8BE" Background="White" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <Grid>
                  <Path x:Name="Mark" Data="M 3.5 7.6 L 6.5 10.6 L 11.6 4.8" Stroke="White" StrokeThickness="2"
                        StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round" StrokeLineJoin="Round" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
                  <Path x:Name="Dash" Data="M 4.5 7.5 L 10.5 7.5" Stroke="White" StrokeThickness="2" StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
                </Grid>
              </Border>
              <ContentPresenter x:Name="CP" Grid.Column="1" Margin="9,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" RecognizesAccessKey="False"/>
            </Grid>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Box" Property="BorderBrush" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Box" Property="Background" Value="#E8F1FC"/>
              </Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Box" Property="Background" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Box" Property="BorderBrush" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Mark" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/>
              </Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="{x:Null}">
                <Setter TargetName="Box" Property="Background" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Box" Property="BorderBrush" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Dash" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/>
              </Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="HasContent" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="CP" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.45"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 右键菜单 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="Menu" TargetType="ContextMenu">
      <Setter Property="OverridesDefaultStyle" Value="True"/>
      <Setter Property="SnapsToDevicePixels" Value="True"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ContextMenu">
            <Border Background="White" BorderBrush="#D2D2D7" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="8" Padding="4" Margin="0,0,8,8">
              <Border.Effect><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="12" ShadowDepth="2" Direction="270" Opacity="0.18"/></Border.Effect>
              <StackPanel IsItemsHost="True" KeyboardNavigation.DirectionalNavigation="Cycle"/>
            </Border>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="MenuRow" TargetType="MenuItem">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="MenuItem">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" Background="Transparent" CornerRadius="5" Padding="12,6,28,6" MinWidth="180">
              <ContentPresenter ContentSource="Header" RecognizesAccessKey="False" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsHighlighted" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E8F1FC"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.4"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="MenuSep" TargetType="Separator">
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Separator">
            <Border Height="1" Background="#E5E5EA" Margin="8,4"/>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 输入框 ===== -->
    <Style TargetType="TextBox">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="White"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#D2D2D7"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="8,0"/>
      <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="30"/>
      <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="TextBox">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" Background="{TemplateBinding Background}" BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="7">
              <ScrollViewer x:Name="PART_ContentHost" Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Focusable="False"
                            HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Hidden" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Hidden"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="BorderBrush" Value="#AEAEB2"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsKeyboardFocused" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="BorderBrush" Value="#0071E3"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <!-- 运行记录用系统默认的多行文本框（有滚动条），只改颜色 -->
    <Style x:Key="LogBox" TargetType="TextBox">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#3A3A3C"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="White"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0"/>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 下拉框 ===== -->
    <Style TargetType="ComboBoxItem">
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="9,6"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ComboBoxItem">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" CornerRadius="5" Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}" Background="Transparent">
              <ContentPresenter/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsHighlighted" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="White"/>
              </Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style TargetType="ComboBox">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="30"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ComboBox">
            <Grid>
              <ToggleButton x:Name="Toggle" Focusable="False" ClickMode="Press"
                            IsChecked="{Binding IsDropDownOpen, Mode=TwoWay, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                <ToggleButton.Template>
                  <ControlTemplate TargetType="ToggleButton">
                    <Border x:Name="Bd" Background="White" BorderBrush="#D2D2D7" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="7">
                      <TextBlock Text="&#xE70D;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#6E6E73"
                                 HorizontalAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,11,0"/>
                    </Border>
                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                      <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="BorderBrush" Value="#AEAEB2"/></Trigger>
                      <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="BorderBrush" Value="#0071E3"/></Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                  </ControlTemplate>
                </ToggleButton.Template>
              </ToggleButton>
              <ContentPresenter IsHitTestVisible="False" Content="{TemplateBinding SelectionBoxItem}" ContentTemplate="{TemplateBinding SelectionBoxItemTemplate}"
                                Margin="11,4,30,4" VerticalAlignment="Center" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
              <Popup x:Name="PART_Popup" Placement="Bottom" AllowsTransparency="True" Focusable="False" PopupAnimation="Fade"
                     IsOpen="{Binding IsDropDownOpen, Mode=TwoWay, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                <Border Background="White" BorderBrush="#D2D2D7" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="9" Padding="4" Margin="0,4,12,14"
                        MinWidth="{Binding ActualWidth, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                  <Border.Effect><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="18" ShadowDepth="3" Direction="270" Opacity="0.16"/></Border.Effect>
                  <ScrollViewer MaxHeight="{TemplateBinding MaxDropDownHeight}" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
                    <StackPanel IsItemsHost="True" KeyboardNavigation.DirectionalNavigation="Contained"/>
                  </ScrollViewer>
                </Border>
              </Popup>
            </Grid>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.45"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 细滚动条 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="SlimThumb" TargetType="Thumb">
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Thumb">
            <Border x:Name="T" Background="#C7C7CC" CornerRadius="4" Margin="2"/>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="T" Property="Background" Value="#AEAEB2"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsDragging" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="T" Property="Background" Value="#8E8E93"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style TargetType="ScrollBar">
      <Setter Property="Width" Value="11"/>
      <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="11"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="Transparent"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ScrollBar">
            <Grid Background="Transparent">
              <Track x:Name="PART_Track" Orientation="Vertical" IsDirectionReversed="True">
                <Track.Thumb><Thumb Style="{StaticResource SlimThumb}"/></Track.Thumb>
              </Track>
            </Grid>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
      <Style.Triggers>
        <Trigger Property="Orientation" Value="Horizontal">
          <Setter Property="Width" Value="Auto"/>
          <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="0"/>
          <Setter Property="Height" Value="11"/>
          <Setter Property="MinHeight" Value="11"/>
          <Setter Property="Template">
            <Setter.Value>
              <ControlTemplate TargetType="ScrollBar">
                <Grid Background="Transparent">
                  <Track x:Name="PART_Track" Orientation="Horizontal" IsDirectionReversed="False">
                    <Track.Thumb><Thumb Style="{StaticResource SlimThumb}"/></Track.Thumb>
                  </Track>
                </Grid>
              </ControlTemplate>
            </Setter.Value>
          </Setter>
        </Trigger>
      </Style.Triggers>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 进度条：圆角细条；不确定进度时轻轻闪烁 ===== -->
    <Style TargetType="ProgressBar">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#0071E3"/>
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="#E5E5EA"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ProgressBar">
            <Grid>
              <Border x:Name="PART_Track" Background="{TemplateBinding Background}" CornerRadius="3"/>
              <Border x:Name="PART_Indicator" Background="{TemplateBinding Foreground}" CornerRadius="3" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
            </Grid>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsIndeterminate" Value="True">
                <Trigger.EnterActions>
                  <BeginStoryboard x:Name="Pulse">
                    <Storyboard RepeatBehavior="Forever" AutoReverse="True">
                      <DoubleAnimation Storyboard.TargetName="PART_Indicator" Storyboard.TargetProperty="Opacity" From="0.25" To="0.85" Duration="0:0:0.8"/>
                    </Storyboard>
                  </BeginStoryboard>
                </Trigger.EnterActions>
                <Trigger.ExitActions><StopStoryboard BeginStoryboardName="Pulse"/></Trigger.ExitActions>
              </Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <Style TargetType="ToolTip">
      <Setter Property="Background" Value="White"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="#D2D2D7"/>
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="9,6"/>
      <Setter Property="MaxWidth" Value="420"/>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 查找条件的折叠面板：左边一个小箭头，展开时转向下 ===== -->
    <Style TargetType="Expander">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Expander">
            <DockPanel>
              <ToggleButton DockPanel.Dock="Top" Focusable="False" Cursor="Hand" Content="{TemplateBinding Header}"
                            IsChecked="{Binding IsExpanded, Mode=TwoWay, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}">
                <ToggleButton.Template>
                  <ControlTemplate TargetType="ToggleButton">
                    <Border Background="Transparent" Padding="2,6">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <TextBlock x:Name="Chev" DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="11"
                                   Foreground="#6E6E73" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,1,10,0" RenderTransformOrigin="0.5,0.5">
                          <TextBlock.RenderTransform><RotateTransform Angle="0"/></TextBlock.RenderTransform>
                        </TextBlock>
                        <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                      <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                        <Setter TargetName="Chev" Property="RenderTransform"><Setter.Value><RotateTransform Angle="90"/></Setter.Value></Setter>
                      </Trigger>
                    </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
                  </ControlTemplate>
                </ToggleButton.Template>
              </ToggleButton>
              <ContentPresenter x:Name="Body" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
            </DockPanel>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsExpanded" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Body" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>

    <!-- ===== 清理列表：每组一张圆角白卡片，行之间一条细线 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="CardGroup" TargetType="GroupItem">
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="GroupItem">
            <StackPanel Margin="0,0,0,22">
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="4,0,0,8">
                <TextBlock Text="{Binding Items[0].GroupTitle}" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F"/>
                <Border Background="#E5E5EA" CornerRadius="8" Padding="7,0" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                  <TextBlock Text="{Binding ItemCount, StringFormat='{}{0} 项'}" FontSize="12" Foreground="#3A3A3C"/>
                </Border>
                <TextBlock Text="{Binding Items[0].GroupNote}" FontSize="12" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="10,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Bottom"/>
              </StackPanel>
              <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="12" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="1" Padding="0,2">
                <ItemsPresenter/>
              </Border>
            </StackPanel>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="PlainRow" TargetType="ListViewItem">
      <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Stretch"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListViewItem">
            <Grid Background="Transparent">
              <Rectangle x:Name="Sep" Height="1" Fill="#E5E5EA" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="18,0,0,0"/>
              <ContentPresenter/>
            </Grid>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <!-- 显示出来的第一行不画分隔线：列表要设 AlternationCount（很大），排序、筛选以后按显示的顺序算 -->
              <Trigger Property="ItemsControl.AlternationIndex" Value="0"><Setter TargetName="Sep" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <DataTemplate x:Key="CleanRow">
      <Grid Margin="18,12,14,12">
        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="CleanSize"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="CleanAct"/>
        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Margin="0,0,18,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontSize="13.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F"/>
          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Note}" FontSize="12" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,3,0,0"/>
          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Status}" Foreground="{Binding StatusBrush}" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,5,0,0">
            <TextBlock.Style>
              <Style TargetType="TextBlock">
                <Style.Triggers>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Status}" Value=""><Setter Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                </Style.Triggers>
              </Style>
            </TextBlock.Style>
          </TextBlock>
        </StackPanel>
        <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding SizeText}" FontSize="13.5" Foreground="#1D1D1F" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                   MinWidth="90" TextAlignment="Right" Margin="0,0,18,0"/>
        <ListBox Grid.Column="2" ItemsSource="{Binding Actions}" SelectedItem="{Binding Action, Mode=TwoWay}" Style="{StaticResource SegList}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
      </Grid>
    </DataTemplate>

    <!-- ===== 重复文件结果表 ===== -->
    <Style TargetType="GridViewColumnHeader">
      <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Left"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#6E6E73"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="GridViewColumnHeader">
            <Grid>
              <Border Background="White" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="0,0,0,1" Padding="6,8,6,7">
                <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="{TemplateBinding HorizontalContentAlignment}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              </Border>
              <Thumb x:Name="PART_HeaderGripper" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Width="9" Margin="0,0,-4,0" Cursor="SizeWE">
                <Thumb.Template>
                  <ControlTemplate TargetType="Thumb">
                    <Border Background="Transparent"><Rectangle Width="1" Fill="#E5E5EA" HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,8"/></Border>
                  </ControlTemplate>
                </Thumb.Template>
              </Thumb>
            </Grid>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="GridRow" TargetType="ListViewItem">
      <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0,5"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListViewItem">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" Background="Transparent" Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}">
              <GridViewRowPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center" Columns="{TemplateBinding GridView.ColumnCollection}"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#F5F5F7"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsSelected" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E8F1FC"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="RootRow" TargetType="ListBoxItem">
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,6,6"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListBoxItem"><ContentPresenter/></ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <!-- 查找位置：和文件类型一样的胶囊，勾上变蓝；自己加的文件夹带一个小叉可以移除 -->
    <Style x:Key="PillCheck" TargetType="CheckBox">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12.5"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="CheckBox">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" CornerRadius="13" Padding="12,4,12,5" Background="#F2F2F7">
              <ContentPresenter VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E5E5EA"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#0071E3"/>
                <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="White"/>
              </Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="PillX" TargetType="Button">
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="AutomationProperties.Name" Value="{Binding ToolTip, RelativeSource={RelativeSource Self}}"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" Width="16" Height="16" CornerRadius="8" Background="Transparent">
              <TextBlock Text="&#xE711;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="8" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#26000000"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <!-- ===== 侧边栏分组标题 ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="NavHead" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="12"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#636366"/>
      <Setter Property="Margin" Value="4,14,0,5"/>
    </Style>
    <!-- ===== 开关（勾选框的另一种样子） ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="Switch" TargetType="CheckBox">
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
      <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="CheckBox">
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Background="Transparent">
              <Grid Width="40" Height="24" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                <Border x:Name="Track" CornerRadius="12" Background="#D1D1D6"/>
                <Ellipse x:Name="Knob" Width="20" Height="20" Fill="White" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="2,0,0,0">
                  <Ellipse.Effect><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="3" ShadowDepth="1" Direction="270" Opacity="0.25"/></Ellipse.Effect>
                </Ellipse>
              </Grid>
              <ContentPresenter x:Name="CP" Margin="10,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </StackPanel>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
                <Setter TargetName="Track" Property="Background" Value="#34C759"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Knob" Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Right"/>
                <Setter TargetName="Knob" Property="Margin" Value="0,0,2,0"/>
              </Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="HasContent" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="CP" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"><Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.45"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <!-- ===== 可以选中的列表行（空间地图、软件、搬家记录） ===== -->
    <Style x:Key="SelRow" TargetType="ListViewItem">
      <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Stretch"/>
      <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{StaticResource FocusRing}"/>
      <Setter Property="Template">
        <Setter.Value>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListViewItem">
            <Border x:Name="Bd" Background="Transparent" CornerRadius="8" Margin="6,1">
              <ContentPresenter/>
            </Border>
            <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
              <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#F5F5F7"/></Trigger>
              <Trigger Property="IsSelected" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Bd" Property="Background" Value="#E8F1FC"/></Trigger>
            </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Setter.Value>
      </Setter>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="CardHead" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="15"/>
      <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="SemiBold"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#1D1D1F"/>
    </Style>
    <Style x:Key="Body" TargetType="TextBlock">
      <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13"/>
      <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="#3A3A3C"/>
      <Setter Property="TextWrapping" Value="Wrap"/>
      <Setter Property="LineHeight" Value="21"/>
      <Setter Property="MaxWidth" Value="860"/>
      <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Left"/>
    </Style>
    <!-- 系统健康里的一条记录（事件、拖慢开机的程序、驱动）：第一行加粗，详细说明在下面一行，右边是次数和时间，行与行之间一条细线 -->
    <DataTemplate x:Key="NoteRowTpl">
      <Border BorderBrush="#EFEFF4" BorderThickness="0,0,0,1" Padding="0,10,0,10">
        <DockPanel>
          <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" Text="{Binding Body}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="18,1,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Top"/>
          <StackPanel>
            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Head}" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap" LineHeight="20"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="Sub" Text="{Binding Sub}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap" LineHeight="19" Margin="0,3,0,0" ToolTip="{Binding Path}"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>
      <DataTemplate.Triggers>
        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Sub}" Value="{x:Null}"><Setter TargetName="Sub" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Sub}" Value=""><Setter TargetName="Sub" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
      </DataTemplate.Triggers>
    </DataTemplate>
    <!-- 空间地图的一行：图标、名字、占比条、大小、百分比 -->
    <DataTemplate x:Key="CandRowTpl">
      <Grid Margin="14,11,14,11">
        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="30"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="100"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="CandAct"/>
        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <CheckBox x:Name="Ck" Grid.Column="0" IsChecked="{Binding Checked, Mode=TwoWay, UpdateSourceTrigger=PropertyChanged}" IsEnabled="{Binding CanMove}" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
        <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Margin="0,0,14,0">
          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontSize="13.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
          <TextBlock Text="{Binding PathText}" FontSize="12" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,2,0,0" ToolTip="{Binding PathText}"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="Nt" Text="{Binding Note}" FontSize="12" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,3,0,0"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="St" Text="{Binding Status}" Foreground="{Binding StatusBrush}" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{Binding SizeText}" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
        <Button x:Name="CandOpen" Grid.Column="3" Content="打开" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
      </Grid>
      <DataTemplate.Triggers>
        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Status}" Value=""><Setter TargetName="St" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Note}" Value=""><Setter TargetName="Nt" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding CanMove}" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="Ck" Property="Visibility" Value="Hidden"/></DataTrigger>
      </DataTemplate.Triggers>
    </DataTemplate>
    <DataTemplate x:Key="MapRowTpl">
      <Grid Margin="12,7,14,7">
        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="MapCk"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="30"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="MapBar"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="92"/>
          <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="MapPct"/>
        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <!-- 项目复选框：和这一行是否选中绑在一起，点它只增减这一行，不影响其他已选的行 -->
        <CheckBox x:Name="Ck" Grid.Column="0" Visibility="{DynamicResource MapCkVis}" Focusable="False" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,12,0" Cursor="Hand"
                  IsChecked="{Binding IsSelected, Mode=TwoWay, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=ListViewItem}}"/>
        <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding Glyph}" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="{Binding GlyphBrush}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
        <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Margin="0,0,14,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
          <DockPanel>
            <TextBlock x:Name="Lk" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Text="&#xE72E;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="11" Foreground="#6E6E73"
                       Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Visibility="Collapsed" ToolTip="{Binding LockTip}"/>
            <Border x:Name="Mk" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Background="#FDEBEC" CornerRadius="6" Padding="6,0,6,1" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Visibility="Collapsed" ToolTip="已经在待删清单里">
              <TextBlock Text="待删" FontSize="12" Foreground="#C0101C"/>
            </Border>
            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontSize="13.5" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" ToolTip="{Binding Path}"/>
          </DockPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Meta}" FontSize="12" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,1,0,0" Visibility="{DynamicResource MapMetaVis}" ToolTip="{Binding Meta}"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <Border Grid.Column="3" Height="8" Width="160" Margin="0,0,12,0" CornerRadius="4" Background="#EFEFF4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Center" Visibility="{DynamicResource MapBarVis}">
          <Border Width="{Binding Bar}" HorizontalAlignment="Left" CornerRadius="4" Background="#0071E3"/>
        </Border>
        <TextBlock Grid.Column="4" Text="{Binding SizeText}" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
        <TextBlock Grid.Column="5" Width="58" Text="{Binding Pct}" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Visibility="{DynamicResource MapPctVis}"/>
      </Grid>
      <DataTemplate.Triggers>
        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Locked}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Lk" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Marked}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="Mk" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Kind}" Value="type"><Setter TargetName="Ck" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Kind}" Value="recent"><Setter TargetName="Ck" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
      </DataTemplate.Triggers>
    </DataTemplate>
  </Window.Resources>

  <Grid x:Name="Root">
    <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
      <ColumnDefinition Width="220"/>
      <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
    </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
      <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
      <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
    </Grid.RowDefinitions>

    <!-- ==================== 侧边栏 ==================== -->
    <Border Grid.Column="0" Grid.RowSpan="3" Background="#ECECF0" BorderBrush="#DCDCE1" BorderThickness="0,0,1,0">
      <DockPanel Margin="14,20,14,16">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Top" Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="6,0,0,26">
          <Border Width="36" Height="36" CornerRadius="9">
            <Border.Background>
              <LinearGradientBrush StartPoint="0,0" EndPoint="0,1">
                <GradientStop Color="#3A9BFF" Offset="0"/>
                <GradientStop Color="#0062D6" Offset="1"/>
              </LinearGradientBrush>
            </Border.Background>
            <TextBlock Text="&#xEDA2;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="18" Foreground="White" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
          </Border>
          <StackPanel Margin="11,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
            <TextBlock Text="腾挪 ClearC" FontSize="15" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Ideal"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="AppVer" Text="" FontSize="12" Foreground="#636366" Margin="0,1,0,0"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="ModeTag" Text="" FontSize="12" Foreground="#0066CC" Margin="0,1,0,0" Cursor="Hand" ToolTip="点一下到设置里换模式"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Bottom">
          <Button x:Name="BtnTheme" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Foreground="#636366" Padding="11,6" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
              <TextBlock Text="&#xE706;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="13" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,9,0"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="BtnThemeText" Text="外观：浅色" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Button>
          <Button x:Name="BtnLang" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Foreground="#636366" Padding="11,6" HorizontalAlignment="Left" ToolTip="中文 / English">
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
              <TextBlock Text="&#xE774;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="13" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,9,0"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="BtnLangText" Text="English" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Button>
          <Button x:Name="BtnFeedback" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Foreground="#636366" Padding="11,6" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
              <TextBlock Text="&#xE8BD;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="13" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,9,0"/>
              <TextBlock Text="使用反馈" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Button>
          <Button x:Name="BtnLog" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Foreground="#636366" Padding="11,6" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
              <TextBlock Text="&#xE8A5;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="13" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,9,0"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="BtnLogText" Text="运行记录" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Button>
        </StackPanel>
        <!-- 窗口矮的时候（比如笔记本 150% 缩放）放不下全部页面：这一栏可以上下滚动，「设置」不会被挤掉 -->
        <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="清理" Style="{StaticResource NavHead}" Margin="4,0,0,5"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavClean" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource NavSub}" Tag="&#xEDA2;" Content="清理 C 盘" IsChecked="True"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavDup" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource NavSub}" Tag="&#xE8C8;" Content="重复文件"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavSave" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource NavSub}" Tag="&#xE7B8;" Content="省空间"/>
          <TextBlock Text="分析" Style="{StaticResource NavHead}"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavMap" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource NavSub}" Tag="&#xE9D9;" Content="空间地图"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavApps" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource NavSub}" Tag="&#xE71D;" Content="软件管理"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavHealth" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource NavSub}" Tag="&#xE95E;" Content="系统健康"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="NavHeadManage" Text="管理" Style="{StaticResource NavHead}"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavMoves" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource NavSub}" Tag="&#xE8AB;" Content="搬家管理"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavAuto" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource NavSub}" Tag="&#xE823;" Content="自动提醒"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavLog" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource NavSub}" Tag="&#xE81C;" Content="操作日志"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavHelp" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource Nav}" Tag="&#xE897;" Content="帮助" Margin="0,12,0,3"/>
          <RadioButton x:Name="NavSettings" GroupName="nav" Style="{StaticResource Nav}" Tag="&#xE713;" Content="设置"/>
        </StackPanel>
        </ScrollViewer>
      </DockPanel>
    </Border>

    <!-- ==================== 清理 C 盘 ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageClean" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Margin="30,24,30,14">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
      </Grid.RowDefinitions>

      <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,18">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0">
          <Button x:Name="BtnCleanCustom" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="自定义清理项…" Margin="0,0,14,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" ToolTip="自己加要清理的文件夹，或者排除不想碰的文件夹（在「设置」里）"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnHogs" Content="分析占用" Margin="0,0,8,0" ToolTip="打开「空间地图」扫描 C 盘，看清哪些文件夹和文件最占地方"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnScan" Content="扫描"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="清理 C 盘" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="Hint" Style="{StaticResource PageSub}"
                     Text="一键清理缓存和临时文件，或者先扫描，再逐项选择。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </DockPanel>

      <!-- 容量卡片、搬家目标和清理列表放在同一个滚动区里，整页一起滚；分类选项卡和表头滚到顶上就停住 -->
      <Grid x:Name="CleanHost" Grid.Row="1" Grid.IsSharedSizeScope="True" ClipToBounds="True">
      <ScrollViewer x:Name="CleanScroll" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False" Padding="0,0,6,0">
      <StackPanel>
      <!-- 存储空间：已用 / 可释放 / 可用 -->
      <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="22,18" Margin="0,0,0,14">
        <DockPanel>
          <Button x:Name="BtnOneClick" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Content="一键清理" FontSize="14" Padding="24,9"
                  VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="28,0,0,0"
                  ToolTip="自动扫描，清掉所有安全项和默认选中的缓存、临时文件。只删不搬：聊天记录在下面单独一张卡片里，要搬自己点。不会关闭休眠、不清空回收站，个人文件夹（桌面、文档、下载等）里的东西一律不删。"/>
          <StackPanel>
            <DockPanel>
              <TextBlock x:Name="CapTotal" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Foreground="#6E6E73" VerticalAlignment="Bottom" Margin="12,0,0,3"/>
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                <TextBlock x:Name="CapFree" Text="—" FontSize="24" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Ideal"/>
                <TextBlock Text="可用" FontSize="14" Foreground="#6E6E73" VerticalAlignment="Bottom" Margin="8,0,0,4"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </DockPanel>
            <Border Height="10" CornerRadius="5" Background="#E5E5EA" Margin="0,11,0,10">
              <Grid x:Name="CapBar">
                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <ColumnDefinition Width="1*"/>
                  <ColumnDefinition Width="0*"/>
                  <ColumnDefinition Width="1*"/>
                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <Border Grid.Column="0" Background="#8E8E93" CornerRadius="5,0,0,5"/>
                <Border Grid.Column="1" Background="#0071E3"/>
              </Grid>
            </Border>
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
              <Ellipse Width="8" Height="8" Fill="#8E8E93" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              <TextBlock Text="已用" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="6,0,18,0"/>
              <Ellipse Width="8" Height="8" Fill="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="CapReclaim" Text="可释放（扫描后显示）" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="6,0,18,0"/>
              <Ellipse Width="8" Height="8" Fill="#D1D1D6" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              <TextBlock Text="可用" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="6,0,0,0"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </StackPanel>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>

      <!-- 搬家目标 -->
      <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="18,12" Margin="0,0,0,20">
        <StackPanel>
          <DockPanel LastChildFill="False">
            <TextBlock Text="&#xE8B7;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,10,0"/>
            <TextBlock Text="搬家目标" FontWeight="SemiBold" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
            <ComboBox x:Name="DestPick" Width="380" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            <Button x:Name="BtnDestBrowse" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="选择文件夹…" Margin="14,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
          </DockPanel>
          <TextBlock x:Name="DestHint" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="26,7,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                     Text="聊天记录等搬到这里，C 盘原位置留一个链接，软件照常使用。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>

      <!-- 聊天记录：一键清理只删不搬，所以聊天记录单独一张卡片，要搬就在这里点 -->
      <Border x:Name="ChatCard" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="18,14" Margin="0,0,0,20" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <DockPanel>
          <Button x:Name="BtnChatMove" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="搬走聊天记录…" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
          <TextBlock Text="&#xE8BD;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,1,10,0"/>
          <StackPanel>
            <TextBlock x:Name="ChatCardTitle" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="ChatCardText" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,5,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>

      <!-- 扫描结果总览：一共几类、每类几项，一眼看出下面还有很多 -->
      <Border x:Name="CleanOverview" Background="#EAF3FF" CornerRadius="10" Padding="14,10" Margin="0,0,0,16" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <DockPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="&#xE8FD;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="15" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,1,10,0"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="CleanOverviewText" TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#1D1D1F" LineHeight="20"/>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>
      <!-- 分类选项卡和表头占的位置：真正的那一排浮在列表上面（CleanBar），滚过头以后停在顶上 -->
      <Border x:Name="CleanBarSlot" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
      <!-- 列表自己不滚动（没有内部滚动条），只显示选中的那一类，跟着整页滚 -->
      <Border x:Name="CleanListCard" Background="White" CornerRadius="0,0,12,12" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="1,0,1,1" Padding="0,0,0,2" Margin="0,0,0,8" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <StackPanel>
      <ListView x:Name="List" Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" Padding="0" AlternationCount="1000000"
                ItemTemplate="{StaticResource CleanRow}" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource PlainRow}">
        <ListView.ContextMenu>
          <ContextMenu x:Name="CleanMenu" Style="{StaticResource Menu}">
            <MenuItem x:Name="CmOpen" Header="打开所在文件夹" Style="{StaticResource MenuRow}"/>
            <MenuItem x:Name="CmOpenAll" Header="打开全部位置" Style="{StaticResource MenuRow}"/>
            <MenuItem x:Name="CmCopy" Header="复制路径" Style="{StaticResource MenuRow}"/>
          </ContextMenu>
        </ListView.ContextMenu>
        <ListView.Template>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="ListView"><ItemsPresenter/></ControlTemplate>
        </ListView.Template>
      </ListView>
      <TextBlock x:Name="CleanFilterEmpty" Text="这一类里没有这种操作的项目，换一个操作看看" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="18,16,18,16" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
      </StackPanel>
      </Border>
      <StackPanel x:Name="EmptyClean" HorizontalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,40,0,40" IsHitTestVisible="False">
        <TextBlock Text="&#xE721;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="34" Foreground="#C7C7CC" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
        <TextBlock x:Name="EmptyCleanText" Text="点「扫描」看看 C 盘里有什么可以清理" Foreground="#6E6E73" FontSize="14" Margin="0,12,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
      </StackPanel>
      </StackPanel>
      </ScrollViewer>
      <!-- 分类选项卡和表头：平时就在列表上面；往下滚到它碰到顶边以后就停在那里，下面的列表照常滚 -->
      <Border x:Name="CleanBar" VerticalAlignment="Top" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Background="#F5F5F7" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <StackPanel>
          <DockPanel Margin="0,0,0,8">
            <Button x:Name="BtnCleanSkipTab" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="这一类全部跳过" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="14,0,4,0"
                    ToolTip="把这个选项卡里的项目都改成「跳过」；再点一次恢复默认的选择"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="CleanTabInfo" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="14,0,4,0"/>
            <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" VerticalAlignment="Center">
              <WrapPanel x:Name="CleanTabs"/>
            </Border>
          </DockPanel>
          <TextBlock x:Name="CleanTabNote" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="4,0,4,8"/>
          <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="12,12,0,0" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="1,1,1,0">
            <Border Style="{StaticResource HeadBar}">
              <Grid x:Name="CleanHead" Margin="18,0,14,0">
                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                  <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="CleanSize"/>
                  <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="CleanAct"/>
                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <Button Grid.Column="0" Tag="name" Content="名称" Style="{StaticResource ColHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                <Button Grid.Column="1" Tag="size" Content="大小" Style="{StaticResource ColHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Margin="0,0,18,0"/>
                <ComboBox Grid.Column="2" x:Name="CleanOpFilter" MinWidth="150" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,2,0,2" ToolTip="只看某一种操作的项目，比如只看要删除的、只看跳过的。排序不变"/>
              </Grid>
            </Border>
          </Border>
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>
      <!-- 下面还有内容时浮在底部的提示，点一下往下翻一屏 -->
      <Button x:Name="CleanMore" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Bottom" Margin="0,0,0,10" Visibility="Collapsed" Cursor="Hand" ToolTip="往下翻一屏">
        <Button.Template>
          <ControlTemplate TargetType="Button">
            <Border Background="#1D1D1F" CornerRadius="16" Padding="16,7">
              <Border.Effect><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="14" ShadowDepth="3" Direction="270" Opacity="0.25"/></Border.Effect>
              <ContentPresenter/>
            </Border>
          </ControlTemplate>
        </Button.Template>
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
          <TextBlock x:Name="CleanMoreText" Foreground="White" FontSize="12.5" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
          <TextBlock Text="&#xE74B;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" Foreground="White" FontSize="12" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,1,0,0"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </Button>
      </Grid>

      <DockPanel Grid.Row="2" Margin="0,14,0,0">
        <Button x:Name="BtnRun" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Content="开始处理所选项" Padding="22,8" IsEnabled="False"/>
        <TextBlock x:Name="Summary" Text="" VerticalAlignment="Center" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="2,0,16,0"/>
      </DockPanel>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 重复文件 ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageDup" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Margin="30,24,30,14" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
      </Grid.RowDefinitions>

      <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,14">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0">
          <Button x:Name="BtnDupStop" Content="停止" Margin="0,0,8,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnDupScan" Content="开始查找" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Padding="20,6"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="重复文件" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="找出内容完全相同的文件，每组留一份。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </DockPanel>

      <!-- 查找条件：一类一个选项卡（选项卡上写着现在选的是什么）；点「开始查找」后收起来，只留这一排，结果占满下面 -->
      <Border Grid.Row="1" x:Name="DupFilterCard" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="0" Margin="0,0,0,12">
        <StackPanel>
          <DockPanel Margin="16,4,14,0">
            <Button x:Name="DupFilterToggle" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="收起" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="FilterSummary" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
            <WrapPanel>
              <RadioButton x:Name="DTabRoots" GroupName="dtab" Style="{StaticResource SubTab}" IsChecked="True">
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="查找位置"/><Border Style="{StaticResource TabBadge}" Background="#EFEFF4" Margin="8,0,0,0"><TextBlock x:Name="DTabRootsVal" Style="{StaticResource TabBadgeText}" MaxWidth="230" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></Border></StackPanel>
              </RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="DTabType" GroupName="dtab" Style="{StaticResource SubTab}">
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="文件类型"/><Border Style="{StaticResource TabBadge}" Background="#EFEFF4" Margin="8,0,0,0"><TextBlock x:Name="DTabTypeVal" Style="{StaticResource TabBadgeText}" MaxWidth="230" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></Border></StackPanel>
              </RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="DTabSize" GroupName="dtab" Style="{StaticResource SubTab}">
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="文件大小"/><Border Style="{StaticResource TabBadge}" Background="#EFEFF4" Margin="8,0,0,0"><TextBlock x:Name="DTabSizeVal" Style="{StaticResource TabBadgeText}" MaxWidth="230" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></Border></StackPanel>
              </RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="DTabMode" GroupName="dtab" Style="{StaticResource SubTab}">
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="怎样算重复"/><Border Style="{StaticResource TabBadge}" Background="#EFEFF4" Margin="8,0,0,0"><TextBlock x:Name="DTabModeVal" Style="{StaticResource TabBadgeText}" MaxWidth="230" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></Border></StackPanel>
              </RadioButton>
            </WrapPanel>
          </DockPanel>
          <Border x:Name="DupFilterBody" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="0,1,0,0" Padding="20,12,20,12">
            <Grid>
              <StackPanel x:Name="DPaneRoots">
              <ListBox x:Name="Roots" BorderThickness="0" Background="Transparent" Padding="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource RootRow}"
                       ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" ScrollViewer.VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled">
                <ListBox.ItemsPanel><ItemsPanelTemplate><WrapPanel/></ItemsPanelTemplate></ListBox.ItemsPanel>
                <ListBox.ItemTemplate>
                  <DataTemplate>
                    <CheckBox IsChecked="{Binding Enabled, Mode=TwoWay}" Style="{StaticResource PillCheck}" ToolTip="{Binding Detail}">
                      <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding Label}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                        <Button x:Name="X" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource PillX}" Visibility="Collapsed" Margin="6,0,-5,0" ToolTip="不在这里找了，移除"/>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </CheckBox>
                    <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                      <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Removable}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="X" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
                    </DataTemplate.Triggers>
                  </DataTemplate>
                </ListBox.ItemTemplate>
              </ListBox>
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,0,0">
                <Button x:Name="BtnAddRoot" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="添加文件夹…" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                           Text="系统目录、Program Files、AppData 和开发环境（.git、node_modules、conda）会自动跳过。"/>
              </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
              <StackPanel x:Name="DPaneType" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <WrapPanel x:Name="TypeChips"/>
              <DockPanel Margin="0,2,0,0" MaxWidth="560" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="其他扩展名" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,0,10,0"/>
                <Button x:Name="TypeReset" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="全部重置" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
                <TextBox x:Name="ExtraExt" MinWidth="240" ToolTip="上面没有的类型，用空格隔开，例如 .dwg .step .sldprt"/>
              </DockPanel>
              </StackPanel>
              <StackPanel x:Name="DPaneSize" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}"><StackPanel x:Name="SizeChips" Orientation="Horizontal"/></Border>
              <StackPanel x:Name="SizeCustomRow" Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,9,0,0" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <TextBlock Text="从" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                <TextBox x:Name="SizeMin" Width="76"/>
                <ComboBox x:Name="SizeMinUnit" Width="66" Margin="6,0,0,0" SelectedIndex="1">
                  <ComboBoxItem Content="KB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="MB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="GB"/>
                </ComboBox>
                <TextBlock Text="到" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="16,0,8,0"/>
                <TextBox x:Name="SizeMax" Width="76"/>
                <ComboBox x:Name="SizeMaxUnit" Width="66" Margin="6,0,0,0" SelectedIndex="1">
                  <ComboBoxItem Content="KB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="MB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="GB"/>
                </ComboBox>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SizeHint" Text="留空表示不限" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="14,0,0,0"/>
              </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
              <StackPanel x:Name="DPaneMode" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <WrapPanel>
                <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" Margin="0,0,28,0">
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                    <RadioButton x:Name="ModeName" GroupName="dupmode" Content="名字和内容都相同" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                    <RadioButton x:Name="ModeContent" GroupName="dupmode" Content="只看内容，名字不同也算" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                    <RadioButton x:Name="ModeSimilar" GroupName="dupmode" Content="相似照片" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"
                                 ToolTip="找看起来一样的照片：不同分辨率、重新压缩过、轻微裁剪过的也算。只看 jpg、png、bmp、gif、tif、webp、heic。不是同一个文件，删之前自己看一眼"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </Border>
                <StackPanel x:Name="SimilarRow" Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,28,0" Visibility="Collapsed">
                  <TextBlock Text="相似程度" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,12,0"/>
                  <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                      <RadioButton x:Name="SimStrict" GroupName="simlvl" Content="几乎一样" Style="{StaticResource Seg}" ToolTip="64 位指纹相差 4 位以内：同一张照片的不同尺寸、不同压缩"/>
                      <RadioButton x:Name="SimNormal" GroupName="simlvl" Content="相似" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}" ToolTip="相差 8 位以内：加上轻微裁剪、调色"/>
                      <RadioButton x:Name="SimLoose" GroupName="simlvl" Content="大致相似" Style="{StaticResource Seg}" ToolTip="相差 12 位以内：连拍、构图相近的也会归到一起，误判会多"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                  <TextBlock Text="比对方式" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,12,0"/>
                  <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                      <RadioButton x:Name="SpeedFast" GroupName="dupspeed" Content="快速" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"
                                   ToolTip="16 MB 以内的文件读全文；更大的读头尾和 16 处抽样（每个约 1 MB）。删除前再逐字节完整比对。"/>
                      <RadioButton x:Name="SpeedExact" GroupName="dupspeed" Content="完整比对" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"
                                   ToolTip="每个可疑文件都读完全部内容。大视频多的时候会慢很多。"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                </StackPanel>
              </WrapPanel>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="2,8,0,0"
                         Text="快速模式下大文件只抽样读约 1 MB；删除前都会逐字节完整核对，有任何不同就不删。"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </Grid>
          </Border>
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>

      <!-- 结果 -->
      <Border Grid.Row="2" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="0,0,0,6">
        <DockPanel>
          <DockPanel DockPanel.Dock="Top" Margin="18,12,14,10">
            <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal">
              <TextBlock Text="每组只留一份：" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnKeepNew"  Style="{StaticResource Small}" Content="留最新的" Margin="0,0,6,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnKeepOld"  Style="{StaticResource Small}" Content="留最早的" Margin="0,0,6,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnPickC"    Style="{StaticResource Small}" Content="优先留 C 盘以外的" Margin="0,0,6,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnKeepIn"   Style="{StaticResource Small}" Content="留某个文件夹里的…" Margin="0,0,6,0" IsEnabled="False" ToolTip="选一个文件夹：每组优先保留在这个文件夹（含子文件夹）里的那份，其余勾上；这一组里没有的就留最新的"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnKeepShort" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Content="留路径最短的" Margin="0,0,6,0" IsEnabled="False" ToolTip="每组保留路径最短（层级最浅）的那份"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnPickNone" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Content="全部取消" IsEnabled="False"/>
            </StackPanel>
            <TextBlock x:Name="DupProgressText" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Foreground="#6E6E73"
                       Text="只有内容逐字节完全相同才算重复。"/>
          </DockPanel>
          <Grid>
            <ListView x:Name="DupList" Background="White" BorderThickness="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource GridRow}"
                      VirtualizingPanel.IsVirtualizing="True" VirtualizingPanel.IsVirtualizingWhenGrouping="True"
                      VirtualizingPanel.VirtualizationMode="Recycling" ScrollViewer.CanContentScroll="True">
              <ListView.GroupStyle>
                <GroupStyle>
                  <GroupStyle.HeaderTemplate>
                    <DataTemplate>
                      <Border BorderBrush="#EFEFF4" BorderThickness="0,1,0,0" Padding="16,14,12,6" Margin="0,4,0,0">
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                          <Ellipse Width="8" Height="8" Margin="0,0,10,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Fill="{Binding Items[0].TypeBrush}"/>
                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Items[0].GroupName}" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Items[0].GroupMeta}" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="12,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                          <Border CornerRadius="9" Padding="8,1,8,2" Margin="12,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                  Background="{Binding Items[0].GroupBadgeBg}" ToolTip="{Binding Items[0].GroupBadgeTip}">
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Items[0].GroupBadge}" FontSize="12" Foreground="{Binding Items[0].GroupBadgeFg}"/>
                          </Border>
                        </StackPanel>
                      </Border>
                    </DataTemplate>
                  </GroupStyle.HeaderTemplate>
                </GroupStyle>
              </ListView.GroupStyle>
              <ListView.View>
                <GridView>
                  <GridViewColumn Header="删除" Width="52">
                    <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                      <DataTemplate>
                        <Grid>
                          <CheckBox x:Name="Chk" IsChecked="{Binding ToDelete, Mode=TwoWay}" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
                          <TextBlock x:Name="Lock" Text="&#xE72E;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="13" Foreground="#6E6E73" HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                     VerticalAlignment="Center" Visibility="Collapsed" ToolTip="C 盘个人文件夹里的文件受保护，不会删除"/>
                        </Grid>
                        <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                          <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding CanDelete}" Value="False">
                            <Setter TargetName="Chk" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/>
                            <Setter TargetName="Lock" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/>
                          </DataTrigger>
                        </DataTemplate.Triggers>
                      </DataTemplate>
                    </GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                  </GridViewColumn>
                  <GridViewColumn Header="位置" Width="520">
                    <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                      <DataTemplate>
                        <TextBlock ToolTip="{Binding Path}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis">
                          <Run Text="{Binding Dir, Mode=OneWay}" Foreground="#6E6E73"/><Run Text="{Binding FileName, Mode=OneWay}" Foreground="#1D1D1F"/>
                        </TextBlock>
                      </DataTemplate>
                    </GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                  </GridViewColumn>
                  <GridViewColumn Header="修改时间" Width="136">
                    <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Modified}" Foreground="#6E6E73"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                  </GridViewColumn>
                  <GridViewColumn Header="注意" Width="230">
                    <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Risk}" ToolTip="{Binding Risk}" Foreground="#C93400" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                  </GridViewColumn>
                  <GridViewColumn Header="" Width="80">
                    <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><Button Content="打开位置" Tag="{Binding Path}" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                  </GridViewColumn>
                </GridView>
              </ListView.View>
            </ListView>
            <StackPanel x:Name="EmptyDup" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,10,0,30" IsHitTestVisible="False">
              <TextBlock Text="&#xE8C8;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="32" Foreground="#C7C7CC" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="EmptyDupText" Text="设置好条件后，点右上角「开始查找」" Foreground="#6E6E73" FontSize="14" Margin="0,12,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Grid>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>

      <DockPanel Grid.Row="3" Margin="0,14,0,0">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal">
          <CheckBox x:Name="DupProtect" Content="不删 C 盘个人文件夹里的文件" IsChecked="True" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,16,0"
                    ToolTip="桌面、文档、下载、图片、视频、音乐等 C 盘个人文件夹里的副本一律保留，只删其他位置的副本"/>
          <CheckBox x:Name="DupRecycle" Content="放入回收站，可以恢复" IsChecked="True" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,16,0"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnDupMove" Content="归档勾选的…" Margin="0,0,8,0" Padding="16,8" IsEnabled="False"
                  ToolTip="不删，把勾选的文件搬到你选的一个文件夹里（按原来的盘符和路径放，不会重名覆盖），想清楚了再删"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnDupMerge" Content="合并为一份" Margin="0,0,8,0" Padding="16,8" IsEnabled="False"
                  ToolTip="勾选的副本换成指向保留那份的硬链接：每个位置的文件都还在，只占一份空间。只适用于同一块盘上的副本"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnDupDelete" Content="删除勾选的文件" Style="{StaticResource Danger}" Padding="20,8" IsEnabled="False"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <TextBlock x:Name="DupSummary" Text="" FontWeight="SemiBold" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="2,0,16,0"/>
      </DockPanel>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 空间地图 ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageMap" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Margin="30,24,30,14" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
      </Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,16">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0">
          <CheckBox x:Name="MapFast" Content="快速扫描" IsChecked="True" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,14,0"
                    ToolTip="直接读取 NTFS 的文件表（MFT），比逐个文件夹查看快得多。少数安全软件对直接读盘会提示，可以关掉，改为逐个文件夹扫描。清理、搬家、软件管理统计大小时也按这个设置。"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MapDrive" Width="130" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnMapStop" Content="停止" Margin="0,0,8,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnMapScan" Content="扫描" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Padding="20,6"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="空间地图" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="看清每个文件夹和文件占了多少空间。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </DockPanel>
      <!-- 每块盘一张卡片：用量条、温度、磨损、健康状态。颜色按档位：绿正常、橙要留意、红有问题 -->
      <Border x:Name="MapHealthBox" Grid.Row="1" Margin="0,0,0,12" Visibility="{DynamicResource MapHealthVis}">
        <StackPanel>
          <ItemsControl x:Name="MapHealth">
            <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel><ItemsPanelTemplate><WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal"/></ItemsPanelTemplate></ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
              <DataTemplate>
                <Border x:Name="DcCard" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Width="{DynamicResource DcCardW}" Margin="0,0,12,8" Padding="0" Cursor="Hand" ToolTip="{Binding Tip}" Tag="{Binding}">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="5" Background="{Binding Stripe}" CornerRadius="12,0,0,12"/>
                    <StackPanel Margin="14,10,14,10">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="{Binding Letter}" FontSize="17" FontWeight="SemiBold" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding Model}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                      </DockPanel>
                      <Grid Margin="0,10,0,0" Height="6">
                        <Border Background="#EBEBF0" CornerRadius="3"/>
                        <Border Background="{Binding BarBrush}" CornerRadius="3" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Width="{Binding BarW}"/>
                      </Grid>
                      <DockPanel Margin="0,7,0,0">
                        <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" Text="{Binding FreeText}" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F" Margin="12,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding UsedText}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
                      </DockPanel>
                      <WrapPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                        <Border Background="{Binding HealthBg}" CornerRadius="6" Padding="7,2" Margin="0,0,6,4"><TextBlock Text="{Binding HealthText}" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{Binding HealthFg}"/></Border>
                        <Border x:Name="TempChip" Background="{Binding TempBg}" CornerRadius="6" Padding="7,2" Margin="0,0,6,4"><TextBlock Text="{Binding TempText}" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{Binding TempFg}"/></Border>
                        <Border x:Name="WearChip" Background="{Binding WearBg}" CornerRadius="6" Padding="7,2" Margin="0,0,6,4"><TextBlock Text="{Binding WearText}" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{Binding WearFg}"/></Border>
                        <TextBlock x:Name="HoursText" Text="{Binding HoursText}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="2,0,0,4"/>
                      </WrapPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Sel}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="DcCard" Property="BorderBrush" Value="#0071E3"/><Setter TargetName="DcCard" Property="BorderThickness" Value="2"/></DataTrigger>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasTemp}" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="TempChip" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasWear}" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="WearChip" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasHours}" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="HoursText" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                </DataTemplate.Triggers>
              </DataTemplate>
            </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
          </ItemsControl>
          <TextBlock x:Name="MapHealthNote" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Text="正在读取各块盘的健康信息…"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>
      <DockPanel Grid.Row="2" Margin="0,0,0,10">
        <Border x:Name="MapViewBox" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" VerticalAlignment="Center">
          <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
            <RadioButton x:Name="MapViewDirs" GroupName="mapview" Content="文件夹" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MapViewTree" GroupName="mapview" Content="方块图" Style="{StaticResource Seg}" ToolTip="每个方块的大小就是它占的空间。单击选中，双击文件夹往里点"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MapViewTypes" GroupName="mapview" Content="按类型" Style="{StaticResource Seg}" ToolTip="这块盘上视频、图片、文档、程序、日志各占多少。双击一类，到「找文件」里看这一类最大的文件"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MapViewFiles" GroupName="mapview" Content="找文件" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MapViewGrow" GroupName="mapview" Content="和上次比" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MapViewRecent" GroupName="mapview" Content="最近改动" Style="{StaticResource Seg}" ToolTip="按文件系统的变更日志，看这几天哪些文件夹新建、改写的文件最多：多出来的空间多半在那里"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Border>
        <Button x:Name="BtnMapExport" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Content="导出 CSV" Margin="0,0,10,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsEnabled="False"
                ToolTip="把现在看到的列表存成 CSV 文件，可以用 Excel 打开"/>
        <Button x:Name="BtnMapReport" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Content="导出报告" Margin="0,0,8,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsEnabled="False"
                ToolTip="把这块盘的空间情况存成一个网页报告：方块图、最大的文件夹和文件、各类文件占多少、和上次比的变化。在浏览器里按 Ctrl+P 可以存成 PDF"/>
        <!-- 左边是「上一级」和路径；地方不够时说明文字末尾省略，「空间明细」靠右一直看得见，不会被右边的按钮挡住 -->
        <DockPanel VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,12,0">
          <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Left" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,10,0">
            <Button x:Name="BtnMapBack" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Padding="8,3" Margin="0,0,4,0" IsEnabled="False" ToolTip="后退到刚才看的文件夹（鼠标侧键、Alt+←）">
              <TextBlock Text="&#xE72B;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="11" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </Button>
            <Button x:Name="BtnMapFwd" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Padding="8,3" Margin="0,0,8,0" IsEnabled="False" ToolTip="前进（鼠标侧键、Alt+→）">
              <TextBlock Text="&#xE72A;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="11" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </Button>
            <Button x:Name="BtnMapUp" Style="{StaticResource Small}" IsEnabled="False" ToolTip="回到上一级文件夹（Backspace）" VerticalAlignment="Center">
              <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                <TextBlock Text="&#xE74A;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="11" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,6,0"/>
                <TextBlock Text="上一级" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </Button>
          </StackPanel>
          <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
            <!-- 路径上的每一层都能点，点哪一层回到哪一层 -->
            <StackPanel x:Name="MapCrumbs" Orientation="Horizontal" Visibility="Collapsed" ClipToBounds="True"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="MapPath" Text="还没有扫描" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
            <DockPanel>
              <Button x:Name="BtnMapAcct" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="空间明细" FontSize="12" Padding="10,0,2,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" Visibility="Collapsed"
                      ToolTip="已用空间都花在哪：文件实际占用、文件表（MFT）、硬链接、压缩和稀疏文件，以及为什么和按文件大小相加对不上"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="MapInfo" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" ToolTip="{Binding Text, RelativeSource={RelativeSource Self}}" Text="选一块盘，点「扫描」。C 盘通常一两分钟就能扫完。"/>
            </DockPanel>
          </StackPanel>
        </DockPanel>
      </DockPanel>
      <!-- 找文件的条件：只在「找文件」时显示 -->
      <WrapPanel x:Name="MapFilter" Grid.Row="3" Margin="0,0,0,10" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,18,2">
          <TextBlock Text="大小至少" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MapMinSize" Width="96" SelectedIndex="2">
            <ComboBoxItem Content="1 MB" Tag="1"/><ComboBoxItem Content="10 MB" Tag="10"/><ComboBoxItem Content="50 MB" Tag="50"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="100 MB" Tag="100"/><ComboBoxItem Content="500 MB" Tag="500"/><ComboBoxItem Content="1 GB" Tag="1024"/>
          </ComboBox>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,18,2">
          <TextBlock Text="多久没改过" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MapAge" Width="120" SelectedIndex="0">
            <ComboBoxItem Content="不限" Tag="0"/><ComboBoxItem Content="30 天以上" Tag="30"/><ComboBoxItem Content="半年以上" Tag="182"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="1 年以上" Tag="365"/><ComboBoxItem Content="2 年以上" Tag="730"/>
          </ComboBox>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,18,2">
          <TextBlock Text="类型" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MapType" Width="190" SelectedIndex="0">
            <ComboBoxItem Content="全部" Tag=""/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="视频" Tag="video"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="压缩包和安装包" Tag="archive"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="光盘映像和虚拟磁盘" Tag="image"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="图片" Tag="picture"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="音乐" Tag="music"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="文档" Tag="doc"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="程序和游戏数据" Tag="program"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="日志、转储和临时文件" Tag="log"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="代码和开发文件" Tag="code"/>
          </ComboBox>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,18,2">
          <TextBlock Text="所有者" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MapOwner" Width="170" SelectedIndex="0" ToolTip="按文件的所有者（Windows 账户）筛选。只在列出来的这些文件里分">
            <ComboBoxItem Content="全部" Tag=""/>
          </ComboBox>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,18,2">
          <TextBlock Text="排序" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MapSort" Width="140" SelectedIndex="0">
            <ComboBoxItem Content="大的在前" Tag="size"/><ComboBoxItem Content="最近改过的在前" Tag="new"/><ComboBoxItem Content="最久没改的在前" Tag="old"/>
          </ComboBox>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,18,2">
          <TextBlock Text="名称" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <TextBox x:Name="MapName" Width="150" ToolTip="文件名里包含这些字。可以用 * 和 ?，比如 *.mp4、备份*"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <CheckBox x:Name="MapUnder" Content="只找当前文件夹里的" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,2,18,2"/>
        <CheckBox x:Name="MapChat" Content="只找聊天软件里的" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,2,0,2"
                  ToolTip="微信、QQ、企业微信、飞书、钉钉、Telegram 等聊天记录文件夹里的大文件。这些文件只能查看、打开位置；要腾地方，可以到「搬家管理」把整个聊天记录搬到其他盘。"/>
      </WrapPanel>
      <WrapPanel x:Name="MapGrowBar" Grid.Row="3" Margin="0,0,0,10" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,18,2">
          <TextBlock Text="和哪次比" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MapGrowBase" Width="150" SelectedIndex="0" ToolTip="每次扫描都会存一份快照（每块盘最多留 40 份）。选一个时间，和那时候的快照比">
            <ComboBoxItem Content="上一次扫描" Tag="0"/><ComboBoxItem Content="1 天前" Tag="1"/><ComboBoxItem Content="3 天前" Tag="3"/>
            <ComboBoxItem Content="7 天前" Tag="7"/><ComboBoxItem Content="30 天前" Tag="30"/><ComboBoxItem Content="最早的一次" Tag="9999"/>
          </ComboBox>
        </StackPanel>
      </WrapPanel>
      <WrapPanel x:Name="MapRecentBar" Grid.Row="3" Margin="0,0,0,10" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,18,2">
          <TextBlock Text="最近" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MapRecentDays" Width="120" SelectedIndex="0">
            <ComboBoxItem Content="24 小时" Tag="1"/><ComboBoxItem Content="3 天" Tag="3"/><ComboBoxItem Content="7 天" Tag="7"/><ComboBoxItem Content="30 天" Tag="30"/>
          </ComboBox>
        </StackPanel>
        <Button x:Name="BtnMapRecent" Content="查看" Style="{StaticResource Small}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,2,0,2"/>
      </WrapPanel>
      <Border Grid.Row="4" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="0,6,0,6">
        <Grid x:Name="MapGrid" Grid.IsSharedSizeScope="True">
          <Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="0"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
          </Grid.RowDefinitions>
          <!-- 概览：已用的空间里系统、个人文件、缓存各占多少（扫描后才有）。上面的磁盘卡片已经写着这块盘用了多少、剩多少，
               所以「已用 / 共多少」那一行只在卡片不显示这块盘时出现（设置里关了卡片、读不到健康信息） -->
          <Border x:Name="MapOverview" Grid.Row="0" Margin="18,6,18,8" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <StackPanel>
              <DockPanel x:Name="MapOvHead" Margin="0,0,0,12" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" HorizontalAlignment="Right">
                  <TextBlock Text="已使用" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="MapOvPct" Text="" FontSize="26" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="MapOvTitle" Text="" Style="{StaticResource Caption}"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="MapOvUsed" Text="" FontSize="26" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
              <TextBlock x:Name="MapOvWhat" Text="已用的空间里都是什么" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
              <Grid x:Name="MapOvBar" Height="10" Margin="0,10,0,0">
                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <ColumnDefinition Width="1*"/><ColumnDefinition Width="0"/><ColumnDefinition Width="0"/><ColumnDefinition Width="0"/>
                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <Border Grid.Column="0" Background="#3B82F6"/>
                <Border Grid.Column="1" Background="#E0A731"/>
                <Border Grid.Column="2" Background="#3FA37E"/>
                <Border Grid.Column="3" Background="#8E8E93"/>
              </Grid>
              <WrapPanel x:Name="MapOvLegend" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
              <!-- 值得一看：可能用不上、删了能腾出不少空间的大文件夹（缓存、依赖包、构建产物、虚拟环境、临时文件），点一下跳过去看 -->
              <DockPanel x:Name="MapWorthBox" Margin="0,10,0,0" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="值得一看" FontWeight="SemiBold" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,4,12,0"
                           ToolTip="这块盘上可能用不上、删了能腾出不少空间的大文件夹：缓存、依赖包（node_modules 等）、构建产物、虚拟环境、临时文件。只是按名字认的，点一下跳过去，看清楚再决定"/>
                <WrapPanel x:Name="MapWorth"/>
              </DockPanel>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          <DockPanel x:Name="MapTreeBox" Grid.Row="1" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <!-- 颜色是这个文件夹装的是哪一类东西；带斜线的是能腾出来的（缓存、依赖包、临时文件） -->
            <WrapPanel x:Name="MapTreeLegend" DockPanel.Dock="Bottom" Margin="12,0,12,6"/>
            <Canvas x:Name="MapTree" Margin="10,4,10,6" ClipToBounds="True" Background="White"/>
          </DockPanel>
          <DockPanel Grid.Row="2">
          <!-- 表头：点「名称」「修改时间」「大小」排序，点第三下回到按大小排 -->
          <Border x:Name="MapHeadBox" DockPanel.Dock="Top" Style="{StaticResource HeadBar}" Margin="6,0,6,2" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <Grid x:Name="MapHead" Margin="12,0,14,0">
              <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="MapCk"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="30"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="MapBar"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="92"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="MapPct"/>
              </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Orientation="Horizontal">
                <Button Tag="name" Content="名称" Style="{StaticResource ColHead}"/>
                <TextBlock Text="·" Foreground="#C7C7CC" Margin="7,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                <Button Tag="when" Content="修改时间" Style="{StaticResource ColHead}"/>
              </StackPanel>
              <Button Grid.Column="4" Tag="size" Content="大小" Style="{StaticResource ColHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Right"/>
            </Grid>
          </Border>
          <ListView x:Name="MapList" Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" ItemTemplate="{StaticResource MapRowTpl}" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource SelRow}" SelectionMode="Extended"
                    ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" VirtualizingPanel.IsVirtualizing="True" VirtualizingPanel.VirtualizationMode="Recycling">
            <ListView.ContextMenu>
              <ContextMenu x:Name="MapMenu" Style="{StaticResource Menu}">
                <MenuItem x:Name="MmEnter" Header="打开文件夹" Style="{StaticResource MenuRow}"/>
                <MenuItem x:Name="MmOpen" Header="在资源管理器里显示" Style="{StaticResource MenuRow}"/>
                <MenuItem x:Name="MmCopy" Header="复制路径" Style="{StaticResource MenuRow}"/>
                <Separator Style="{StaticResource MenuSep}"/>
                <MenuItem x:Name="MmCompress" Header="压缩（不删文件）" Style="{StaticResource MenuRow}"/>
                <MenuItem x:Name="MmMark" Header="加入待删清单" Style="{StaticResource MenuRow}"/>
                <MenuItem x:Name="MmDelete" Header="删除…" Style="{StaticResource MenuRow}"/>
              </ContextMenu>
            </ListView.ContextMenu>
          </ListView>
          </DockPanel>
          <ListView x:Name="MapGrow" Grid.Row="2" Background="White" BorderThickness="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource GridRow}" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <ListView.View>
              <GridView>
                <GridViewColumn Header="文件夹" Width="480">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Path}" ToolTip="{Binding Path}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
                <GridViewColumn Header="上次" Width="110">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Before}" Foreground="#6E6E73"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
                <GridViewColumn Header="这次" Width="110">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Now}"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
                <GridViewColumn Header="变化" Width="120">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Change}" Foreground="{Binding ChangeBrush}" FontWeight="SemiBold"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
              </GridView>
            </ListView.View>
          </ListView>
          <StackPanel x:Name="EmptyMap" Grid.Row="2" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,0,24" IsHitTestVisible="False">
            <TextBlock Text="&#xE9D9;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="34" Foreground="#C7C7CC" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="EmptyMapText" Text="点右上角「扫描」，看看这块盘的空间都去哪了" Foreground="#6E6E73" FontSize="14" Margin="0,12,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Grid>
      </Border>
      <StackPanel Grid.Row="5">
      <!-- 待删清单：在不同文件夹里挑的都放在这里，一直看得见删完以后这块盘还剩多少；看过清单再一起删 -->
      <Border x:Name="MapMarkBar" Background="#FFF4E5" BorderBrush="#F3D9A8" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="10" Padding="14,8" Margin="0,12,0,0" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <DockPanel>
          <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal">
            <Button x:Name="BtnMarkClear" Content="清空清单" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
            <Button x:Name="BtnMarkShow" Content="看看清单" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
            <Button x:Name="BtnMarkDelete" Content="删除清单里的…" Style="{StaticResource Danger}" Padding="14,4"/>
          </StackPanel>
          <TextBlock x:Name="MapMarkText" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,12,0"/>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>
      <DockPanel Margin="0,14,0,0">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal">
          <Button x:Name="BtnMapOpen" Content="打开位置" Margin="0,0,8,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnMapCompress" Content="压缩（不删文件）" Margin="0,0,8,0" IsEnabled="False"
                  ToolTip="用 NTFS 压缩这个文件夹：文件照常打开、照常修改，只是占的空间变小。适合不常用的资料、旧项目"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnMapMark" Content="加入待删清单" Margin="0,0,8,0" IsEnabled="False"
                  ToolTip="先放进清单，不马上删：可以接着到别的文件夹里挑，下面一直显示删完以后还剩多少空间，看过清单再一起删"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnMapDelete" Content="删除…" Style="{StaticResource Danger}" Padding="18,6" IsEnabled="False"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <CheckBox x:Name="MapAll" DockPanel.Dock="Left" Content="全选" Visibility="{DynamicResource MapCkVis}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="18,0,12,0" ToolTip="选中这一层列出的全部项目；再点一下全部取消"/>
        <TextBlock x:Name="MapSel" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="2,0,16,0"
                   Text="选中一行可以打开位置、压缩或删除；勾选前面的方框，或按住 Ctrl、Shift，可以选多项一起删；按住鼠标（左键或右键）上下拖可以一次选中连着的几行。系统文件夹、软件安装文件夹、C 盘个人文件夹和搬家后的数据带小锁，不能在这里删。"/>
      </DockPanel>
      </StackPanel>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 省空间（不删文件） ==================== -->
    <!-- 省空间：左边是目录（一级标题下面一项一项），点哪项右边只显示那一项，不用一路往下滚 -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageSave" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Visibility="Collapsed" Margin="30,24,30,14">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="*"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,16">
        <Button x:Name="BtnSaveRefresh" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="刷新" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0"/>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="省空间" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="不删文件也能腾出空间：压缩，或者换个位置放。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </DockPanel>
      <Grid Grid.Row="1">
        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="214"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <Border Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="8,0,8,10" Margin="0,0,16,0" VerticalAlignment="Top">
          <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
            <StackPanel x:Name="SaveNav">
                <TextBlock x:Name="SaveHeadSys" Text="系统文件" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SaveNavCos" GroupName="savenav" Tag="Cos" Content="系统压缩" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SaveNavPf" GroupName="savenav" Tag="Pf" Content="页面文件" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SaveNavHib" GroupName="savenav" Tag="Hib" Content="休眠文件" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SaveNavRs" GroupName="savenav" Tag="Rs" Content="保留的存储" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SaveNavCs" GroupName="savenav" Tag="Cs" Content="组件存储（WinSxS）" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SaveNavDump" GroupName="savenav" Tag="Dump" Content="蓝屏转储大小" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SaveHeadSafe" Text="还原点和临时文件" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SaveNavRp" GroupName="savenav" Tag="Rp" Content="系统还原点" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SaveNavTmp" GroupName="savenav" Tag="Tmp" Content="临时文件夹的位置" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SaveHeadFiles" Text="文件和文件夹" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SaveNavFc" GroupName="savenav" Tag="Fc" Content="压缩文件夹" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SaveNavOd" GroupName="savenav" Tag="Od" Content="OneDrive 仅在线" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SaveNavMerge" GroupName="savenav" Tag="Merge" Content="合并重复文件" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SaveHeadVd" Text="虚拟磁盘" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SaveNavVd" GroupName="savenav" Tag="Vd" Content="虚拟磁盘和虚拟机" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </ScrollViewer>
        </Border>
        <ScrollViewer x:Name="SaveScroll" Grid.Column="1" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
          <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,14">
            <Border x:Name="SaveCardCos" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <DockPanel>
                <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0">
                  <Button x:Name="BtnCosOff" Content="关闭" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnCosOn" Content="开启" Style="{StaticResource Primary}"/>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="系统压缩（CompactOS）" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="SaveCosState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                             Text="Windows 自带的功能：把系统文件压缩存放，通常能省 2 到 4 GB，不影响使用。压缩要 10 到 30 分钟，期间可以照常用电脑。固态硬盘几乎感觉不到变慢；很老的机械硬盘电脑不建议开。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SaveCardPf" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="页面文件（pagefile.sys）" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SavePfState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                           Text="内存不够用时，Windows 把暂时用不到的数据放进这个文件，通常有几个 GB 到十几 GB。可以把它放到其他硬盘，C 盘就不再占这块空间。要重启电脑才生效。改了以后蓝屏时可能无法保存完整的内存转储，对普通用户没有影响；如果有问题，随时点「恢复系统默认」。"/>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                  <ComboBox x:Name="SavePfDrive" Width="220" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnPfMove" Content="改到这块盘" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnPfAuto" Content="恢复系统默认"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SaveCardHib" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="休眠文件（hiberfil.sys）" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SaveHibState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                           Text="休眠和「快速启动」用的文件，大小约等于内存的四成到七成。「只留快速启动」能缩小到原来的一半左右，开机速度不变，只是不能手动休眠；「关闭休眠」整个删掉它，睡眠不受影响，只是没有休眠和快速启动。"/>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                  <Button x:Name="BtnHibReduced" Content="只留快速启动（缩小）" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnHibOff" Content="关闭休眠" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnHibFull" Content="恢复完整休眠"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SaveCardRp" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <DockPanel>
                <Button x:Name="BtnRestoreOpen" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="打开系统保护设置" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="系统还原点（卷影副本）" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="SaveRpState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                             Text="装更新、装驱动之前 Windows 会自动建还原点，系统出问题时可以退回去。还原点放在 C 盘的 System Volume Information 里（空间地图里带小锁的那个文件夹），只记改动过的部分，占的空间有上限，到了上限会自动删掉最旧的。觉得占得多，可以在 Windows 的「系统保护」里点「配置」，调小「最大使用量」，或者删掉这块盘的全部还原点（删了就不能再退回去）。本工具不直接删还原点。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SaveCardFc" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <DockPanel>
                <Button x:Name="BtnFolderCompress" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="选择文件夹…" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="压缩文件夹（NTFS 压缩）" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                             Text="文件照常打开、照常修改，只是占的空间变小。文档、代码、日志、旧项目通常能省一半；照片、视频、压缩包本身已经压缩过，几乎省不了。也可以在「空间地图」里选中文件夹直接压缩。"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="SaveFcState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,8,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SaveCardOd" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <DockPanel>
                <Button x:Name="BtnOdFree" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="改成仅在线" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="OneDrive 文件改成「仅在线」" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="SaveOdState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                             Text="同步过的文件本地都留着一份副本。改成「仅在线」后文件还在云端，资源管理器里照常显示，打开时才下载，本地不再占空间。什么都不删。你设了「始终保留在此设备」的文件不动；OneDrive 要开着才会真正释放。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SaveCardRs" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <DockPanel>
                <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0">
                  <Button x:Name="BtnRsOn" Content="重新开启" Margin="0,0,8,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnRsOff" Content="关闭" IsEnabled="False"/>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="Windows 保留的存储" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="SaveRsState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                             Text="Windows 给系统更新预留的空间，通常 7 GB 左右，空间明细里的「其他」有一部分就是它。关掉以后这块空间还给你，更新时 Windows 改为临时借用空闲空间；C 盘很满时更新可能提示空间不够，再开回来就好。有更新正在安装时改不了。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SaveCardCs" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <DockPanel>
                <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0">
                  <Button x:Name="BtnCsAnalyze" Content="分析" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnCsClean" Content="去清理"/>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="组件存储（WinSxS）" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="SaveCsState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="点「分析」让 Windows 算一下实际多大、能清多少（要一两分钟）。"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                             Text="C:\Windows\WinSxS 看着很大，其中很多文件和 System32 是同一份（硬链接），真正能清的是更新替换下来的旧组件。Windows 自己能算出可回收多少、建不建议清理；清理在「清理 C 盘」里的「WinSxS 组件清理 (DISM)」。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SaveCardDump" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <DockPanel>
                <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0">
                  <Button x:Name="BtnDumpSmall" Content="改成小转储" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnDumpAuto" Content="恢复自动"/>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="蓝屏时保存多大的转储" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="SaveDumpState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                             Text="蓝屏时 Windows 会把内存里的内容存成 C:\Windows\MEMORY.DMP，「自动」模式下可能和内存一样大，清掉了下次蓝屏又会生成。改成「小内存转储」只存 256 KB 的摘要，够看出是哪个驱动出的问题。随时可以恢复。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SaveCardTmp" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="临时文件夹的位置" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SaveTmpState" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                           Text="各软件的临时文件默认放在 C 盘的用户目录里。可以改到其他盘，以后的临时文件就不占 C 盘了。改完要注销再登录（或重启）才对所有软件生效；个别安装程序对 C 盘以外的临时文件夹不兼容，遇到就点「恢复默认」。"/>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                  <ComboBox x:Name="SaveTmpDrive" Width="220" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnTmpMove" Content="改到这块盘" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnTmpAuto" Content="恢复默认"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SaveCardVd" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20,24,14" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="虚拟磁盘、模拟器和虚拟机" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,4"
                           Text="WSL、Docker、安卓模拟器、虚拟机的磁盘文件动辄几十 GB，而且在里面删了东西也不会自动变小。压缩能把空出来的部分还给 Windows；WSL 发行版和文件夹形式的可以整个搬到其他盘。"/>
                <ItemsControl x:Name="VdList">
                  <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                    <DataTemplate>
                      <Border BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="0,1,0,0" Padding="0,12,0,10">
                        <DockPanel>
                          <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="16,0,0,0">
                            <Button x:Name="VdOpen" Content="打开位置" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,6,0"/>
                            <Button x:Name="VdMove" Content="搬到其他盘" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,6,0" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
                            <Button x:Name="VdCompact" Content="压缩" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
                          </StackPanel>
                          <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Right" Text="{Binding SizeText}" FontWeight="SemiBold" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
                          <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Path}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Note}" FontSize="12" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                          </StackPanel>
                        </DockPanel>
                      </Border>
                      <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding CanCompact}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="VdCompact" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
                        <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding CanMove}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="VdMove" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
                      </DataTemplate.Triggers>
                    </DataTemplate>
                  </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                </ItemsControl>
                <TextBlock x:Name="VdEmpty" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,8,0,0" Text="这台电脑上没找到 WSL、Docker、安卓模拟器或虚拟机的磁盘。"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SaveCardMerge" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,18" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <DockPanel>
                <Button x:Name="BtnGoDup" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="去找重复文件" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="合并重复文件" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0"
                             Text="同一块盘上内容完全相同的文件，可以合并成一份：每个位置的文件都还在，只占一份空间。在「重复文件」页找完后，点「合并为一份」。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
            </Border>
          </StackPanel>
        </ScrollViewer>
      </Grid>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 软件管理 ==================== -->
    <!-- ===== 系统健康：硬件、启动、蓝屏、活动监控、事件。读不到的明说读不到 ===== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageHealth" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Visibility="Collapsed" Margin="30,24,30,10">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
      </Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <!-- 标题和选项卡在一排：点哪一项只显示哪一项，各自有自己的滚动条 -->
      <DockPanel Grid.Row="0">
        <Button x:Name="BtnHealthRefresh" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="刷新" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="16,0,0,0"/>
        <WrapPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
          <TextBlock Text="系统健康" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,22,4" ToolTip="硬件状态、开机用时、蓝屏原因、常见问题的修法、谁在吃资源。读不到的数据直接写明读不到，不用估算冒充"/>
          <Border x:Name="HealthTabBox" Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,2,0,4">
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
              <RadioButton x:Name="HTabHw" GroupName="htab" Content="硬件" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HTabBoot" GroupName="htab" Content="开机用时" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HTabCrash" GroupName="htab" Content="蓝屏和崩溃" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HTabFix" GroupName="htab" Content="常见问题修复" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HTabMon" GroupName="htab" Content="活动监控" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HTabEvents" GroupName="htab" Content="Windows 事件" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
        </WrapPanel>
      </DockPanel>
      <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" x:Name="HealthNote" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,6,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="正在读取…"/>
      <Grid Grid.Row="2" Margin="0,12,0,0">
        <ScrollViewer x:Name="HealthViewHw" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
          <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,14">
          <!-- 硬件：每一项一张小卡片；卡片宽度跟着窗口变，窗口拉宽（最大化）时一排放更多张，不在右边留一大块空白 -->
          <Border x:Name="HealthCardHw" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="硬件" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <ItemsControl x:Name="HealthCards" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel><ItemsPanelTemplate><WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal"/></ItemsPanelTemplate></ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                  <DataTemplate>
                    <Border Width="{DynamicResource HcCardW}" Margin="0,0,12,12" Padding="0" Background="#F7F7F9" CornerRadius="10" ToolTip="{Binding Tip}">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="5" Background="{Binding Stripe}" CornerRadius="10,0,0,10"/>
                        <StackPanel Margin="14,10,14,12">
                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Title}" FontSize="14" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Sub}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                          <Grid x:Name="HcBar" Margin="0,8,0,0" Height="6">
                            <Border Background="#EBEBF0" CornerRadius="3"/>
                            <Border Background="{Binding BarBrush}" CornerRadius="3" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Width="{Binding BarW}"/>
                          </Grid>
                          <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Chips}" Margin="0,8,0,0">
                            <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel><ItemsPanelTemplate><WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal"/></ItemsPanelTemplate></ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                              <DataTemplate>
                                <Border Background="{Binding Bg}" CornerRadius="6" Padding="7,2" Margin="0,0,6,4"><TextBlock Text="{Binding Text}" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{Binding Fg}"/></Border>
                              </DataTemplate>
                            </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                          </ItemsControl>
                          <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Lines}">
                            <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,3,0,0"/></DataTemplate></ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                          </ItemsControl>
                        </StackPanel>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                      <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasBar}" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="HcBar" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                    </DataTemplate.Triggers>
                  </DataTemplate>
                </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
              </ItemsControl>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="温度、磨损来自 SMART 和 ACPI；CPU 内核温度和显卡温度 Windows 不提供，要厂商工具。所有数字都是读取那一刻的。"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          </StackPanel>
        </ScrollViewer>
        <ScrollViewer x:Name="HealthViewBoot" Visibility="Collapsed" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
          <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,14">
          <!-- 开机 -->
          <Border x:Name="HealthCardBoot" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="开机用时" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="HealthBootText" Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text=""/>
              <ItemsControl x:Name="HealthSlow" Margin="0,6,0,0" ItemTemplate="{StaticResource NoteRowTpl}"/>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,8,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="数据来自 Windows 自己的「诊断-性能」日志（事件 100 和 101）。拖慢开机的程序可以到「软件管理 → 开机启动」里关掉。"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>

          </StackPanel>
        </ScrollViewer>
        <!-- 蓝屏和崩溃：再分三个小选项卡（诊断结论 / 蓝屏记录 / 相关事件和驱动），各自滚动，不用一路滚到底 -->
        <Grid x:Name="HealthViewCrash" Visibility="Collapsed">
                    <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="*"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
          <Border Grid.Row="0" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="0,0,0,1" Margin="0,0,6,12">
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
              <RadioButton x:Name="CTabVerdict" GroupName="ctab" Content="诊断结论" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource SubTab}"/>
              <RadioButton x:Name="CTabDumps" GroupName="ctab" Style="{StaticResource SubTab}">
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="每次蓝屏"/><Border x:Name="CTabDumpsB" Style="{StaticResource TabBadge}" Visibility="Collapsed"><TextBlock x:Name="CTabDumpsN" Style="{StaticResource TabBadgeText}"/></Border></StackPanel>
              </RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="CTabEvents" GroupName="ctab" Style="{StaticResource SubTab}">
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="相关事件和驱动"/><Border x:Name="CTabEventsB" Style="{StaticResource TabBadge}" Visibility="Collapsed"><TextBlock x:Name="CTabEventsN" Style="{StaticResource TabBadgeText}"/></Border></StackPanel>
              </RadioButton>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          <ScrollViewer x:Name="CrashViewVerdict" Grid.Row="1" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
          <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,14">
          <!-- 诊断结论：几次蓝屏、事件、硬盘健康放在一起看 -->
          <Border x:Name="HealthCardVerdict" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20">
            <StackPanel>
              <DockPanel>
                <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="20,0,0,0">
                  <Button x:Name="BtnCopyReport" Content="复制报告" Margin="0,0,8,0" ToolTip="把这一页的诊断结论、每次蓝屏的说明、相关事件和硬盘状态复制成文字，可以直接粘贴给别人"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnDiagPack" Content="导出诊断包…" ToolTip="把蓝屏转储、最近 30 天的系统和应用日志、系统信息、驱动列表和诊断结论打成一个 zip，方便发给懂的人看。只读不改"/>
                </StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="诊断结论" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              </DockPanel>
              <ItemsControl x:Name="HealthVerdicts" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                  <DataTemplate>
                    <Border Background="{Binding Bg}" CornerRadius="10" Padding="16,12" Margin="0,0,0,10">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding Title}" FontSize="15" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{Binding Fg}" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding Body}" Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,6,0,0"/>
                        <StackPanel x:Name="VdPlan" Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                          <Button Content="{Binding PlanName}" Tag="{Binding PlanTag}" ToolTip="{Binding PlanTip}" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Padding="16,5"/>
                          <TextBlock Text="本工具能直接做的，一次做完；做之前会列出要做什么，都能撤销" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="12,0,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <StackPanel x:Name="VdTodo" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                          <TextBlock Text="需要你自己做的" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Todo}" Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                        <ItemsControl x:Name="VdFixes" ItemsSource="{Binding Fixes}" Margin="0,10,0,0">
                          <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel><ItemsPanelTemplate><WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal"/></ItemsPanelTemplate></ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                          <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate><DataTemplate><Button Content="{Binding Name}" Tag="{Binding Id}" ToolTip="{Binding Tip}" IsEnabled="{Binding Enabled}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,8,6"/></DataTemplate></ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                        </ItemsControl>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                      <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasFixes}" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="VdFixes" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                      <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasPlan}" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="VdPlan" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                      <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasTodo}" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="VdTodo" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                    </DataTemplate.Triggers>
                  </DataTemplate>
                </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
              </ItemsControl>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="结论是按错误码、状态码、事件日志和硬盘健康推出来的，是排查方向，不是定论。按钮和「常见问题修复」里的是同一套：只看的直接运行，会改动的先说明要改什么。"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          </StackPanel>
          </ScrollViewer>
          <ScrollViewer x:Name="CrashViewDumps" Grid.Row="1" Visibility="Collapsed" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
          <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,14">
          <Border x:Name="HealthCardCrash" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20">
            <StackPanel>
              <DockPanel>
                <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="20,0,0,0">
                  <Button x:Name="BtnSfcCheck" Content="检查系统文件（只看）" Margin="0,0,8,0" ToolTip="在终端窗口里运行 sfc /verifyonly 和 DISM /ScanHealth：只检查，不改任何东西。要几分钟"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnSfcRepair" Content="修复系统文件…" ToolTip="在终端窗口里运行 DISM /RestoreHealth 和 sfc /scannow：会把损坏的系统文件换成正常的副本（会改系统文件，可能要联网下载）。点了会先确认"/>
                </StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="每次蓝屏" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              </DockPanel>
              <TextBlock x:Name="HealthCrashText" Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text=""/>
              <ItemsControl x:Name="HealthDumps" Margin="0,8,0,0">
                <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                  <DataTemplate>
                    <Border Background="#F7F7F9" CornerRadius="8" Padding="12,8" Margin="0,6,0,0">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <Button DockPanel.Dock="Right" x:Name="DumpOpen" Content="打开位置" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
                        <StackPanel>
                          <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding When}" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Code}" Margin="10,0,0,0" FontFamily="Consolas"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Suspect}" Margin="10,0,0,0" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{Binding SuspectBrush}"/>
                          </StackPanel>
                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Plain}" Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,3,0,0"/>
                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Detail}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,3,0,0"/>
                        </StackPanel>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </Border>
                  </DataTemplate>
                </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
              </ItemsControl>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,10,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="转储文件是本工具自己解析的（错误码、参数、状态码、出事时加载的驱动、栈上出现的驱动），不如 WinDbg 准确；「可能的驱动」只是提示，不是定论。蓝屏时间和最近装的驱动对得上的，优先怀疑那个驱动。"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          </StackPanel>
          </ScrollViewer>
          <ScrollViewer x:Name="CrashViewEvents" Grid.Row="1" Visibility="Collapsed" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
          <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,14">
          <Border x:Name="HealthCardCrashEv" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock x:Name="HealthEventsHead" Text="最近 30 天的相关事件" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <ItemsControl x:Name="HealthEvents" Margin="0,6,0,0" ItemTemplate="{StaticResource NoteRowTpl}"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="HealthDriversHead" Text="最近 30 天装的驱动" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}" Margin="0,20,0,0"/>
              <ItemsControl x:Name="HealthDrivers" Margin="0,6,0,0" ItemTemplate="{StaticResource NoteRowTpl}"/>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,12,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="意外关机、硬件错误（WHEA）、磁盘和文件系统错误按来源归并；蓝屏时间和最近装的驱动对得上的，优先怀疑那个驱动。"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          </StackPanel>
          </ScrollViewer>
        </Grid>
        <!-- 常见问题修复：左边选问题，右边是这个问题的修法：一步一张卡片，从轻到重往下排，按钮在每张卡片右边 -->
        <Grid x:Name="HealthViewFix" Visibility="Collapsed" Margin="0,0,6,10">
          <Border x:Name="HealthCardFix" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="0">
            <DockPanel>
              <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Top" Margin="28,22,28,0">
                <TextBlock Text="常见问题修复" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}" FontSize="17"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,6,0,0" Text="左边选遇到的问题，右边的修法从轻到重排，从上往下试。都是 Windows 自带的命令，在看得见的窗口里运行。"/>
                <WrapPanel Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,28,6">
                    <Border Background="#E5F4E9" CornerRadius="6" Padding="8,2,8,3" VerticalAlignment="Center"><TextBlock Text="只看" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D7A35"/></Border>
                    <TextBlock Text="不改任何东西" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="8,0,0,0"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,28,6">
                    <Border Background="#FFF1DB" CornerRadius="6" Padding="8,2,8,3" VerticalAlignment="Center"><TextBlock Text="会改动" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#995700"/></Border>
                    <TextBlock Text="先说明要改什么，能撤销的写明怎么撤销" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="8,0,0,0"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,0,28,6">
                    <Border Background="#FDEBEC" CornerRadius="6" Padding="8,2,8,3" VerticalAlignment="Center"><TextBlock Text="要重启" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#C0101C"/></Border>
                    <TextBlock Text="重启后才生效" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="8,0,0,0"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </WrapPanel>
                <Border x:Name="FixRecBox" Background="#E3EEFF" CornerRadius="12" Padding="18,14,18,8" Margin="0,14,0,0" Visibility="Collapsed">
                  <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock x:Name="FixRecHead" Text="根据这台电脑的蓝屏诊断，建议先做" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0A5BC4"/>
                    <ItemsControl x:Name="FixRec" Margin="0,10,0,0">
                      <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel><ItemsPanelTemplate><WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal"/></ItemsPanelTemplate></ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                      <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate><DataTemplate><Button Content="{Binding Name}" Tag="{Binding Id}" ToolTip="{Binding Tip}" IsEnabled="{Binding Enabled}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,8,6"/></DataTemplate></ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                    </ItemsControl>
                  </StackPanel>
                </Border>
              </StackPanel>
              <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Bottom" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap" LineHeight="19" Margin="28,12,28,16" Text="这里的修复不删除任何文件、不结束任何程序、不装驱动；Windows 更新组件是改名留底，硬盘省电和快速启动随时能改回来。系统还原、内存诊断、设备管理器是 Windows 自己的工具，里面每一步都由你确认。每次运行都记在操作日志里。"/>
              <Grid Margin="0,20,0,0">
                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="260"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <Border Grid.Column="0" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="0,1,1,1">
                  <ListBox x:Name="FixGroups" Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" Padding="12,12" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource NavItem}"
                           ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled">
                    <ListBox.ItemTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Title}" TextWrapping="Wrap" LineHeight="20" Margin="2,2,2,2"/></DataTemplate></ListBox.ItemTemplate>
                  </ListBox>
                </Border>
                <Border Grid.Column="1" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="0,1,0,1">
                  <ScrollViewer x:Name="FixDetailScroll" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
                    <ContentControl x:Name="FixDetail" Content="{Binding SelectedItem, ElementName=FixGroups}" Margin="32,24,28,20" Focusable="False">
                      <ContentControl.ContentTemplate>
                        <DataTemplate>
                          <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Title}" FontSize="20" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap" TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Ideal"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="{Binding Desc}" Style="{StaticResource Body}" FontSize="14" LineHeight="23" Foreground="#424245" Margin="0,8,0,22"/>
                            <ItemsControl ItemsSource="{Binding Steps}">
                              <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                                <DataTemplate>
                                  <Border Background="#F7F7F9" CornerRadius="12" Padding="18,16,18,16" Margin="0,0,0,12">
                                    <DockPanel>
                                      <Button DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="{Binding Act}" Tag="{Binding Id}" IsEnabled="{Binding Enabled}" Style="{StaticResource Secondary}" Padding="16,6" MinWidth="84" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="24,0,0,0"/>
                                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="26" Height="26" CornerRadius="13" Background="#E8E8ED" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,14,0">
                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding No}" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#3A3A3C" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                      </Border>
                                      <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                        <WrapPanel>
                                          <TextBlock Text="{Binding Title}" FontSize="14.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,2,10,0"/>
                                          <Border Background="{Binding TagBg}" CornerRadius="6" Padding="8,2,8,3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,2,0,0"><TextBlock Text="{Binding Tag}" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="{Binding TagFg}"/></Border>
                                        </WrapPanel>
                                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding Desc}" Style="{StaticResource Body}" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,6,0,0"/>
                                      </StackPanel>
                                    </DockPanel>
                                  </Border>
                                </DataTemplate>
                              </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                            </ItemsControl>
                          </StackPanel>
                        </DataTemplate>
                      </ContentControl.ContentTemplate>
                    </ContentControl>
                  </ScrollViewer>
                </Border>
              </Grid>
            </DockPanel>
          </Border>
        </Grid>

        <!-- 活动监控：表格占满这一页，表格自己滚动；点列名（CPU、内存、写入速度……）按那一列从高到低排 -->
        <Grid x:Name="HealthViewMon" Visibility="Collapsed" Margin="0,0,6,10">
                    <Border x:Name="HealthCardMon" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,18,24,14">
            <DockPanel>
              <DockPanel DockPanel.Dock="Top">
                <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="20,0,0,0">
                  <Button x:Name="BtnMonStart" Content="开始监控" Style="{StaticResource Primary}"/>
                  <Button x:Name="BtnMonStop" Content="停止" Margin="8,0,0,0" IsEnabled="False"/>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Text="谁在让电脑变慢" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="HealthMonText" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="点「开始监控」，每 3 秒采一次样：各个程序这段时间用了多少 CPU、占多少内存、往磁盘写了多少。点列名按那一列从高到低排，再点一下从低到高。不装常驻服务，关掉本工具就停。"/>
                </StackPanel>
              </DockPanel>
              <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Bottom" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,10,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="「启动以来写入」是 Windows 从进程启动起累计的，重启过的进程从头算；写入量不等于磁盘净占用增长（临时文件写了又删）。哪个进程写了哪个文件，只有监控开着的时候能对上：把「空间地图 → 最近改动」里变大的文件夹和这里写入多的程序放在一起看。"/>
              <ListView x:Name="MonList" Margin="0,12,0,0" Background="White" BorderThickness="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource GridRow}">
                <ListView.View>
                  <GridView>
                    <GridViewColumn Header="程序" Width="250">
                      <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><StackPanel><TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/><TextBlock Text="{Binding Meta}" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></StackPanel></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                    </GridViewColumn>
                    <GridViewColumn Header="CPU" Width="70"><GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding CpuText}" TextAlignment="Right"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate></GridViewColumn>
                    <GridViewColumn Header="内存" Width="90"><GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding WsText}" TextAlignment="Right"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate></GridViewColumn>
                    <GridViewColumn Header="写入速度" Width="100"><GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding RateText}" TextAlignment="Right"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate></GridViewColumn>
                    <GridViewColumn Header="本次监控写入" Width="200">
                      <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><Border Width="{Binding Bar}" Height="8" Background="#3B82F6" CornerRadius="4" VerticalAlignment="Center"/><TextBlock Text="{Binding SinceText}" Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></StackPanel></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                    </GridViewColumn>
                    <GridViewColumn Header="启动以来写入" Width="110"><GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding TotalText}" TextAlignment="Right"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate></GridViewColumn>
                  </GridView>
                </ListView.View>
              </ListView>
            </DockPanel>
          </Border>
        </Grid>
        <ScrollViewer x:Name="HealthViewEvents" Visibility="Collapsed" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
          <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,14">
          <!-- Windows 事件 -->
          <Border x:Name="HealthCardEvents" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20">
            <StackPanel>
              <TextBlock Text="Windows 事件：最近 7 天的严重错误" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
              <TextBlock x:Name="HealthWinText" Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,8,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text=""/>
              <ItemsControl x:Name="HealthErrors" Margin="0,6,0,0" ItemTemplate="{StaticResource NoteRowTpl}"/>
              <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,10,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="系统日志里「严重」和「错误」两级，按来源归并。很多错误是无害的（比如某个服务启动慢了一次）；同一个来源反复出现、时间又和故障对得上的才值得查。详细内容在 Windows 的「事件查看器」里。"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </Border>
          </StackPanel>
        </ScrollViewer>
      </Grid>
    </Grid>
    <Grid x:Name="PageApps" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Margin="30,24,30,14" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
      </Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,16">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0">
          <Button x:Name="BtnAppsUpdates" Content="检查新版本" Margin="0,0,8,0" ToolTip="用 Windows 自带的 winget 查一下装过的软件有没有新版本。只在你点的时候联网，只查不改"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnAppsRefresh" Content="刷新"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="软件管理" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="看软件占了多少，卸载、清残留，或者搬到其他盘。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </DockPanel>
      <DockPanel Grid.Row="1" Margin="0,0,0,10">
        <Border x:Name="AppsViewBox" DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,14,0">
          <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
            <RadioButton x:Name="AppsViewApps" GroupName="appsv" Content="软件" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="AppsViewStartup" GroupName="appsv" Content="开机启动" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="AppsViewTasks" GroupName="appsv" Content="计划任务" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="AppsViewMenu" GroupName="appsv" Content="右键菜单" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="AppsViewLeft" GroupName="appsv" Content="残留文件夹" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Border>
        <Border x:Name="AppsFilterBox" DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,14,0">
          <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
            <RadioButton x:Name="AppsAll" GroupName="appsf" Content="全部" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="AppsC" GroupName="appsf" Content="装在 C 盘的" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton x:Name="AppsStore" GroupName="appsf" Content="应用商店" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Border>
        <TextBlock x:Name="AppsInfo" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="14,0,0,0" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" ToolTip="{Binding Text, RelativeSource={RelativeSource Self}}"/>
        <DockPanel>
          <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE721;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="12" Foreground="#6E6E73" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <TextBox x:Name="AppsSearch" MaxWidth="320" HorizontalAlignment="Left" MinWidth="200" ToolTip="按名字或发行商搜索"/>
        </DockPanel>
      </DockPanel>
      <StackPanel Grid.Row="2">
      <Border x:Name="AppsBatchBox" Background="#E3EEFF" BorderBrush="#B9D3F7" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="10" Padding="16,10" Margin="0,0,0,10" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <DockPanel>
          <Button x:Name="BtnBatchStop" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="停止" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="8,0,0,0" ToolTip="不再打开后面的卸载程序；已经打开的那个照常走完"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnBatchNext" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="打开下一个" Style="{StaticResource Small}" ToolTip="这个卸载程序已经走完了但没自动接上时，点这里打开下一个"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="AppsBatchText" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,12,0"/>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>
      <Border x:Name="AppsLeftBox" Background="#FFF8EC" BorderBrush="#F3D9A8" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="10" Padding="16,10" Margin="0,0,0,10" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <DockPanel>
          <Button x:Name="BtnAppsLeftClose" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="不用了" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="8,0,0,0"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnAppsLeft" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="检查残留" Style="{StaticResource Small}"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="AppsLeftText" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,12,0"/>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>
      </StackPanel>
      <Border Grid.Row="3" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="0,2,0,6">
        <DockPanel Grid.IsSharedSizeScope="True">
        <!-- 表头：点列名排序（软件：名称、发行商、安装日期、大小；开机启动等：名称、状态） -->
        <Border x:Name="AppsHeadBox" DockPanel.Dock="Top" Style="{StaticResource HeadBar}" Margin="6,0,6,2">
          <Grid>
            <Grid x:Name="AppsHead" Margin="12,0,10,0">
              <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="30"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="40"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="100"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="AppAct"/>
              </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <CheckBox x:Name="AppsPickAll" Grid.Column="0" VerticalAlignment="Center" ToolTip="勾上这里列出的全部；再点一下全部取消"/>
              <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Orientation="Horizontal">
                <Button Tag="name" Content="名称" Style="{StaticResource ColHead}"/>
                <TextBlock Text="·" Foreground="#C7C7CC" Margin="7,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                <Button Tag="pub" Content="发行商" Style="{StaticResource ColHead}"/>
                <TextBlock Text="·" Foreground="#C7C7CC" Margin="7,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                <Button Tag="date" Content="安装日期" Style="{StaticResource ColHead}"/>
              </StackPanel>
              <Button Grid.Column="3" Tag="size" Content="大小" Style="{StaticResource ColHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
            </Grid>
            <Grid x:Name="StartHead" Margin="12,0,10,0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="30"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="80"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="StartAct"/>
              </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <CheckBox x:Name="StartPickAll" Grid.Column="0" VerticalAlignment="Center" ToolTip="勾上这里列出的全部；再点一下全部取消"/>
              <Button Grid.Column="1" Tag="name" Content="名称" Style="{StaticResource ColHead}"/>
              <Button Grid.Column="2" Tag="status" Content="状态" Style="{StaticResource ColHead}"/>
            </Grid>
          </Grid>
        </Border>
        <!-- 勾选了几项时出现：一次卸载 / 禁用 / 启用 / 移到回收站 -->
        <Border x:Name="AppsPickBar" DockPanel.Dock="Bottom" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="0,1,0,0" Padding="18,10,14,6" Visibility="Collapsed">
          <DockPanel>
            <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal">
              <Button x:Name="BtnPickClear" Content="取消选择" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnPickEnable" Content="启用选中的" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnPickDisable" Content="禁用选中的" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnPickRecycle" Content="移到回收站…" Style="{StaticResource Danger}" Padding="14,4"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnPickUninstall" Content="卸载选中的…" Style="{StaticResource Danger}" Padding="14,4"/>
            </StackPanel>
            <TextBlock x:Name="AppsPickText" VerticalAlignment="Center" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
          </DockPanel>
        </Border>
        <Grid>
          <ListView x:Name="AppsList" Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource SelRow}"
                    ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" VirtualizingPanel.IsVirtualizing="True" VirtualizingPanel.VirtualizationMode="Recycling">
            <ListView.ItemTemplate>
              <DataTemplate>
                <Grid Margin="12,8,10,8">
                  <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="30"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="40"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="100"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="AppAct"/>
                  </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <CheckBox Grid.Column="0" IsChecked="{Binding Picked, Mode=TwoWay}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Focusable="False" Cursor="Hand"/>
                  <Border Grid.Column="1" Width="30" Height="30" CornerRadius="8" Background="#EFEFF4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <Grid>
                      <TextBlock x:Name="AppLetter" Text="{Binding Icon}" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#636366" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                      <Image Source="{Binding IconImage}" Width="22" Height="22" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" RenderOptions.BitmapScalingMode="HighQuality"/>
                    </Grid>
                  </Border>
                  <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,12,0">
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontSize="13.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Meta}" FontSize="12" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Column="3" Text="{Binding SizeText}" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
                  <StackPanel Grid.Column="4" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <Button x:Name="AppUpgrade" Content="升级" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Foreground="#0066CC" Margin="0,0,6,0" Visibility="Collapsed"
                            ToolTip="在终端窗口里用 winget 升级这个软件，过程和提示都看得见"/>
                    <Button x:Name="AppOpen" Content="打开位置" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,6,0"/>
                    <Button x:Name="AppMove" Content="搬到其他盘" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,6,0" Visibility="{DynamicResource AppMoveVis}"
                            ToolTip="把整个安装文件夹搬到其他盘，C 盘原位置留一个链接，软件照常使用，不用重装"/>
                    <Button x:Name="AppNoMove" Content="不能搬" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,12,0" Visibility="{DynamicResource AppMoveVis}"
                            VerticalAlignment="Center" Cursor="Help" ToolTip="{Binding MoveWhy}"/>
                    <Button x:Name="AppUninstall" Content="卸载" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </Grid>
                <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding CanMove}" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="AppMove" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding ShowWhy}" Value="False"><Setter TargetName="AppNoMove" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasImage}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="AppLetter" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding HasUpgrade}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="AppUpgrade" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
                </DataTemplate.Triggers>
              </DataTemplate>
            </ListView.ItemTemplate>
          </ListView>
          <!-- 开机启动 / 计划任务 / 右键菜单：同一个列表，按视图换内容 -->
          <ListView x:Name="StartList" Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource SelRow}" Visibility="Collapsed"
                    ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" VirtualizingPanel.IsVirtualizing="True" VirtualizingPanel.VirtualizationMode="Recycling">
            <ListView.ItemTemplate>
              <DataTemplate>
                <Grid Margin="12,8,10,8">
                  <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="30"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="80"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="StartAct"/>
                  </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <CheckBox x:Name="Pk" Grid.Column="0" IsChecked="{Binding Picked, Mode=TwoWay}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Focusable="False" Cursor="Hand"/>
                  <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,12,0">
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontSize="13.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Meta}" FontSize="12" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,2,0,0"/>
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Detail}" FontSize="12" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,1,0,0" ToolTip="{Binding Detail}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Column="2" Text="{Binding StatusText}" Foreground="{Binding StatusBrush}" FontWeight="SemiBold" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
                  <StackPanel Grid.Column="3" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <Button x:Name="StartOpen" Content="打开位置" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,6,0"/>
                    <Button x:Name="StartToggle" Content="{Binding ToggleText}" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" MinWidth="64"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </Grid>
                <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Open}" Value=""><Setter TargetName="StartOpen" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed"/></DataTrigger>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding Ours}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="StartToggle" Property="IsEnabled" Value="False"/><Setter TargetName="StartToggle" Property="ToolTip" Value="本工具自己的任务，请在「自动提醒」页开关"/><Setter TargetName="Pk" Property="Visibility" Value="Hidden"/></DataTrigger>
                </DataTemplate.Triggers>
              </DataTemplate>
            </ListView.ItemTemplate>
          </ListView>
          <StackPanel x:Name="EmptyApps" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False">
            <TextBlock Text="&#xE71D;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="32" Foreground="#C7C7CC" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="EmptyAppsText" Text="正在读取已安装的软件…" Foreground="#6E6E73" FontSize="14" Margin="0,12,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Grid>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 搬家管理 ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageMoves" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Margin="30,24,30,14" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
      </Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,16">
        <Button x:Name="BtnMovesRefresh" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="刷新" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0" ToolTip="重新看看 C 盘上还有什么能搬，并刷新已经搬走的状态"/>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="搬家管理" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="把聊天记录、软件和大文件夹搬到其他盘，软件照常使用。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </DockPanel>
      <TextBlock Grid.Row="1" x:Name="MovesInfo" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="2,0,0,12" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
      <!-- 左边目录：「可以搬的」下面按聊天记录、软件、其他文件夹、不适合搬的分开看；「已经搬走的」单独一项 -->
      <Grid Grid.Row="2">
        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="214"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <Border Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="8,0,8,10" Margin="0,0,16,0" VerticalAlignment="Top">
          <StackPanel>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MovesTabCand" GroupName="movestab" Style="{StaticResource TreeTop}" IsChecked="True">
              <DockPanel><Border x:Name="MovesTabCandB" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource TabBadge}" Visibility="Collapsed"><TextBlock x:Name="MovesTabCandN" Style="{StaticResource TabBadgeText}"/></Border><TextBlock Text="可以搬的" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></DockPanel>
            </RadioButton>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MNavChat" GroupName="movestab" Tag="chat" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}">
              <DockPanel><Border x:Name="MNavChatB" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource TabBadge}" Visibility="Collapsed"><TextBlock x:Name="MNavChatN" Style="{StaticResource TabBadgeText}"/></Border><TextBlock Text="聊天记录" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></DockPanel>
            </RadioButton>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MNavApp" GroupName="movestab" Tag="app" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}">
              <DockPanel><Border x:Name="MNavAppB" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource TabBadge}" Visibility="Collapsed"><TextBlock x:Name="MNavAppN" Style="{StaticResource TabBadgeText}"/></Border><TextBlock Text="装在 C 盘的软件" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></DockPanel>
            </RadioButton>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MNavOther" GroupName="movestab" Tag="other" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}">
              <DockPanel><Border x:Name="MNavOtherB" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource TabBadge}" Visibility="Collapsed"><TextBlock x:Name="MNavOtherN" Style="{StaticResource TabBadgeText}"/></Border><TextBlock Text="其他可搬的文件夹" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></DockPanel>
            </RadioButton>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MNavBlocked" GroupName="movestab" Tag="blocked" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}">
              <DockPanel><Border x:Name="MNavBlockedB" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource TabBadge}" Visibility="Collapsed"><TextBlock x:Name="MNavBlockedN" Style="{StaticResource TabBadgeText}"/></Border><TextBlock Text="不适合搬的软件" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></DockPanel>
            </RadioButton>
            <RadioButton x:Name="MovesTabDone" GroupName="movestab" Style="{StaticResource TreeTop}">
              <DockPanel><Border x:Name="MovesTabDoneB" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource TabBadge}" Visibility="Collapsed"><TextBlock x:Name="MovesTabDoneN" Style="{StaticResource TabBadgeText}"/></Border><TextBlock Text="已经搬走的" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></DockPanel>
            </RadioButton>
          </StackPanel>
        </Border>
      <Grid Grid.Column="1" Grid.IsSharedSizeScope="True">
        <!-- 可以搬的：按聊天记录、软件、其他文件夹分组，勾选后一起搬；表头排序在每一组里面排 -->
        <DockPanel x:Name="CandBox">
        <Grid x:Name="CandHead" DockPanel.Dock="Top" Margin="15,0,15,6">
          <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
            <ColumnDefinition Width="30"/>
            <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
            <ColumnDefinition Width="100"/>
            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="CandAct"/>
          </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
          <Button Grid.Column="1" Tag="name" Content="名称" Style="{StaticResource ColHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
          <Button Grid.Column="2" Tag="size" Content="大小" Style="{StaticResource ColHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
        </Grid>
        <ListView x:Name="CandList" Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource PlainRow}" ItemTemplate="{StaticResource CandRowTpl}"
                  ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" AlternationCount="1000000">
          <ListView.GroupStyle>
            <GroupStyle ContainerStyle="{StaticResource CardGroup}"/>
          </ListView.GroupStyle>
        </ListView>
        </DockPanel>
        <StackPanel x:Name="EmptyCand" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False">
          <TextBlock Text="&#xE8AB;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="32" Foreground="#C7C7CC" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="EmptyCandText" Text="正在看 C 盘上还有什么能搬…" Foreground="#6E6E73" FontSize="14" Margin="0,12,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" MaxWidth="520" TextAlignment="Center"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <!-- 已经搬走的 -->
        <Border x:Name="MovesCard" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="0,2,0,6" Visibility="Collapsed">
          <DockPanel>
          <Border x:Name="MovesHeadBox" DockPanel.Dock="Top" Style="{StaticResource HeadBar}" Margin="6,0,6,2">
            <Grid x:Name="MovesHead" Margin="14,0,10,0">
              <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="100"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="MoveAct"/>
              </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
              <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Orientation="Horizontal">
                <Button Tag="name" Content="名称" Style="{StaticResource ColHead}"/>
                <TextBlock Text="·" Foreground="#C7C7CC" Margin="7,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                <Button Tag="state" Content="状态" Style="{StaticResource ColHead}"/>
              </StackPanel>
              <Button Grid.Column="1" Tag="size" Content="大小" Style="{StaticResource ColHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Right" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
            </Grid>
          </Border>
          <Grid>
          <ListView x:Name="MovesList" Background="Transparent" BorderThickness="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource SelRow}" ScrollViewer.HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled">
            <ListView.ItemTemplate>
              <DataTemplate>
                <Grid Margin="14,10,10,10">
                  <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="100"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" SharedSizeGroup="MoveAct"/>
                  </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                  <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Margin="0,0,12,0">
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Name}" FontSize="13.5" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
                    <TextBlock FontSize="12" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" Margin="0,2,0,0">
                      <Run Text="{Binding Src, Mode=OneWay}"/><Run Text="  →  "/><Run Text="{Binding Dst, Mode=OneWay}"/>
                    </TextBlock>
                    <TextBlock Text="{Binding Status}" Foreground="{Binding StatusBrush}" FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,4,0,0"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                  <TextBlock Grid.Column="1" Text="{Binding SizeText}" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextAlignment="Right" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
                  <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <Button x:Name="MvOpen" Content="打开" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,6,0"/>
                    <Button x:Name="MvFix" Content="修复链接" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,6,0" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
                    <Button x:Name="MvDrop" Content="删除多余副本" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Margin="0,0,6,0" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
                    <Button x:Name="MvBack" Content="搬回 C 盘" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource Small}" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </Grid>
                <DataTemplate.Triggers>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding CanFix}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="MvFix" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding CanDrop}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="MvDrop" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
                  <DataTrigger Binding="{Binding CanBack}" Value="True"><Setter TargetName="MvBack" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible"/></DataTrigger>
                </DataTemplate.Triggers>
              </DataTemplate>
            </ListView.ItemTemplate>
          </ListView>
          <StackPanel x:Name="EmptyMoves" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False">
            <TextBlock Text="&#xE8AB;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="32" Foreground="#C7C7CC" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="EmptyMovesText" Text="还没有搬过文件夹。在「可以搬的」里勾选要搬的项目，或者在「清理 C 盘」里选「搬到其他盘」，搬好的就会出现在这里。" Foreground="#6E6E73" FontSize="14" Margin="0,12,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" MaxWidth="520" TextAlignment="Center"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Grid>
        </DockPanel>
        </Border>
      </Grid>
      </Grid>
      <DockPanel x:Name="CandStore" Grid.Row="3" Margin="2,10,0,0" Visibility="Collapsed">
        <Button x:Name="BtnCandStore" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="打开 Windows 设置" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
        <TextBlock x:Name="CandStoreText" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
      </DockPanel>
      <DockPanel x:Name="CandBar" Grid.Row="4" Margin="0,14,0,0">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal">
          <TextBlock Text="搬到" VerticalAlignment="Center" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <ComboBox x:Name="MovesDest" Width="320" Margin="0,0,8,0" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnCandMove" Content="搬到其他盘" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Padding="20,6" IsEnabled="False"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
          <Button x:Name="BtnCandAll" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="全选" Margin="0,0,12,0" ToolTip="勾选所有聊天记录和软件。「其他文件夹」请看清说明再自己勾选"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnCandNone" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="全不选" Margin="0,0,16,0"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="CandSel" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" Foreground="#6E6E73" Text="勾选要搬的项目。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </DockPanel>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 自动提醒 ==================== -->
    <!-- 自动提醒：标题旁一排选项卡（空间提醒 / 定期自动清理 / 空间变化），点哪项只显示哪项 -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageAuto" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Visibility="Collapsed" Margin="30,24,30,14">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="*"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <WrapPanel Grid.Row="0">
        <TextBlock Text="自动提醒" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,22,4"/>
        <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,2,0,4">
          <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
              <RadioButton x:Name="ATabRemind" GroupName="atab" Style="{StaticResource Seg}" IsChecked="True">
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="空间提醒"/><Border x:Name="ATabRemindB" Style="{StaticResource TabBadge}"><TextBlock x:Name="ATabRemindState" Style="{StaticResource TabBadgeText}"/></Border></StackPanel>
              </RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="ATabClean" GroupName="atab" Style="{StaticResource Seg}">
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="定期自动清理"/><Border x:Name="ATabCleanB" Style="{StaticResource TabBadge}"><TextBlock x:Name="ATabCleanState" Style="{StaticResource TabBadgeText}"/></Border></StackPanel>
              </RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="ATabHist" GroupName="atab" Style="{StaticResource Seg}">
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="空间变化"/><Border x:Name="ATabHistB" Style="{StaticResource TabBadge}"><TextBlock x:Name="ATabHistState" Style="{StaticResource TabBadgeText}"/></Border></StackPanel>
              </RadioButton>
          </StackPanel>
        </Border>
      </WrapPanel>
      <Grid Grid.Row="1">
        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="C 盘快满时提醒你，定期自动清理缓存。默认都关着。"/>
      </Grid>
      <Grid Grid.Row="2" Margin="0,18,0,0">
        <ScrollViewer x:Name="AutoViewRemind" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
          <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,14">
            <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20">
              <StackPanel>
                <DockPanel>
                  <CheckBox x:Name="AutoRemindOn" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                  <TextBlock Text="C 盘空间不足时提醒我" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                </DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Text="剩余空间低于" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,10,0"/>
                  <ComboBox x:Name="AutoRemindGB" Width="100">
                    <ComboBoxItem Content="10 GB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="20 GB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="30 GB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="50 GB"/>
                  </ComboBox>
                  <TextBlock Text="时，在屏幕右下角弹出提醒（每天最多一次）" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="10,0,0,0"/>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel x:Name="AutoJunkRow" Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,10,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Text="可以清理的临时文件、缓存和日志超过" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,10,0"/>
                  <ComboBox x:Name="AutoJunkGB" Width="100">
                    <ComboBoxItem Content="不提醒"/><ComboBoxItem Content="1 GB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="2 GB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="5 GB"/><ComboBoxItem Content="10 GB"/>
                  </ComboBox>
                  <TextBlock Text="时也提醒（检查时只统计，不删任何东西）" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="10,0,0,0"/>
                </StackPanel>
                <TextBlock x:Name="AutoRemindNote" Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,12,0,0" Foreground="#6E6E73"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>
          </StackPanel>
        </ScrollViewer>
        <ScrollViewer x:Name="AutoViewClean" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False" Visibility="Collapsed">
          <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,14">
            <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20">
              <StackPanel>
                <DockPanel>
                  <CheckBox x:Name="AutoCleanOn" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                  <TextBlock Text="定期自动清理" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                </DockPanel>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Text="什么时候清理" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,0,10,0"/>
                  <ComboBox x:Name="AutoCleanWhen" Width="110">
                    <ComboBoxItem Content="每周日"/><ComboBoxItem Content="每周一"/><ComboBoxItem Content="每周二"/><ComboBoxItem Content="每周三"/><ComboBoxItem Content="每周四"/><ComboBoxItem Content="每周五"/><ComboBoxItem Content="每周六"/><ComboBoxItem Content="每天"/>
                  </ComboBox>
                  <TextBlock Text="中午 12:30（错过了就在下次开机后）" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="10,0,0,0"/>
                </StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,10,0,0"
                           Text="不用开着本工具。到时间由 Windows 任务计划在后台自动做一遍「安全清理」里的项目：临时文件、各类缓存和日志。不搬家、不清空回收站、不碰任何个人文件夹、不碰你自己加的文件夹，也不会关闭正在运行的软件（被占用的文件直接跳过）。做完在右下角告诉你释放了多少，每一项都记在「操作日志」里。"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="AutoCleanNote" Style="{StaticResource Body}" Margin="0,10,0,0" Foreground="#6E6E73"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>
          </StackPanel>
        </ScrollViewer>
        <ScrollViewer x:Name="AutoViewHist" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False" Visibility="Collapsed">
          <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,14">
            <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20">
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="C 盘空间变化" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="HistInfo" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,4,0,12" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                <Border Height="220" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="0,0,0,1">
                  <!-- 柱子平均铺满整个宽度：窗口拉宽时柱子之间的空隙跟着变大，柱子最宽 28 -->
                  <ItemsControl x:Name="HistChart" VerticalAlignment="Bottom">
                    <ItemsControl.ItemsPanel><ItemsPanelTemplate><UniformGrid Rows="1"/></ItemsPanelTemplate></ItemsControl.ItemsPanel>
                    <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                      <DataTemplate>
                        <Border MaxWidth="28" Height="{Binding H}" Background="{Binding Fill}" CornerRadius="4,4,0,0" Margin="2,0" VerticalAlignment="Bottom" ToolTip="{Binding Tip}"/>
                      </DataTemplate>
                    </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                  </ItemsControl>
                </Border>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,6,0,0">
                  <TextBlock x:Name="HistLast" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Caption}"/>
                  <TextBlock x:Name="HistFirst" Style="{StaticResource Caption}"/>
                </DockPanel>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,10,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap"
                           Text="柱子越高表示 C 盘已经用掉的越多（每天取最后一次记录）。每次打开本工具、每次定时检查都会记一笔。想知道是哪些文件夹变大了，到「空间地图」扫一遍，再选「和上次比」。"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>
          </StackPanel>
        </ScrollViewer>
      </Grid>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 操作日志 ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageLog" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Margin="30,24,30,14" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
      </Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <DockPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,14">
        <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0">
          <Button x:Name="BtnLogOpenDir" Content="打开日志文件夹" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
          <Button x:Name="BtnLogRefresh" Content="刷新"/>
        </StackPanel>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="操作日志" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="每一次删除、搬家和设置改动都记在这里。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </DockPanel>
      <Border Grid.Row="1" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="20,14" Margin="0,0,0,12">
        <DockPanel>
          <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Left" Margin="0,2,24,0">
            <TextBlock Text="日志保存时间" FontWeight="SemiBold"/>
            <ComboBox x:Name="LogKeep" Width="150" Margin="0,8,0,0">
              <ComboBoxItem Content="1 个月" Tag="1"/><ComboBoxItem Content="3 个月" Tag="3"/><ComboBoxItem Content="半年（默认）" Tag="6"/>
              <ComboBoxItem Content="1 年" Tag="12"/><ComboBoxItem Content="2 年" Tag="24"/><ComboBoxItem Content="永久保存" Tag="0"/>
            </ComboBox>
          </StackPanel>
          <TextBlock x:Name="LogKeepNote" Style="{StaticResource Body}" Foreground="#3A3A3C"/>
        </DockPanel>
      </Border>
      <WrapPanel Grid.Row="2" Margin="0,0,0,10">
        <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" Margin="0,0,12,6" VerticalAlignment="Center">
          <StackPanel x:Name="LogCats" Orientation="Horizontal">
            <RadioButton GroupName="logcat" Content="全部" Tag="" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton GroupName="logcat" Content="删除" Tag="删除" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton GroupName="logcat" Content="搬运" Tag="搬运" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton GroupName="logcat" Content="合并" Tag="合并" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton GroupName="logcat" Content="压缩" Tag="压缩" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton GroupName="logcat" Content="卸载" Tag="卸载" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton GroupName="logcat" Content="系统设置" Tag="系统设置" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Border>
        <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" Margin="0,0,12,6" VerticalAlignment="Center">
          <StackPanel x:Name="LogRange" Orientation="Horizontal">
            <RadioButton GroupName="logrange" Content="7 天" Tag="7" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton GroupName="logrange" Content="30 天" Tag="30" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
            <RadioButton GroupName="logrange" Content="全部" Tag="0" IsChecked="True" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Border>
        <TextBox x:Name="LogSearch" Width="220" Margin="0,0,12,6" ToolTip="按文件名、文件夹或操作搜索"/>
        <TextBlock x:Name="LogCount" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="0,0,0,6"/>
      </WrapPanel>
      <Border Grid.Row="3" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="0,0,0,6">
        <Grid>
          <ListView x:Name="LogList" Background="White" BorderThickness="0" ItemContainerStyle="{StaticResource GridRow}"
                    VirtualizingPanel.IsVirtualizing="True" VirtualizingPanel.VirtualizationMode="Recycling">
            <ListView.View>
              <GridView>
                <GridViewColumn Header="时间" Width="150">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Time}" Foreground="#6E6E73"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
                <GridViewColumn Header="类别" Width="84">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                    <DataTemplate>
                      <Border CornerRadius="9" Padding="8,1,8,2" Background="{Binding CatBg}" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding CatText}" FontSize="12" Foreground="{Binding CatFg}"/>
                      </Border>
                    </DataTemplate>
                  </GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
                <GridViewColumn Header="操作" Width="210">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding What}" ToolTip="{Binding What}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
                <GridViewColumn Header="对象" Width="360">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Target}" ToolTip="{Binding Target}" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
                <GridViewColumn Header="详情" Width="250">
                  <GridViewColumn.CellTemplate><DataTemplate><TextBlock Text="{Binding Detail}" ToolTip="{Binding Detail}" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></DataTemplate></GridViewColumn.CellTemplate>
                </GridViewColumn>
              </GridView>
            </ListView.View>
          </ListView>
          <StackPanel x:Name="EmptyLog" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" Margin="0,30,0,0">
            <TextBlock Text="&#xE81C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="32" Foreground="#C7C7CC" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="EmptyLogText" Text="还没有操作记录" Foreground="#6E6E73" FontSize="14" Margin="0,12,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Center"/>
          </StackPanel>
        </Grid>
      </Border>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 设置：外观、语言、显示哪些内容 ==================== -->
    <!-- 设置：左边目录（常用、界面、清理和扫描），点哪项右边只显示那一项 -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageSettings" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Visibility="Collapsed" Margin="30,24,30,14">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="*"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <Grid Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,16">
      <DockPanel>
        <Button x:Name="BtnSetReset" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="恢复默认显示" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="16,4,0,0"
                ToolTip="页面、按钮、列和说明全部恢复成默认显示。外观、语言和扫描设置不变"/>
        <StackPanel>
          <TextBlock Text="设置" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="外观、语言，以及界面上显示什么。"/>
        </StackPanel>
      </DockPanel>
      </Grid>
      <Grid Grid.Row="1">
        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="214"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <Border Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="8,0,8,10" Margin="0,0,16,0" VerticalAlignment="Top">
          <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
            <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SetHeadGeneral" Text="常用" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SetNavMode" GroupName="setnav" Tag="Mode" Content="使用模式" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SetNavLook" GroupName="setnav" Tag="Look" Content="外观和语言" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SetHeadUi" Text="界面" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SetNavDisplay" GroupName="setnav" Tag="Display" Content="界面上显示什么" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SetNavMap" GroupName="setnav" Tag="Map" Content="空间地图" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SetHeadClean" Text="清理和扫描" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SetNavClean" GroupName="setnav" Tag="Clean" Content="清理列表" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SetNavScan" GroupName="setnav" Tag="Scan" Content="扫描和查重" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SetHeadChanges" Text="改动" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
                <RadioButton x:Name="SetNavChanges" GroupName="setnav" Tag="Changes" Content="本工具改过的" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}"/>
            </StackPanel>
          </ScrollViewer>
        </Border>
        <ScrollViewer x:Name="SetScroll" Grid.Column="1" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
          <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,14">
            <Border x:Name="SetCardMode" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="使用模式" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="决定界面上有多少功能。换模式不会丢任何设置和记录。"/>
                <Border Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="0,12,0,0">
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                    <RadioButton x:Name="SetModeBasic" GroupName="mode" Content="普通用户" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                    <RadioButton x:Name="SetModePro" GroupName="mode" Content="工程师" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                    <RadioButton x:Name="SetModeExpert" GroupName="mode" Content="开发者和 IT" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </Border>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SetModeNote" Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SetCardLook" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="外观和语言" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock Text="外观" Style="{StaticResource SetName}" Margin="0,14,0,0"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="跟随系统时照 Windows 的「选择应用模式」。更改后本工具会重新打开。"/>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <RadioButton x:Name="SetThemeLight" GroupName="settheme" Style="{StaticResource ThemeCard}">
                    <StackPanel><Border x:Name="SetThemeLightPic" Style="{StaticResource ThemePic}"/><TextBlock Text="浅色" Style="{StaticResource ThemeLbl}"/></StackPanel>
                  </RadioButton>
                  <RadioButton x:Name="SetThemeDark" GroupName="settheme" Style="{StaticResource ThemeCard}">
                    <StackPanel><Border x:Name="SetThemeDarkPic" Style="{StaticResource ThemePic}"/><TextBlock Text="深色" Style="{StaticResource ThemeLbl}"/></StackPanel>
                  </RadioButton>
                  <RadioButton x:Name="SetThemeSystem" GroupName="settheme" Style="{StaticResource ThemeCard}">
                    <StackPanel><Border x:Name="SetThemeSystemPic" Style="{StaticResource ThemePic}"/><TextBlock Text="跟随系统" Style="{StaticResource ThemeLbl}"/></StackPanel>
                  </RadioButton>
                </StackPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,22,0,0">
                  <Border DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource SegBox}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                      <RadioButton x:Name="SetLangZh" GroupName="setlang" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                      <RadioButton x:Name="SetLangEn" GroupName="setlang" Style="{StaticResource Seg}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <TextBlock Text="界面语言" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="更改后本工具会重新打开。"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SetCardDisplay" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="界面上显示什么" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock Text="左侧显示的页面" Style="{StaticResource SetName}" Margin="0,14,0,0"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="「清理 C 盘」「空间地图」「帮助」和「设置」一直显示。关掉的页面只是不在左边列出，设置和记录都照旧。"/>
                <WrapPanel Margin="0,2,0,0">
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetPageDup" Content="重复文件" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetPageSave" Content="省空间" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetPageApps" Content="软件管理" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetPageHealth" Content="系统健康" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetPageMoves" Content="搬家管理" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetPageAuto" Content="自动提醒" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetPageLog" Content="操作日志" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                </WrapPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="左下角的按钮" Style="{StaticResource SetName}" Margin="0,18,0,0"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="外观和语言在这一页上面也能改；「使用反馈」和「运行记录」在帮助里也有。"/>
                <WrapPanel Margin="0,2,0,0">
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetLinkTheme" Content="外观" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetLinkLang" Content="切换语言" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetLinkFeedback" Content="使用反馈" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetLinkLog" Content="运行记录" Width="170" Margin="0,10,0,0"/>
                </WrapPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,18,0,0">
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetPageSub" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                  <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="页面标题下的说明" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="每一页标题下面那行灰色的说明。关掉后列表能多显示几行。"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SetCardMap" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="空间地图" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetMapCheck" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                  <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="项目复选框" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="每一行前面显示一个复选框，点方框才选中，按 Esc 全部取消。关掉就照 Windows 原来的做法：单击选中，按住 Ctrl 或 Shift 多选。都可以按住鼠标上下拖，一次选中连着的几行。"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetMapBar" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                  <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="占比条" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="名字右边的蓝色横条，表示占了多少。"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetMapPct" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                  <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="百分比" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="占这一层的百分之几。"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetMapMeta" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                  <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="名字下面的详细信息" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="文件个数、最近修改时间、比上次扫描变了多少、链接指向哪里。"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetMapDisk" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                  <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="实际占用和硬链接" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="快速扫描时注明压缩、稀疏和只在云端的文件实际占多少，以及硬链接（删了也不腾空间）。"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetMapHealth" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                  <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="磁盘健康卡片" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="页面上方每块盘一张卡片：用量、健康状态，固态硬盘还有温度和磨损。"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetMapFastBtn" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                  <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="右上角的「快速扫描」开关" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="只是不在空间地图上显示这个开关；快速扫描本身在「扫描和查重」里开关。"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SetCardChanges" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="本工具改过的" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Margin="0,6,0,0" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="这台电脑上本工具做过、现在还在生效的改动，每一项写着怎么改回去。删了什么、什么时候做的，完整记录在「操作日志」里。"/>
                <StackPanel x:Name="SetChangesList" Margin="0,12,0,0"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SetChangesEmpty" Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Margin="0,12,0,0" Text="正在读取…"/>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,22,0,0">
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetRestorePoint" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                  <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="改系统设置前先建一个还原点" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Text="在「省空间」和「常见问题修复」里改系统设置之前，先用 Windows 的系统还原建一个还原点，出问题可以回到改之前。要几十秒；一次打开本工具最多建一次，Windows 自己也限制一天一个；系统保护没开时建不成，照常继续。本工具从不删还原点。"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SetCardScan" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="扫描和查重" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetFast" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                  <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="快速扫描" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="直接读 NTFS 的文件表，比逐个文件夹查看快得多。少数安全软件会提示，可以关掉。"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
                <DockPanel Margin="0,16,0,0">
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetLowIo" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                  <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="查重复文件时让着其他程序" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="读文件时用 Windows 的后台模式，不拖慢正在用的程序。同时做别的事时会查得慢一些。"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>

            <Border x:Name="SetCleanCard" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="24,20" Margin="0" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Text="清理列表" Style="{StaticResource CardHead}"/>
                <DockPanel x:Name="SetRecycleRow" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <CheckBox x:Name="SetRecycle" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource Switch}" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="20,0,0,0"/>
                  <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="删除时先放进回收站" Style="{StaticResource SetName}"/>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="手动清理删掉的文件先放进回收站，删错了能恢复。放不进回收站的不删。定期自动清理不受影响。"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SetCustomHead" Text="自己加的文件夹" Style="{StaticResource SetName}" Margin="0,14,0,0"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SetCustomNote" Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="清理时删掉这些文件夹里的东西，文件夹本身保留。个人文件夹、系统文件夹和软件的安装文件夹加不进来。"/>
                <ItemsControl x:Name="SetCustomList" Margin="0,6,0,0">
                  <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                    <DataTemplate>
                      <DockPanel Margin="0,4,0,0">
                        <Button x:Name="SetListRemove" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="移除" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" FontSize="12.5" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding}" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" ToolTip="{Binding}"/>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </DataTemplate>
                  </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                </ItemsControl>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SetCustomEmpty" Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="还没有加。" Margin="0,6,0,0"/>
                <Button x:Name="BtnSetCustomAdd" Content="添加文件夹…" Style="{StaticResource Small}" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="0,8,0,0"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SetExcludeHead" Text="排除的文件夹" Style="{StaticResource SetName}" Margin="0,20,0,0"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SetExcludeNote" Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="清理时一律不碰这些文件夹，估算大小时也不算。"/>
                <ItemsControl x:Name="SetExcludeList" Margin="0,6,0,0">
                  <ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                    <DataTemplate>
                      <DockPanel Margin="0,4,0,0">
                        <Button x:Name="SetListRemove" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="移除" Tag="{Binding}" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" FontSize="12.5" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
                        <TextBlock Text="{Binding}" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" ToolTip="{Binding}"/>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </DataTemplate>
                  </ItemsControl.ItemTemplate>
                </ItemsControl>
                <TextBlock x:Name="SetExcludeEmpty" Style="{StaticResource SetNote}" Text="还没有排除。" Margin="0,6,0,0"/>
                <Button x:Name="BtnSetExcludeAdd" Content="添加文件夹…" Style="{StaticResource Small}" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Margin="0,8,0,0"/>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>
          </StackPanel>
        </ScrollViewer>
      </Grid>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 帮助：使用说明、安全风险提示、使用反馈 ==================== -->
    <Grid x:Name="PageHelp" Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="0" Visibility="Collapsed" Margin="30,24,30,14">
      <Grid.RowDefinitions><RowDefinition Height="Auto"/><RowDefinition Height="*"/></Grid.RowDefinitions>
      <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Margin="0,0,0,16">
        <TextBlock Text="帮助" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}"/>
        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource PageSub}" Text="怎么用，哪些东西不会动，以及怎么反馈问题。"/>
      </StackPanel>
      <Grid Grid.Row="1">
        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions><ColumnDefinition Width="214"/><ColumnDefinition Width="*"/></Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
        <Border Grid.Column="0" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="8,0,8,10" Margin="0,0,16,0" VerticalAlignment="Top">
          <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
            <StackPanel x:Name="HelpNav">
              <TextBlock Text="开始" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNavStart" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="start" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="快速上手"><TextBlock Text="快速上手" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <TextBlock Text="清理" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav0" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s0" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="清理 C 盘"><TextBlock Text="清理 C 盘" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav1" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s1" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="重复文件"><TextBlock Text="重复文件" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav2" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s2" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="省空间"><TextBlock Text="省空间" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <TextBlock Text="分析" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav3" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s3" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="空间地图"><TextBlock Text="空间地图" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav4" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s4" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="软件管理"><TextBlock Text="软件管理" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav5" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s5" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="系统健康"><TextBlock Text="系统健康" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <TextBlock Text="管理" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav6" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s6" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="搬家管理"><TextBlock Text="搬家管理" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav7" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s7" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="自动提醒"><TextBlock Text="自动提醒" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav8" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s8" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="操作日志"><TextBlock Text="操作日志" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <TextBlock Text="其他" Style="{StaticResource TreeHead}"/>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNav9" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="s9" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="设置"><TextBlock Text="设置" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNavFaq" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="faq" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="常见问题"><TextBlock Text="常见问题" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
              <RadioButton x:Name="HelpNavFb" GroupName="helpnav" Tag="fb" Style="{StaticResource TreeItem}" ToolTip="反馈和新版本"><TextBlock Text="反馈和新版本" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/></RadioButton>
            </StackPanel>
          </ScrollViewer>
        </Border>
        <ScrollViewer x:Name="HelpScroll" Grid.Column="1" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Disabled" Focusable="False">
          <StackPanel Margin="0,0,6,14">
            <StackPanel x:Name="HelpPaneStart">
              <Border x:Name="RiskCard" Background="#FFF6F6" BorderBrush="#F3C4C8" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="14" Padding="32,28,32,30" Margin="0">
                <DockPanel>
                  <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE7BA;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#D70015" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,3,16,0"/>
                  <StackPanel>
                    <TextBlock Text="安全风险提示" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" Foreground="#A1000F"/>
                    <DockPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="20" Foreground="#6E6E73" Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"><Run>删除操作会把文件从电脑上移除。没有放进回收站的文件，删除后通常无法恢复，可能造成资料丢失。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="20" Foreground="#6E6E73" Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"><Run>每次删除前，请确认这些资料确实不再需要、删除不会给你带来损失。重要资料请先备份。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="20" Foreground="#6E6E73" Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"><Run>本工具只按你的选择执行操作。因使用本工具删除、搬移文件造成的资料丢失或其他损失，</Run><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#A1000F">责任由使用者自行承担，开发者不承担责任</Run><Run>。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel Margin="0,10,0,0">
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="20" Foreground="#6E6E73" Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpPara}"><Run>继续使用本工具，即表示你已了解并接受上述风险。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </StackPanel>
                </DockPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Margin="0,20,0,0">
                <StackPanel>
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="&#xE768;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="19" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,1,12,0"/><TextBlock Text="快速上手" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}"/></StackPanel>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:230:12:12:4" Margin="0,20,0,0">
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="24" Height="24" CornerRadius="12" Background="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,12,0"><TextBlock Text="1" Foreground="White" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                        <StackPanel>
                          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="一键清理" Margin="0,1,0,0"/>
                          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>在「清理 C 盘」点「一键清理」：删除缓存和临时文件，只删不搬。开始前会列出全部项目，确认后才做。聊天记录占得多时，清理页上有一张单独的卡片，点「搬走聊天记录」才搬到其他盘。</Run></TextBlock>
                        </StackPanel>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="24" Height="24" CornerRadius="12" Background="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,12,0"><TextBlock Text="2" Foreground="White" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                        <StackPanel>
                          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="自己挑选" Margin="0,1,0,0"/>
                          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>点「扫描」，在每一行选「删除」「搬到其他盘」或「跳过」，再点「开始处理所选项」。</Run></TextBlock>
                        </StackPanel>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="24" Height="24" CornerRadius="12" Background="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,12,0"><TextBlock Text="3" Foreground="White" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                        <StackPanel>
                          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="找重复文件" Margin="0,1,0,0"/>
                          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>在「重复文件」选好位置，点「开始查找」，核对后删除勾选的文件。</Run></TextBlock>
                        </StackPanel>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                      <DockPanel>
                        <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="24" Height="24" CornerRadius="12" Background="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,0,12,0"><TextBlock Text="4" Foreground="White" FontSize="12.5" FontWeight="SemiBold" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                        <StackPanel>
                          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="看谁占地方" Margin="0,1,0,0"/>
                          <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>在「空间地图」选一块盘扫描，双击文件夹一层层往里看。</Run></TextBlock>
                        </StackPanel>
                      </DockPanel>
                    </Border>
                  </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
            </StackPanel>
            <StackPanel x:Name="HelpSections">
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec0" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xEDA2;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="清理 C 盘" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="删除缓存和临时文件，把聊天记录搬到其他盘" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <TextBlock Text="扫描结果" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,22,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:400:40:16:2" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <DockPanel>
                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="104" VerticalAlignment="Top"><Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E5F4E9"><TextBlock Text="安全清理" FontSize="13" Foreground="#1D7A35" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border></Border>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>缓存、临时文件和日志。删了软件会自动重建。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel>
                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="104" VerticalAlignment="Top"><Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#FFF1DB"><TextBlock Text="清后要重建" FontSize="13" Foreground="#995700" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border></Border>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>浏览器缓存、缩略图、着色器和下载缓存。删了要重新生成，第一次打开会慢一点。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel>
                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="104" VerticalAlignment="Top"><Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#FFF1DB"><TextBlock Text="默认不清" FontSize="13" Foreground="#995700" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border></Border>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>有代价的项目，默认跳过。比如删掉 Windows.old 后，不能再退回旧系统。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel>
                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="104" VerticalAlignment="Top"><Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC"><TextBlock Text="只能搬走" FontSize="13" Foreground="#0B5CAD" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border></Border>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>聊天记录和其他大文件夹。不能删，只能整体搬到其他盘。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel>
                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="104" VerticalAlignment="Top"><Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E5F4E9"><TextBlock Text="受保护" FontSize="13" Foreground="#1D7A35" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border></Border>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>个人文件夹、系统文件夹和软件的安装文件夹，任何清理都不碰。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="删除前看清单"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>确认时点「看文件清单」，可以看到会删掉哪些文件，完整清单能存成文本文件。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="先放进回收站"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>在设置的「清理列表」里打开后，手动清理删掉的文件先进回收站，删错了能恢复。放不进回收站的不会删，日志里写明原因。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="打开所在位置"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>双击一行，打开它所在的文件夹；右键可以复制路径。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="清理哪些缓存"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Windows 的临时文件、更新缓存和日志，常见浏览器、游戏平台和软件的缓存，以及开发工具的下载缓存。只删缓存，不碰 Cookie、历史记录、密码和设置。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="默认不清的项目"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>Windows.old、回收站、Windows Installer 孤儿安装包、旧版驱动包、失效的快捷方式和事件日志等。默认跳过，看清说明再选。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:2">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="自己加文件夹"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>在设置的「清理列表」里添加要清理或要排除的文件夹。添加的文件夹只清里面的东西，文件夹本身保留。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="扫描很快"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>文件夹大小直接从 C 盘的文件表里读，一般几秒钟就扫完。真正删除时，每一项都会重新检查。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <Border Background="#EFF8F1" BorderBrush="#CFE9D6" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12" Padding="18,16,22,17" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <DockPanel>
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xEA18;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#248A3D" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,3,14,0"/>
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="个人文件夹里的东西不会删"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>桌面、文档、下载、图片、视频、音乐和 OneDrive 等文件夹，清理时一律跳过。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <TextBlock Text="搬聊天记录" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,40,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="支持的软件"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>微信、QQ、企业微信、腾讯会议、飞书、钉钉、Telegram、Discord、Slack、Signal、LINE、Viber、KakaoTalk 和 Zoom。应用商店版请在 Windows 设置的「应用」里用「移动」。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <StackPanel Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="搬的过程"/>
                    <WrapPanel Margin="0,12,0,0">
                      <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,8"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="1" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="关闭软件" FontSize="13" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="7,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                      <TextBlock Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#8E8E93" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,8,8"/>
                      <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,8"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="2" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="复制到目标盘" FontSize="13" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="7,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                      <TextBlock Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#8E8E93" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,8,8"/>
                      <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,8"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="3" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="核对" FontSize="13" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="7,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                      <TextBlock Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#8E8E93" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,8,8"/>
                      <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,8"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="4" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="原位置换成链接" FontSize="13" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="7,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                      <TextBlock Text="&#xE76C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="10" Foreground="#8E8E93" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="8,0,8,8"/>
                      <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E8F1FC" Margin="0,0,0,8"><StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="5" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#0B5CAD"/><TextBlock Text="删除 C 盘上的原文件夹" FontSize="13" Foreground="#0B5CAD" Margin="7,0,0,0"/></StackPanel></Border>
                    </WrapPanel>
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,4,0,0"><Run>软件照常从原来的位置读写，不用改设置。核对不一致时，不会删除原文件夹。</Run></TextBlock>
                  </StackPanel>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="目标盘"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>默认选空闲最多的本机硬盘，也可以换一块盘或选一个文件夹。网络盘、网盘和 U 盘不行；移动硬盘不会自动选，手动选时会先提醒：拔掉后，搬过去的软件会打不开。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <Border Background="#FFF8EC" BorderBrush="#F5E1BC" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12" Padding="18,16,22,17" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <DockPanel>
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE7BA;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#B25E00" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,3,14,0"/>
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="不要动目标盘上的 CDriveMoved 文件夹"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>删除、改名或移动它，软件就找不到聊天记录。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </Border>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec1" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE8C8;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="重复文件" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="找出内容完全相同的文件，留一份，删其余" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <TextBlock Text="查找" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,22,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="位置和条件"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>选好查找位置、文件类型和大小。系统、软件和开发环境的文件夹会自动跳过。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="怎样算重复"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>默认名字和内容都要相同；选「只看内容」时，名字不同也算。内容都要逐字节相同。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="快速和完整比对"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>「快速」对大文件只抽样比对，删除前再逐字节核对；「完整比对」每个文件都读完。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="相似照片"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>找看起来一样的照片，比如不同分辨率或重新压缩过的。相似不等于相同，不会自动勾选，只能放进回收站或归档。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <TextBlock Text="处理" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,40,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="留哪一份"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>默认每组留最新的一份。也可以留最早的、留 C 盘以外的、留某个文件夹里的，或者自己勾选。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="删除、归档或合并"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>默认放进回收站，能恢复。也可以把多余的归档到一个文件夹，或者「合并为一份」：每个位置的文件都还在，只占一份空间。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <Border Background="#EFF8F1" BorderBrush="#CFE9D6" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12" Padding="18,16,22,17" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <DockPanel>
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xEA18;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#248A3D" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,3,14,0"/>
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="C 盘个人文件夹受保护"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>桌面、文档、下载等位置的副本默认不能勾选。每组至少留一份。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </Border>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec2" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE7B8;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="省空间（不删文件）" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="压缩，或换个位置放，文件都还在" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:280:12:12:3" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="系统压缩"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>压缩 Windows 系统文件，通常省 2 到 4 GB，不影响使用。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:1">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="页面文件"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>把 pagefile.sys 移到其他盘，重启后生效。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="休眠文件"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>只留快速启动能缩小一半；关闭休眠会删掉它。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:1">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="系统还原点"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>看还原点占了多少，到 Windows 的系统保护里调整。本工具不删还原点。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:1">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="压缩文件夹"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>NTFS 压缩。文件照常使用，只是占得少，适合文档和旧项目。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:1">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="虚拟磁盘"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>压缩 WSL、Docker 的虚拟磁盘；模拟器和虚拟机可以整个搬走。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:1">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="合并重复文件"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>同一块盘上的重复文件只占一份空间，适合不再修改的照片和视频。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="OneDrive 仅在线"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>本地副本改成只在云端，打开时再下载。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:2">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="保留的存储"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>把 Windows 为更新预留的约 7 GB 还给你，随时能恢复。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:2">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="组件存储分析"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>让 Windows 算一下 WinSxS 能回收多少，再决定要不要清理。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:2">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="蓝屏小转储"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>蓝屏时只存 256 KB 的小转储，不再生成几 GB 的文件。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:2">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="临时文件夹"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>把 TEMP 改到其他盘，注销再登录后生效。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource HelpTile}" Tag="lvl:1">
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="WSL 搬到其他盘"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>用 wsl --manage --move 搬走整个发行版，需要 WSL 2.5 以上。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                  </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec3" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE9D9;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="空间地图" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="看清哪些文件夹和文件最占地方" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <TextBlock Text="扫描" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,22,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="扫描一块盘"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>选一块盘点「扫描」，或者点上方的盘卡片。只是查看，不改动任何东西。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="快速扫描"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>NTFS 盘直接读文件表，几十万个文件几秒钟就扫完；读不了时自动改为逐个文件夹扫描。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="盘的概览"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>扫完整块盘后，上方显示已用空间里系统与软件、个人文件、可清理的缓存和其他各占多少。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="值得一看"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>列出缓存、依赖包、构建产物和临时文件这类大文件夹，点一下就过去。只按名字判断，删之前先看看。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <TextBlock Text="浏览" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,40,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="往里看"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>双击文件夹进入下一层。后退、前进可以用鼠标侧键或 Alt+←、Alt+→，路径上的每一层都能点。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="方块图"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>方块越大，占得越多。颜色表示文件夹里是哪一类东西，带斜线的是删了能腾出空间的缓存。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="找文件"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>在 1 MB 以上的文件里，按大小、修改时间、类型和名称找。也可以只看聊天软件里的大文件。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="按类型"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>把全盘文件按视频、图片、文档、压缩包等分成十类，看每类占多少。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="最近改动、和上次比"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>「最近改动」列出这几天新建、改写文件最多的文件夹；「和上次比」找出变大的文件夹，说明多出的空间主要在哪。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="导出"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>把列表导出成 CSV，或把整块盘的情况存成网页报告。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <TextBlock Text="选中和删除" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,40,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="勾选"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>只有点行前面的方框才会勾上，点行的其他地方不会。按住鼠标左键或右键上下拖，一次勾上连着的几行。方框可以在设置里关掉。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="待删清单"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>在不同文件夹里挑好要删的，先放进待删清单，下面会一直显示删完以后大约还剩多少空间。看过再一起删。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="删除"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>可以移到回收站，也可以永久删除，都要先确认。要删的是 git 仓库时会提醒你。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <Border Background="#F5F5F7" BorderBrush="#E5E5EA" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12" Padding="18,16,22,17" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <DockPanel>
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE72E;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#6E6E73" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,3,14,0"/>
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="带小锁的不能在这里删"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>系统文件夹、软件的安装文件夹、C 盘个人文件夹、聊天记录，以及搬家后的数据。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </Border>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="实际占用"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>快速扫描时会注明压缩和只在云端的文件实际占多少，以及硬链接。「空间明细」说明已用空间为什么和文件大小相加对不上。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec4" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE71D;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="软件管理" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="看软件占多少，卸载、清残留、搬到其他盘" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="软件列表"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>按占用空间从大到小列出所有软件，可以搜索，也可以只看装在 C 盘的。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="一次处理几个"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>勾选几个，或按住鼠标左键拖选。卸载时会依次打开每个软件自己的卸载程序。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="卸载和残留"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>卸载后点「检查残留」，找出留下的文件夹，确认后移到回收站。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="搬到其他盘"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>把装在 C 盘的软件整个搬到其他盘，快捷方式、卸载和更新照常可用。带服务或驱动的、微软自己的软件等不适合搬，会写明原因。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="检查新版本"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>用 Windows 自带的 winget 查新版本，在终端里升级。只在你点的时候联网。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <TextBlock Text="启动项和扩展" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,40,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="开机启动、计划任务、右键菜单"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>列出第三方的启动项、计划任务和右键菜单扩展。禁用不删除任何东西，随时可以重新启用。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="残留文件夹"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>找已卸载软件可能留下的文件夹。只是猜测，先打开看看，再移到回收站。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec5" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE95E;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="系统健康" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="硬件状态、开机用时、蓝屏诊断和常见问题修复" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="硬件"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>CPU、内存、硬盘、电池、显卡和 Windows 的状态，按绿、橙、红标出，读不到的写明读不到。打开本工具后会在后台先读好。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="开机用时"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>最近几次开机用了多久，以及拖慢开机的程序。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="蓝屏和崩溃"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>解析蓝屏转储，结合事件日志和硬盘健康给出诊断结论。每条结论下面有「按建议处理」和「需要你自己做的」。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="诊断包"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>把转储、日志和系统信息打成一个 zip，发给能帮你的人。里面有电脑名和装过的软件，只发给信任的人。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="常见问题修复"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>按问题列出常用的修法，都是 Windows 自带的命令，在看得见的窗口里运行。会改动系统的先说明，再由你确认。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Tag="lvl:1">
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="活动监控"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>每 3 秒看一次各程序的 CPU、内存和磁盘写入，找出是谁在拖慢电脑。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <Border Background="#EFF8F1" BorderBrush="#CFE9D6" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12" Padding="18,16,22,17" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <DockPanel>
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xEA18;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#248A3D" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,3,14,0"/>
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="查看什么都不改"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>只有修复按钮会改系统，而且先说明改什么、能不能撤销。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </Border>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec6" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE8AB;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="搬家管理" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="一次搬好几项，看搬走的是否正常" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="可以搬的"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>列出 C 盘上还能搬走的聊天记录、软件和大文件夹。勾选后选好目标盘，点「搬到其他盘」。按住鼠标左键上下拖，一次勾上连着的几行。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="不适合搬的软件"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>单独列出，并写明原因。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <TextBlock Text="已经搬走的" Style="{StaticResource HelpGroup}" Margin="0,40,0,0"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:400:40:16:2" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <DockPanel>
                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="88" VerticalAlignment="Top"><Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#E5F4E9"><TextBlock Text="正常" FontSize="13" Foreground="#1D7A35" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border></Border>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>数据在目标盘上，C 盘只留一个链接。需要时可以搬回 C 盘。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel>
                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="88" VerticalAlignment="Top"><Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#FDEBEC"><TextBlock Text="链接断了" FontSize="13" Foreground="#C0101C" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border></Border>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>目标盘没插着，或者盘符变了。插回去就好，也可以修复链接。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                    <DockPanel>
                      <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Width="88" VerticalAlignment="Top"><Border Style="{StaticResource HelpPill}" Background="#FFF1DB"><TextBlock Text="没搬完" FontSize="13" Foreground="#995700" TextWrapping="Wrap"/></Border></Border>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run>原文件夹还在，目标盘上有一份副本。可以再搬一次，或删掉多余的副本。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec7" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE823;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="自动提醒" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="空间不够时提醒，定期自动清理" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="空间不足提醒"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>C 盘低于你设定的值时，在屏幕右下角提醒，每天最多一次。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="垃圾提醒"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>临时文件和缓存超过你设定的大小时提醒。只统计，不删除。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="定期自动清理"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>每周或每天自动清一次临时文件、缓存和日志。不碰个人文件夹，也不搬家。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="空间变化"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>记下每天 C 盘的剩余空间，画成最近 30 天的柱状图。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                  <Border Background="#EEF5FD" BorderBrush="#D2E3FA" BorderThickness="1" CornerRadius="12" Padding="18,16,22,17" Margin="0,26,0,0">
                    <DockPanel>
                      <TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="&#xE946;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="16" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Top" Margin="0,3,14,0"/>
                      <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="默认都关着"/>
                        <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" MaxWidth="Infinity"><Run>打开后会把本工具复制一份到 C:\Program Files\ClearC，由 Windows 的任务计划程序从那里按时运行；两个都关掉后这一份会删掉。</Run></TextBlock>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </DockPanel>
                  </Border>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec8" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE81C;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="操作日志" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="每一次改动都记下来" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="记什么"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>每次删除、搬家、合并、压缩、卸载和系统设置的改动：时间、做了什么、对哪个文件夹、结果如何。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="查找"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>按类别、时间和关键字查找。日志是普通的文本文件，每月一个。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="保存多久"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>默认半年，可以改。超过保存时间的记录会自动删除。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
              <Border x:Name="HelpSec9" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
                <StackPanel>
                  <DockPanel>
                    <Border DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource HelpIcon}"><TextBlock Text="&#xE713;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="20" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/></Border>
                    <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <TextBlock Text="设置" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}" HorizontalAlignment="Left"/>
                      <TextBlock Text="外观、语言和界面上显示什么" Style="{StaticResource HelpSum}"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,24,0,6"/>
                  <Grid Tag="cols:330:44:26:3" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="使用模式"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>决定界面上有多少功能。随时可以换，不会丢任何设置和记录。</Run></TextBlock>
                      <DockPanel Margin="0,10,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="20" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#8E8E93"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">普通用户</Run><Run>：清理 C 盘、省空间、空间地图、软件管理、系统健康和帮助。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                      <DockPanel Margin="0,7,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="20" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#8E8E93"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">工程师</Run><Run>：再加上重复文件、搬家管理、自动提醒、操作日志，以及各页的进阶功能。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                      <DockPanel Margin="0,7,0,0"><TextBlock DockPanel.Dock="Left" Text="•" Width="20" Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="2,0,0,0" Foreground="#8E8E93"/><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0"><Run FontWeight="SemiBold" Foreground="#1D1D1F">开发者和 IT</Run><Run>：全部功能。</Run></TextBlock></DockPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="外观和语言"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>浅色、深色或跟随系统；中文或 English。更改后本工具会重新打开。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="界面上显示什么"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>用不上的页面、按钮和说明都可以关掉，随时能恢复。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="扫描和查重"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>快速扫描直接读文件表；查重复文件时可以让着其他程序，不拖慢正在用的软件。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="本工具改过的"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>本工具做过、现在还在生效的改动（系统压缩、页面文件、休眠、搬走的文件夹、禁用的启动项……），每一项写着怎么改回去。也可以打开「改系统设置前先建一个还原点」。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="清理列表"/>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}"><Run>删除时先放进回收站，以及添加要清理或要排除的文件夹。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Grid>
                </StackPanel>
              </Border>
            </StackPanel>
            <Border x:Name="HelpPaneFaq" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,20" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="&#xE897;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="19" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,1,12,0"/><TextBlock Text="常见问题" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}"/></StackPanel>
                <StackPanel x:Name="HelpFaq" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}" BorderThickness="0">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="为什么有些功能找不到？"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>可能是使用模式的缘故。到「设置」里换成工程师或开发者和 IT 模式；在「界面上显示什么」里关掉的，也在那里打开。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="C 盘这几天少了很多空间，去哪了？"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>用「空间地图」扫描 C 盘，看「和上次比」和「最近改动」，就知道多出的空间主要在哪。想知道是哪个程序在写，开一会儿「系统健康」的活动监控。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="蓝屏了怎么办？"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>打开「系统健康」的「蓝屏和崩溃」，先看诊断结论，点「按建议处理」，再照「需要你自己做的」逐条做。要找人帮忙，就导出诊断包。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="为什么要管理员权限？"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>清理系统临时文件、Windows 更新缓存这些位置需要管理员权限。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="做到一半能取消吗？"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>可以，会停在安全的地方，已经做完的不会撤销。搬家时如果还在复制，C 盘上的原文件夹不动，下次接着复制。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="执行时能关窗口吗？"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>做完前请不要关窗口。想停下就点「取消」；点「在后台继续」可以收起进度。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="在哪看详细过程？"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>删除和搬家的记录在「操作日志」里，技术细节在左下角的「运行记录」里。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="释放的空间比预计少？"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>放进回收站的文件，要清空回收站后才释放空间；被其他程序占用的文件会跳过。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="扫描的合计为什么和已用空间对不上？"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>硬链接会被重复计算，压缩和只在云端的文件实际占得少，文件表这类系统数据也占空间。快速扫描后，在空间地图点「空间明细」可以看到每一部分。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="WinSxS 很大，能删吗？"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>不能手动删。里面很多文件是硬链接，实际占的比看上去小。要回收空间，用清理页的「WinSxS 组件清理」。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="为什么不清 Prefetch，也没有内存加速？"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>Prefetch 让常用软件启动得更快，一共只有几十 MB，删了反而变慢。空闲内存被 Windows 用来缓存文件，强行清空只会更慢。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="为什么没有注册表清理？"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>多余的注册表项不占空间，也不影响速度；清错了反而可能让软件打不开。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                  <Expander Style="{StaticResource HelpQ}">
                    <Expander.Header><TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="怎么知道有没有新版本？"/></Expander.Header>
                    <StackPanel>
                      <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Run>在帮助的「反馈和新版本」里点「检查新版本」。下载新的 exe 换掉旧的即可，设置和记录都会保留。</Run></TextBlock>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </Expander>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>
            <Border x:Name="FeedbackCard" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="36,30,36,36" Visibility="Collapsed">
              <StackPanel>
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal"><TextBlock Text="&#xE8BD;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="19" Foreground="#0071E3" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="0,1,12,0"/><TextBlock Text="反馈和新版本" Style="{StaticResource HelpHead}"/></StackPanel>
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Margin="0,12,0,0" Text="遇到问题或有建议，欢迎在 GitHub 上提交。"/>
                <Border Background="#F5F5F7" CornerRadius="12" Padding="20,16" Margin="0,18,0,0">
                  <DockPanel>
                    <StackPanel DockPanel.Dock="Right" Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <Button x:Name="BtnIssue" Content="提交问题" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Padding="14,7" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                      <Button x:Name="BtnGitHub" Content="打开主页" Padding="14,7"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                      <Border Width="40" Height="40" CornerRadius="20" Background="#E8F0FE">
                        <TextBlock Text="&#xE943;" FontFamily="{StaticResource Icons}" FontSize="18" Foreground="#0071E3" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                      </Border>
                      <StackPanel Margin="14,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                        <TextBlock Text="GitHub 项目主页" Style="{StaticResource Caption}"/>
                        <TextBlock x:Name="GitHubUrl" Text="github.com/Xuanqiyun/ClearC" FontSize="16" FontWeight="SemiBold" Margin="0,1,0,0" TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Ideal"/>
                      </StackPanel>
                    </StackPanel>
                  </DockPanel>
                </Border>
                <StackPanel x:Name="FbCopyDiag" Margin="0,24,0,0">
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="附上诊断信息"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Text="提交问题时附上截图和诊断信息，能更快找到原因。诊断信息里有文件夹路径，贴出去之前可以先看一下。"/>
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <Button x:Name="BtnCopyDiag" Content="复制诊断信息" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
                    <Button x:Name="BtnOpenLog" Content="打开运行记录文件"/>
                    <TextBlock x:Name="CopyHint" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Foreground="#1D7A35" Margin="14,0,0,0"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel x:Name="FbSelfTest" Margin="0,24,0,0">
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,0,0,24"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="检查扫描功能"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Text="在这台电脑上核对快速扫描是否准确，大约要一两分钟，只读不改。结果会复制下来，可以贴到问题里。"/>
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <Button x:Name="BtnSelfTest" Content="检查扫描功能"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel x:Name="FbCheckUpdate" Margin="0,24,0,0">
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,0,0,24"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="检查新版本"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Text="只在你点的时候连一次 GitHub。"/>
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <Button x:Name="BtnCheckUpdate" Content="检查新版本"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
                <StackPanel x:Name="FbCopyHash" Margin="0,24,0,0">
                  <Border Height="1" Background="#EDEDF0" Margin="0,0,0,24"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpLead}" Text="核对这个文件"/>
                  <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HelpBody}" Text="本工具没有代码签名。把下面这串 SHA256 和 GitHub 发布页上写的对比，一样就说明你下载的 exe 没被改过。"/>
                  <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,14,0,0">
                    <Button x:Name="BtnCopyHash" Content="复制 SHA256"/>
                    <TextBlock x:Name="SelfHash" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" FontFamily="Consolas" VerticalAlignment="Center" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="14,0,0,0"/>
                  </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
              </StackPanel>
            </Border>
            <DockPanel x:Name="HelpPager" Margin="4,14,4,0" LastChildFill="False">
              <Button x:Name="BtnHelpNext" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" FontSize="13"/>
              <Button x:Name="BtnHelpPrev" DockPanel.Dock="Left" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" FontSize="13"/>
            </DockPanel>
          </StackPanel>
        </ScrollViewer>
      </Grid>
    </Grid>

    <!-- ==================== 底部：进度条（有操作时出现） ==================== -->
    <Border Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="1" x:Name="OpPanel" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Padding="16,11,16,12" Margin="30,0,30,14" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <StackPanel>
        <DockPanel>
          <Button x:Name="OpCancel" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="取消" Margin="14,0,0,0" Visibility="Collapsed"
                  ToolTip="停在安全的地方，已经做完的不会撤销"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="OpTime" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Foreground="#6E6E73" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="OpTitle" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
        </DockPanel>
        <ProgressBar x:Name="OpBar" Height="6" Margin="0,8,0,7" Minimum="0" Maximum="100"/>
        <DockPanel>
          <TextBlock x:Name="OpSubTime" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Foreground="#6E6E73" FontSize="12" Margin="12,0,0,0"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="OpDetail" Foreground="#6E6E73" FontSize="12" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis"/>
        </DockPanel>
        <ProgressBar x:Name="OpSubBar" Height="4" Margin="0,6,0,0" Minimum="0" Maximum="100" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
      </StackPanel>
    </Border>

    <!-- ==================== 运行记录（默认收起） ==================== -->
    <Border Grid.Column="1" Grid.Row="2" x:Name="LogPanel" Style="{StaticResource Card}" Height="170" Margin="30,0,30,16" Padding="14,10,6,8" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <DockPanel>
        <DockPanel DockPanel.Dock="Top" Margin="2,0,8,4">
          <Button x:Name="BtnLogHide" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Style="{StaticResource LinkButton}" Content="收起"/>
          <TextBlock Text="运行记录" Style="{StaticResource SectionTitle}"/>
        </DockPanel>
        <TextBox x:Name="Log" Style="{StaticResource LogBox}" IsReadOnly="True" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" TextWrapping="NoWrap"
                 HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" FontFamily="Cascadia Mono, Consolas, Microsoft YaHei UI" FontSize="12"/>
      </DockPanel>
    </Border>

    <!-- ==================== 进度卡片：执行时盖在窗口中间；做完后留下结果，点「完成」才消失 ==================== -->
    <Border x:Name="Overlay" Grid.ColumnSpan="2" Grid.RowSpan="3" Background="#38000000" Visibility="Collapsed">
      <Border Background="White" CornerRadius="14" Width="640" HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Padding="28,24,28,22">
        <Border.Effect><DropShadowEffect BlurRadius="40" ShadowDepth="8" Direction="270" Opacity="0.22"/></Border.Effect>
        <StackPanel>
          <DockPanel>
            <TextBlock x:Name="OvTime" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Foreground="#6E6E73" VerticalAlignment="Center" Margin="16,0,0,0"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="OvTitle" FontSize="17" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" TextOptions.TextFormattingMode="Ideal"/>
          </DockPanel>
          <ProgressBar x:Name="OvBar" Height="6" Margin="0,14,0,18" Minimum="0" Maximum="100"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="OvStep" FontSize="15" FontWeight="SemiBold" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="OvWhat" Foreground="#6E6E73" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,5,0,12"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="OvChecklist" Margin="2,0,0,8" LineHeight="24" FontSize="13.5"/>
          <TextBlock x:Name="OvDetail" Foreground="#6E6E73" FontSize="12.5" TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
          <ProgressBar x:Name="OvSubBar" Height="4" Margin="0,8,0,0" Minimum="0" Maximum="100" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
          <StackPanel x:Name="OvPlanBox" Margin="0,18,0,0" Visibility="Collapsed">
            <TextBlock Text="全部项目" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" Margin="2,0,0,6"/>
            <Border CornerRadius="9" Padding="14,8" Background="#F5F5F7">
              <ScrollViewer x:Name="OvPlanScroll" MaxHeight="190" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto">
                <TextBlock x:Name="OvPlan" LineHeight="23"/>
              </ScrollViewer>
            </Border>
          </StackPanel>
          <DockPanel Margin="0,20,0,0">
            <Button x:Name="OvClose" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="完成" Style="{StaticResource Primary}" Padding="26,7" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
            <Button x:Name="OvHide" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="在后台继续" Padding="14,7" Margin="0,0,8,0"/>
            <Button x:Name="OvCancel" DockPanel.Dock="Right" Content="取消" Padding="14,7" Margin="0,0,8,0" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
            <TextBlock x:Name="OvNote" Style="{StaticResource Caption}" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,14,0"/>
          </DockPanel>
        </StackPanel>
      </Border>
    </Border>

    <!-- 弹出对话框时把主窗口压暗 -->
    <Border x:Name="Dim" Grid.ColumnSpan="2" Grid.RowSpan="3" Background="#33000000" Visibility="Collapsed"/>
  </Grid>
</Window>
"@

# 对话框（代替系统消息框）：圆角白卡片，主窗口同时压暗
